#. Archive name for talk group castle_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第1天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 1 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1"
msgid "我们到了！这里就是辉针城！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ya estamos aquí en el Castillo Shining Needle!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1"
msgid "好高的地方啊，我都有点怕了。"
msgstr ""
"Está tan alto que incluso estoy empezando a "
"sentirme un poco asustado."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1"
msgid ""
"总感觉很安静呢，房子里也没有僵尸，和下面真不一样。"
msgstr ""
"¿Soy yo o hay un silencio absoluto aquí? Tampoco "
"hay zombis en las habitaciones, a diferencia de "
"allá abajo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1"
msgid "是吗？"
msgstr "¿En serio?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1"
msgid "嘿，等等！刚说完，就有僵尸攻过来了！"
msgstr ""
"¡No, espera! ¡Los zombis empezaron a atacar en "
"cuanto dije eso!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_1_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第1天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 1 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_over"
msgid "这是木制投掷器！"
msgstr "¡Este es el Soltador de Madera!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_over"
msgid ""
"它能投出木球，木球能从斜坡上滚下去，打击下方的僵"
"尸！"
msgstr ""
"¡Deja caer bolas de madera que pueden rodar por la "
"inclinación y golpear a los zombis que están "
"debajo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_over"
msgid "感受物理学的力量吧！"
msgstr "¡Contempla el poder de la física!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_1_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第1天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 1 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "清理完毕，现在已经安全了。"
msgstr "Ese es el último de ellos. Ahora es seguro."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "说起来，我们此行的目的是找到针妙丸吧？"
msgstr ""
"Dicho esto, ¿No vinimos aquí con el propósito de "
"encontrar a Shinmyoumaru?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "不知道。"
msgstr "No sé"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "从一开始我就有点在意，这些瓶瓶罐罐是什么？"
msgstr ""
"Tenía pensado mencionarlo, pero... ¿Qué son "
"exactamente estas botellas? ¿Frascos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "可能是用来装空气用的！"
msgstr "¡Tal vez sirvan para almacenar aire!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "……行。"
msgstr "...Seeeeeguramente..."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid ""
"说起来，这座城里真的很安静，一个活着的人都没见到"
"过。"
msgstr ""
"Hablando de eso, este castillo está realmente "
"tranquilo. No hemos visto a nadie por aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "而且啊，还有——"
msgstr "Además-"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "看招！"
msgstr "¡Toma esto!"

#. Speaker Name for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "character.name"
msgid "？？？"
msgstr "¿¿¿???"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "哇啊！搞、搞什么啊！"
msgstr "¡¿Q-qué demonios?!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "你们这群看起来很闲的家伙是谁啊？"
msgstr ""
"Ustedes se ven demasiado relajados para estar "
"aquí. ¿Quiénes son?"

#. Description for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（正邪出场）"
msgstr "(Seija aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "你、你是——"
msgstr "T-tu eres..."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（……戴夫完全被这家伙踩在脚下了。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(...Espero que el suelo no sea "
"demasiado incómodo, Dave).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "你是——鬼人正邪吧？"
msgstr "¿Tu eres... Seija Kijin, no es así?"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "哇！居然直呼我的名字，你好大的胆子啊。"
msgstr ""
"¡Guau! ¿Usar mi nombre completo ahora? ¡Que "
"atrevido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid ""
"你们这些家伙是来干什么的？这里可没有人类居住吧？"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué significa esto? ¿Qué intentas hacer aquí? "
"Aquí no viven humanos, ¿sabes?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "就、就是针妙丸啊，针妙丸。"
msgstr "B-bueno, estamos aquí por Shinmyoumaru."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "……针妙丸？"
msgstr "...¿Shinmyoumaru?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "我们找到了一封针妙丸写下的求助信，所以就——"
msgstr ""
"Encontramos una carta de ella pidiendo ayuda, así "
"que..."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "那家伙还写了那东西吗？真是胆小鬼呢。"
msgstr ""
"¿Ella escribió una carta como esa? Que gallina."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid ""
"不过我可以告诉你们，这里绝对没你们的份。那家伙，我"
"自己一个人来就够了，用不着你们。"
msgstr ""
"Pero te diré esto, no tienes por qué estar aquí. "
"Puedo encargarme de Shinmyoumaru yo misma. No te "
"metas en mi camino."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "哎呀，我干嘛要跟一介人类说这么多呢？"
msgstr ""
"Jeje, solo para que lo sepas, no suelo hablar con "
"simples cosas como tú."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "再见，废物们，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
msgstr "¡Hasta nunca más, basura! ¡Jajajajajaja!"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "真的，如同想象中的一般，是个怪人。"
msgstr ""
"Ella es tan mala como un monstruo, tal como "
"imaginaba."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "我还没死呢……"
msgstr "Sigo vivo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group castle_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_1_map"
msgid "哇啊！"
msgstr "¡AAAAH!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第2天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 2 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2"
msgid "……嗯？这个凋灵骷髅是？"
msgstr ""
"...¿Eh? ¿Qué lleva puesto ese Esqueleto Wither?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2"
msgid ""
"头上戴着个金制头冠，手里拿着法杖。是干什么的呢？"
msgstr ""
"Lleva una corona dorada y sostiene una varita "
"mágica ¿Qué hará con eso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2"
msgid "我也不知道啊，不过我有一种预感！"
msgstr ""
"¡No me preguntes! Pero mi sentido aldeanistico me "
"dice que..."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2"
msgid "你会用到荧石的，邻居！"
msgstr ""
"¡Que deberías llevar Piedra Luminosa, Vecino!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_2_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第2天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 2 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_over"
msgid "这是尖刺方块！"
msgstr "¡Estos son los Bloques de Picos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_over"
msgid "它能对走在它上面的怪物造成伤害！"
msgstr "¡Esto daña a los monstruos que los pisen!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_over"
msgid "还能破坏敌人的车辆！"
msgstr "¡Además, destruye los vehículos enemigos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_over"
msgid "让战场上洒满钉子吧！"
msgstr "¡Llena todo el campo con baches!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_2_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第2天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 2 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "这么多瓶瓶罐罐，到底怎么回事？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Qué PASA con todos estos frascos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "……嗯？好像有动静？有人在敲玻璃？"
msgstr ""
"...¿Hm? ¿Tú escuchaste algo? ¿Es como si alguien "
"golpeara el cristal?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "这里！这里！过来！过来！"
msgstr "¡Aquí! ¡Estoy aquí! ¡Vengan aquí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "！是瓶子里的小人族！"
msgstr "¡! ¡Hay un Inchling en este frasco!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "呼——啊~终于从这该死的瓶子里出来了！"
msgstr ""
"Puf... Finalmente he salido de ese maldito frasco."

#. Description for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（史蒂夫打开了瓶子）"
msgstr "(Steve abre el frasco)"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "感谢你们来救我，请问你们是？"
msgstr ""
"Gracias por sálvame. ¿Puedo preguntar quienes son?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "我是坑爹村民！这位是我的邻居！"
msgstr "¡Yo soy Aldeano Loco! ¡Este es mi vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid ""
"我们看到了你从城中扔下的信，所以才来到这里查看情"
"况。"
msgstr ""
"Hemos visto una carta que había caído desde el "
"castillo, entonces fuimos aquí para comprobarlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "喔，那封信居然真的有人看到了！谢天谢地！"
msgstr ""
"Oh, ¡Gracias al cielo, alguien si leyó la carta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid ""
"我是少名针妙丸，辉针城的城主，也是小人族的公主。"
msgstr ""
"Me presento, soy Shinmyoumaru Sukuna. Dama del "
"Castillo Shining Needle, y la princesa de los "
"inchlings."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid ""
"原来您就是城主啊。听您在信中说，这里被黑色骷髅入侵"
"了？"
msgstr ""
"Oh, entonces tu eres la dueña de este castillo. De "
"acuerdo a la carta, ¿Esos esqueletos negros "
"invadieron este lugar?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid ""
"是的。一年前，辉针城突然遭到了这些黑色骷髅的入侵。"
msgstr ""
"Sí. Hace un año, esos esqueletos negros de repente "
"invadieron todo el castillo."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "我们不知道它们是从哪儿来的，只能不停抵抗。"
msgstr ""
"No sabemos de dónde vinieron, pero no tuvimos otra "
"opción que luchar."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "然后我们就败下阵来，最终被它们俘虏了。"
msgstr ""
"La batalla no estuvo a nuestro favor, y "
"últimamente, fuimos capturados."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid ""
"它们把我和我的同胞们装进了这些瓶子里。我好不容易逃"
"了出去，结果却还是在这里中了它们的陷阱。"
msgstr ""
"Ellos encerraron a mi gente en esos frascos. De "
"alguna manera logré escapar, pero caí en una de "
"sus trampas aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid ""
"所以，我想请求你们，救救我的其他同胞们，可以吗？"
msgstr ""
"Entonces, me gustaría pedirte que por favor salves "
"a los demás. ¿Puedes?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group castle_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_2_map"
msgid "当然了，我们就是为此而来的。"
msgstr ""
"¡Por supuesto! ¡Esa es la razón principal por la "
"cual fuimos a este lugar!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第3天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 3 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid "啊，那些戴金冠的骷髅！一定要小心！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ah! ¡Tengan mucho cuidado con esos esqueletos que "
"llevan coronas doradas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid ""
"它们能控制人的神智！我们好多场败仗都是拜这些家伙所"
"赐！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ellos son capaces de controlar mentes! ¡Son ellos "
"la razón por la que sufrimos pérdida tras pérdida!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid "不过，荧石的光能够防止周围的器械被它们控制。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, la luz de la Piedra Luminosa puede impedir "
"que se puedan controlar los artilugios."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid "诶，有这种事？荧石是什么？"
msgstr ""
"¿Hm? ¿Eso se puede? ¿Qué es esa Piedra Luminosa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid "就是一种发光的石头。"
msgstr "Es un tipo de roca que emite luz."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid "啊，原来如此！"
msgstr "Oh ¡Ya veo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid "早知道我就在城里多放点灯笼了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Si lo hubiera sabido antes, habría colocado más "
"linternas alrededor del castillo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3"
msgid "这俩不一样吧……"
msgstr "No creo que sean lo mismo..."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_3_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第3天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 3 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_over"
msgid "这个是石制投掷器！它能弹射出微小的石子！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Soltador de Piedra! ¡Esto suelta "
"pequeños rockys!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_over"
msgid ""
"不过，有时候它也能射出能击退怪物并且分裂的巨石！"
msgstr ""
"¡Sin embargo, a veces suelta un canto rodado que "
"puede retroceder los enemigos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_over"
msgid "在洞穴中，你最好当心脚下的踏板！"
msgstr ""
"¡Siempre ten cuidado con las placas de presión en "
"una cueva!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_3_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第3天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 3 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"你们真的好厉害！那些黑骷髅在你们的器械面前简直就是"
"溃不成军！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ustedes son asombrosos! ¡Acabaron con esos "
"esqueletos negros como si fueran papel!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "当然，谁让我是坑爹村民呢！"
msgstr "¡No por nada me llama Aldeano Loco!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（谁问你了……）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¿Quién te preguntó...?)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "你的同胞还在更远的地方吗？"
msgstr "¿Tu gente se mantiene aún más alejada?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"是的，我离开那里之后其实还跑了挺远的……都快累死了。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, actualmente corrí una gran distancia para "
"llegar hacia aquí... Solo de pensarlo me pone "
"cansada."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（……还真能跑。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(...Vaya que eres corredora)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "……其实我稍微有些顾虑。"
msgstr ""
"...Sin embargo, hay una cosa que me preocupa."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"在我们被抓进去之前，同胞们，似乎对我有些——怎么说"
"呢。"
msgstr ""
"Antes de que nos capturarán, los demás parecían... "
"Bueno..."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "他们好像不相信我了。"
msgstr "No creo que ellos confíen en mí."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "怎么说？"
msgstr "¿Qué quieres decir?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"好几年前，我因为被天邪鬼灌输了虚假的历史，导致了一"
"场范围浩大的混乱。"
msgstr ""
"Hace algunos años, una Amanojaku me contó una "
"falsa historia, y yo cause un problema masivo en "
"Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"我搞出了乱子，最后也必须为这件事负责。从那之后，小"
"人族的地位就有些——下降。"
msgstr ""
"Fue mi desastre, así que la responsabilidad "
"también fue mía. Desde entonces, el estatus de los "
"Inchlings ha... disminuido un poco."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"大家常常有时抬不起头。实际上，我确实也没为大家做出"
"过什么贡献……"
msgstr ""
"A menudo, todos me miran con desprecio. Lo cual es "
"cierto, no he aportado mucho mi gente..."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "别这么想，你还是在乎你的子民们的，对吧？"
msgstr ""
"No pienses así. Todavía te preocupas por ellos, "
"¿Verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"你为了他们抵御外敌，还写下那封信请求帮忙，最后也没"
"有放弃他们。"
msgstr ""
"Tu peleaste contra los invasores por su bien, "
"hasta escribiste esa carta pidiendo ayuda. Tu no "
"deberías rendirte."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "我想，他们应该也会理解您的。"
msgstr ""
"Estoy seguro que ellos se darán cuenta de ello."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "嗯……"
msgstr "Hmm..."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"话说您刚才说天邪鬼？我们之前还在这座城里见过她。"
msgstr ""
"¿Tu dijiste sobre una Amanojaku? Porque la vimos "
"en el castillo antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "还狠狠地踩了我的背！"
msgstr "¡Incluso me pisó la espalda sin piedad!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "……那真是抱歉了。"
msgstr "...Lo siento por eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid ""
"其实，在那次事件之后，我和那位天邪鬼反而成为了朋"
"友。"
msgstr ""
"Esa Amanojaku y yo nos volvimos amigas después de "
"ese incidente."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group castle_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_3_map"
msgid "她来，其实应该是来救我的。"
msgstr ""
"Con ese hecho de que ella esté aquí, yo creo, que "
"ella sí quiere rescatarme."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第4天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 4 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4"
msgid "史蒂夫，这里出现了相当有危险的敌人。"
msgstr ""
"Hay un enemigo muy peligroso acechando aquí, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4"
msgid ""
"看到那些拿着金斧子的骷髅了嘛？他们会在死掉的时候爆"
"炸！"
msgstr ""
"¿Ves esos esqueletos sosteniendo un hacha de oro? "
"¡Ellos EXPLOTAN al morir!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4"
msgid "就像身上绑着炸弹一样！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es como si tuvieran una bomba atada en ellos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4"
msgid "一定、千万、绝对、必须要注意！"
msgstr ""
"¡Absolutamente, absolutamente NECESITAS mantener "
"un ojo hacia ellos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4"
msgid "我知道了我知道了……"
msgstr "Sí, sí, ya te escuche..."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_4_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第4天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 4 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_over"
msgid "这个是石护罩！他能和普通的器械重叠放置！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Escudo de Piedra! ¡Puedes colocarlo en "
"cualquier artilugio!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_over"
msgid "它的硬度能够保护它里面的器械不受伤害！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es lo suficiente resistente como para mantener a "
"los artilugios fuera de daños!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_over"
msgid ""
"有个小技巧，如果你拿着铁镐，并且瞄准它的下部，就会"
"挖掉石护罩！"
msgstr ""
"Aquí tienes un consejo: ¡Apunta hacia abajo con el "
"Pico para minar el Escudo de Piedra!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_over"
msgid "如果你瞄准上部，则会挖掉里面的器械！"
msgstr ""
"¡Apunta arriba para extraer el artilugio que hay "
"en el interior!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_over"
msgid "当然，星之碎片也是同理的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Igualmente, funciona de la misma forma que con "
"los Fragmentos Estelares!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_4_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第4天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 4 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "针妙丸，关于这场入侵的原因，你有什么想法吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Tienes alguna idea del motivo detrás de esta "
"invasión, Shinmyoumaru?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "嗯……有。"
msgstr "Bueno... Yo creo que sí sé..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid ""
"这场入侵的怪物全部都是方块吧？我听说幻想乡内地也出"
"现了大量的方块怪物。"
msgstr ""
"¿Todos los monstruos invasores están hechos de "
"cuadrados, no? He oído que también han aparecido "
"muchos en Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid ""
"首次出现这些方块怪物的时间，我听别人说是三年前。"
msgstr ""
"Me dijeron que la primera vez que aparecieron "
"estos monstruos cuadrados fue hace tres años."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "而在这三年前，幻想乡发生了一件奇怪的事情。"
msgstr "En esos tres años, algo sucedió en Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "什么事情？"
msgstr "¿Qué paso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "某个地方<color=red>爆炸</color>了。"
msgstr "Sucedió una <color=red>explosión</color>."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "啊？"
msgstr "¿Huh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid ""
"那时我还在辉针城里，下方突然传来一声巨响，我往外看"
"了一眼，但是并没有看到是哪里。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando estabas dentro del castillo, escuche un "
"sonido fuerte abajo. Cheque afuera, pero no vi de "
"donde venía."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "后来听说，似乎有一处地方发生了爆炸。"
msgstr ""
"Oí después que aparentemente en algún lugar "
"explotó."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid ""
"那件事跟我没什么关系，所以我也就只了解了这些了。"
msgstr ""
"Pero no tuvo nada que ver conmigo así que esto es "
"todo lo que puedo decirte al respecto."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "没想到，结果却会影响到我们辉针城……"
msgstr ""
"Y pensar de que acabaría afectando a nuestro "
"castillo de esta manera..."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（爆炸，是吗？）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¿Una explosión, huh?)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_4_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（会和这场异变有关系吗？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿Cómo eso podría relacionarse con el "
"incidente?)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_5_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第5天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 5 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_over"
msgid "钻石尖刺回来了！"
msgstr "¡Los Picos Diamantados han regresado! "

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_over"
msgid "它能够放置在尖刺方块上把它升级！"
msgstr ""
"¡Colócalo encima de los Bloques de Picos para "
"mejorarlos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_over"
msgid ""
"升级过后的钻石尖刺耐久更高，并且会连续扎两次！ "
msgstr ""
"¡Una vez mejorado, los Picos Diamantados picarán "
"dos veces y tendrá más durabilidad!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_over"
msgid "欢迎我们的老朋友！"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido devuelta, viejo amigo!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_5_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第5天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 5 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "对了，关于那位天邪鬼，鬼人正邪。"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, sobre esa Amanojaku, Seija Kijin."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid ""
"那家伙在我们眼前出现，而且说要自己一个人解决这座城"
"中的异变。"
msgstr ""
"Ella apareció ante nosotros e incluso afirmó que "
"resolvería el incidente por sí sola."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "还狠狠的踩了我。"
msgstr "¡Ella también me pisó!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid ""
"我们已经好多天都没看见她了，也不知道她去哪儿了。"
msgstr ""
"Hace muchos días que no vemos rastro de ella. Me "
"pregunto dónde estará."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "我挺担心她的……"
msgstr "Me empiezo a preocuparme por ella."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "怎么了？"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "其实我被困的时候见过她。"
msgstr ""
"En realidad la vi una vez cuando estaba atrapada."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "她一眼就看到了我，要把我的瓶子撬开。"
msgstr ""
"Ella me encontró inmediatamente y estaba a punto "
"de abrir el frasco."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid ""
"但是她突然就倒下了，我的瓶子就这样滚到一边去，我也"
"陷入了昏迷，之后的事情就不知道了。"
msgstr ""
"Pero de repente se cayó al suelo. Mi frasco fue "
"empujado hacia algún lado y yo también perdí el "
"conocimiento. No sé qué pasó después."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "可能只是想把瓶子摔碎吧！"
msgstr "¡Tal vez ella trataba de romper el frasco!"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "你能不要说话了么……"
msgstr "Creo que deberías quedarte callado..."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "你还记得那些会控制他人精神的骷髅么？"
msgstr ""
"¿Te acuerdas de esos esqueletos controladores de "
"mentes?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "我怕她被那群家伙精神控制了。"
msgstr "Tengo miedo de que ella esté bajo control. "

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid ""
"以前和它们作战期间，被俘虏的小人们全部都被精神控"
"制，转而攻击我们，无一例外。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando luchamos contra ellos, todos los Inchlings "
"capturados quedaron bajo su hechizo y nos "
"atacaron. Todos y cada uno."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_5_map"
msgid "如果她变成我们的敌人，那就……太糟了。"
msgstr ""
"Si ella se vuelve enemiga de nosotros... No sería "
"un buen momento."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_6
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第6天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 6 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6"
msgid "不知道怎么回事，僵尸的体型受到了影响！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por alguna razón, los zombis cambiaron de tamaño!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6"
msgid "他们突然之间变得非常小了！而且数量非常多！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ahora ellos, inexplicablemente, unos enanitos! "
"¡Habiendo un buen de ellos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6"
msgid "诶，怎么回事？"
msgstr "¿Qué, qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6"
msgid "小僵尸是吗？我来试试解决他们！"
msgstr "¿Zombis pequeños? ¡Déjame dispararles!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6"
msgid "当然，好像也不止是小……"
msgstr ""
"¡De acuerdo, vecino, pero recuerda vigilar las "
"espinillas!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_6_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第6天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 6 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_over"
msgid "这是金苹果！不过它可不是用来回血的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es la Manzana Dorada! ¡Pero que no te "
"engañe, esto no es para recuperar vida!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_over"
msgid ""
"实际上它是一个魅惑果实，能魅惑第一个攻击它的怪物！"
msgstr ""
"¡En realidad, es una fruta encantadora que encanta "
"al primer monstruo que la ataca!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_over"
msgid "然后！这个怪物就会为你作战！"
msgstr ""
"¡Entonces, el monstruo en cuestión ahora luchará "
"por ti!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_over"
msgid "不过，要注意它也是只能在晚上用的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero recuerda, que esta es dormilona, con lo que "
"solo puedes usarla en noche!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_6_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第6天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 6 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_map"
msgid "话说，该回香霖堂一趟了吧！"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, ¡Creo que deberíamos volver hacia "
"Kourindou por un rato!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_map"
msgid "我又有东西要卖你了！"
msgstr "¡Tengo más cosas para venderte!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_map"
msgid "所以你为什么要把东西卖我？"
msgstr "¿Por qué me sigues vendiendo cosas?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_map"
msgid "因为只要有了这些东西你才能变强啊！"
msgstr ""
"¡Porque no te volverías tan fuerte sin mis cosas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_map"
msgid "不，我的意思是，你为什么不直接给我……"
msgstr ""
"No, me refiero a que... ¿Por qué no simplemente me "
"lo das directamente...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_map"
msgid "因为只有充钱才能变强啊！"
msgstr ""
"¡Porque así es como funcionan las mejoras! "
"¡GASTANDO dinero!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_6_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（完全听不懂！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡No tengo idea de lo que estás "
"hablando!)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group kourindou_visit_castle
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "访问香霖堂-辉针城"
msgstr "Visita a Kourindou-Castillo"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "难道是乘法吗？3，4，12……也不对啊。"
msgstr "¿Multiplicación? 3, 4, 12... No, eso no es."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "诶，你们回来了啊！"
msgstr "¡Ah, están de vuelta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "进展怎么样了？找到那个小人族公主了吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Cómo les fue? ¿Encontraron a la princesa de los "
"inchlings?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid ""
"已经找到了，现在她很安全，估计不久辉针城就能解放"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Lo hicimos. Ella está segura ahora, y estoy seguro "
"que el Castillo será liberado pronto."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "哇，你们好厉害啊！居然这么快就做到了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Guau, ustedes si que son asombrosos! ¡Eso fue "
"demasiado rápido de lo que esperaba!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "您过奖了。"
msgstr "No es nada."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "不过，朱鹭子，刚才看你在玩什么东西？"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, Tokiko, te vi jugando con algo hace un "
"momento, ¿Qué jugabas?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid ""
"啊，刚才啊，是我在香霖堂里找到的数字谜题哦！我一直"
"在尝试破解它！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ay, acabo de encontrar un acertijo matemático en "
"Kourindou! ¡No he parado de resolverlo desde "
"entonces!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "……这个，不是电话吗？"
msgstr "¿... No es eso un número de teléfono?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "电……话？哦！是可以让你说的话带电嘛？"
msgstr ""
"¿Teléfono...? ¿Qué quieres decir con que el número "
"es de \"teléfono\"?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid ""
"不是。这是个远程通讯工具，不是什么谜题。我来教你怎"
"么用吧。"
msgstr ""
"Un teléfono es un dispositivo para comunicarse a "
"larga distancia. No es un rompecabezas ni nada "
"parecido. Déjame enseñarte a usarlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid ""
"点开这个，然后输入对应我们的数字，再按这个按钮，一"
"会就可以在里面听到电话那头的声音了。"
msgstr ""
"Pulsa aquí y escribe nuestros números. Pulsa aquí "
"y empezarás a escuchar la voz al otro lado del "
"teléfono."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "是吗？我试试……"
msgstr "¿En serio? Déjame intentarlo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "叮铃铃铃……"
msgstr "*Tono de Llamada*"

#. Description for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（朱鹭子离场）"
msgstr "(Tokiko se va)"

#. Speaker Name for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "character.name"
msgid "手机"
msgstr "Teléfono"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "哔。"
msgstr "Beep."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "是史蒂夫吗？"
msgstr "¿Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "喂，这里是史蒂夫，你好！"
msgstr "¡Hola, Steve hablando!"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "真的诶，居然是这么神奇的东西！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es cierto! ¡No puedo creer que exista algo tan "
"maravilloso!"

#. Description for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（朱鹭子回来）"
msgstr "(Tokiko regresa)"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "你们的知识真的很渊博呢！"
msgstr "¡Ustedes dos deben saber demasiado!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "如果想跟我们说话的话，你随时可以用它打过来！"
msgstr ""
"Si alguna vez quieres hablar con nosotros, "
"¡Estamos a solo una llamada de distancia!"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "知道了！"
msgstr "¡Entendido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "啊，对了！"
msgstr "¡Oh, cierto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid ""
"我在这几天里我找到了一个新的器械，还闪闪发着光呢！"
msgstr ""
"Encontré un artilugio nuevo mientras estábamos "
"fuera. ¡Es tan nuevo que brilla!"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "接下来，让你看看吧！"
msgstr "¡Te lo demostraré más tarde!"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "当然，得买！"
msgstr "¡Puede ser tuyo! ¡Por un precio, claro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_visit_castle's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_castle"
msgid "你从来没让我失望过……"
msgstr "Nunca me has decepcionado antes..."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_7
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第7天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 7 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7"
msgid "看！那些是无头骑士！"
msgstr "¡Mira! ¡Esos son los Dullahans!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7"
msgid ""
"那些家伙骑着马，跳过一般的障碍对他们来说不是什么难"
"事！"
msgstr ""
"¡Con sus caballos, saltan a traves de los "
"obstáculos como si fuese un juego infantil!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7"
msgid ""
"而且不知道为什么，他们砍下自己的脑袋还不会死的！"
msgstr ""
"¡También de alguna manera, ni siquiera mueren con "
"la cabeza cortada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7"
msgid "我不知道他们是怎么砍下自己的脑袋的。"
msgstr "No sé cómo se cortaron la cabeza."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7"
msgid "但我知道不能让他们砍下我们的脑袋！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero sí sé que nuestras cabezas no les pertenecen!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_7_boss
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第7天头目"
msgstr "Castillo Día 7 Jefe"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "等等，好像有人过来了？"
msgstr "Espera, ¿Alguien se acerca a nosotros?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "消灭生命……凋零万物……"
msgstr "La vida terminará... Todo se marchitará..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "正邪——！！"
msgstr "¡¡Seija!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "你听得到我吗！正邪！"
msgstr "¿¡Me puedes escuchar!? ¡Seija!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "果然，她被控制了！"
msgstr "¡Lo sabia, ella está controlada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "拜托了，史蒂夫，帮帮她！"
msgstr "¡Por favor, Steve! ¡Tienes que ayudarla!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "你应该有办法解除精神控制的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Tienes que encontrar la manera de liberarla del "
"control mental!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "针妙丸……！"
msgstr "¡Shinmyoumaru...!\""

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（一般这种情况下，只要把控制她的催眠者"
"杀死就可以了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(En la mayoría de las circunstancias, "
"matar al Hipnotizador que la controla debería "
"resolver el problema).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（但是，我没有看到任何的催眠者。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Pero... No veo a ninguno por aquí).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_7_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_boss"
msgid "<color=blue>（可恶，到底在哪儿？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿¡Dónde podrá estar ese maldito "
"Hipnotizador!?)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_7_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第7天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 7 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_over"
msgid "正、正邪！你没事吧！"
msgstr "¡S-Seija! ¿¡Estás bien!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_over"
msgid ""
"刚、刚才她倒下的时候，有个催眠者从天花板上掉下来"
"了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Cu-cuando se desmayó, un Hipnotizador cayó del "
"techo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_over"
msgid ""
"原来如此，它利用了正邪的能力反转了自己的重力，让自"
"己处在我们的视线盲区内！"
msgstr ""
"Ahora lo entiendo. ¡Usó la habilidad de Seija para "
"invertir su propia gravedad y se escondió justo en "
"nuestro punto ciego!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_over"
msgid "她好像只是昏过去了，应该没事，等她醒吧！"
msgstr ""
"Parece que se acaba de desmayar, debería estar "
"bien. ¡Esperemos a que despierte!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_over"
msgid "另外，这个器械是雷鼓！"
msgstr "¡Por ciento, este es el Tambor del Trueno!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_over"
msgid ""
"这玩意可以让地面震动起来，然后把僵尸击退，顺便把它"
"们送到不同的行！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este pequeñín puede hacer temblar el suelo, "
"levantar a los zombis y enviándolos a diferentes "
"filas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_over"
msgid "当心地震！"
msgstr "¡Cuidado con los terremotos!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_7_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第7天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 7 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "……可恶，我在哪儿？"
msgstr "...Eugh, ¿¡Dónde estoy!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "你醒了啊，正邪。"
msgstr "Estas despierta, Seija."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "针、针妙丸？"
msgstr "¿Sh-Shinmyoumaru?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "看起来她没有大碍，太好了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Genial, no parece que haya sufrido lesiones "
"graves!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "！是你们！"
msgstr "...¡! ¡Ustedes dos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "等等！正邪！"
msgstr "¡Espera! ¡Seija!"

#. Description for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（正邪离场）"
msgstr "(Seija se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Description for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（正邪回来了）"
msgstr "(Seija regresa)"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "你找我这个背叛者有事情？"
msgstr ""
"¿Tiene usted algún asunto con una traidora como yo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid ""
"上次那起异变我为了完成自己的目的，欺骗并利用了你。"
msgstr ""
"Te he mentido y te he usado en ese incidente para "
"cumplir mis propias metas."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid ""
"这次，我甚至还在你们族人处在危难时期时来这里搅局。"
msgstr ""
"Esta vez, incluso vine aquí para perturbar las "
"cosas durante tu mayor crisis."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid ""
"这对你们普通人来说，应该早就是不可原谅的程度了吧？"
msgstr ""
"Para la gente común y corriente como tú, ya hace "
"tiempo que pasé el punto de cruzar la línea, ¿no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid ""
"甚至还被那群怪物控制，然后被你们这些人类打败，可真"
"是耻辱啊。"
msgstr ""
"Incluso caí bajo el control de esos monstruos y "
"terminé perdiendo contra unas basuras humanas. "
"¡Soy una desgracia!"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "正邪，你走吧。"
msgstr "Deberías irte, Seija."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "我不想和你多说什么，小人族还处在危机之中。"
msgstr ""
"No tengo palabras para ti. Los Inchlings aun "
"seguimos en un peligro mortal."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid ""
"我们还有更大的敌人要面对，我不希望有人再来这里干扰"
"我们了。"
msgstr ""
"Tenemos enemigos más fuertes por delante, por lo "
"que deseo que permanezcamos tranquilos a partir de "
"ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "所以，请你给我离开这里。"
msgstr "Por eso, imploro que te vayas."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "凋灵。"
msgstr "Wither"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "那群家伙的老大叫凋灵。"
msgstr ""
"Ese es el líder de todo estos monstruos, lo "
"llaman, El Wither."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "凋灵？"
msgstr "¿Wither?"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid ""
"就是你们一直在打的那些黑骷髅的首领！这都听不懂吗！"
msgstr ""
"¡El que lidera a esos esqueletos negros con los "
"que has estado luchando todo este tiempo! ¿¡Estás "
"sorda!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "好了，赶我走是吧！求之不得！"
msgstr ""
"¿Quiere que me vayas, cierto? ¡Esta bien, me iré!"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "针妙丸，这样真的好吗？"
msgstr "¿Ella estará bien, Shinmyoumaru?"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "对于她来说，这样就是最好的办法了。"
msgstr ""
"Para ella, esto es lo mejor que podemos hacer."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "天邪鬼，她们的性格就是这样的。"
msgstr ""
"Así es simplemente como se comportan son los "
"Amanojaku."

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group castle_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_7_map"
msgid "我明白了。"
msgstr "..Entiendo."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_8
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第8天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 8 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid ""
"正邪说那些黑骷髅的首领叫做凋灵，你们知道它嘛？"
msgstr ""
"Seija dijo que el líder de los esqueletos negros "
"se llama Wither. ¿Sabes qué es eso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid "是的，凋灵是我们世界的一个极为强大的存在。"
msgstr ""
"Si, el Wither es un ser poderoso de nuestro mundo."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid ""
"它是个三头的死亡巨怪，所到之处房屋瓦解，植被凋零，"
"是个非常可怕的魔物。"
msgstr ""
"Un monstruo de tres cabezas de la muerte, destruye "
"casas y marchita plantas a donde vaya. Un demonio "
"terrorífico de proporciones."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid "原来如此，这些黑骷髅是你们世界的魔物。"
msgstr ""
"Ah, ya veo, entonces estos esqueletos negros son "
"monstruos de tu mundo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid "但为什么，它们会来到我们幻想乡呢？"
msgstr ""
"Pero, entonces, ¿Por qué estarían en Gensokyo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid "这……我就不清楚了。"
msgstr "Eso es... incierto por el momento."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid "说起来，我们已经快要靠近关押同胞的地方了。"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, ya casi llegamos a donde tienen a mi "
"gente."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8"
msgid "再加把劲，我们就能解救族人了！"
msgstr "¡Un poquito más y todos serán salvados!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_8_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第8天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 8 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_over"
msgid "这个是磁暴线圈！"
msgstr "¡Esta es la Bobina Tesla!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_over"
msgid "它能够电击周围的敌人！"
msgstr "¡Esto electrocuta a los enemigos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_over"
msgid "当然，也包括空中的！"
msgstr "¡Incluyendo a enemigos voladores!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_over"
msgid "你确定这是我们世界的东西？"
msgstr "¿Estas seguro que esto es de nuestro mundo?"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_8_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第8天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 8 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "好，族人们被关在这里！"
msgstr ""
"¡Bien, bien, aquí es donde mi gente está atrapada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "戴夫，我们一起把他们救出来！"
msgstr ""
"¡Vamos, debemos ayuda a rescatarlos también, Dave!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（我们小心翼翼地打开每一个罐子，让小人"
"族慢慢的走出来。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Con cuidado, abrimos cada frasco. Los "
"Inchlings lentamente salían).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（小人族们有的因重获自由而欢喜，有的也"
"因为丧失亲人而不停哭泣。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Algunos celebraron su libertad. Otros "
"lloraron por los que perdieron).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（最后，所有的小人族都得到了解救。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Al final, cada Inchling era salvado)."
"</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "同胞们，你们能得救真的是太好了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Me alegro mucho de que todos estén sanos y salvos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（听到针妙丸的话语，小人族们纷纷看向了"
"她。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Al escuchar las palabras de "
"Shinmyoumaru, todos los Inchlings se giraron hacia "
"ella).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（……）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（然而，空气却突然在这时冻结了。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Sin embargo, el aire se torno frio).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "……同胞们？"
msgstr "... ¿Gente?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Speaker Name for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "character.name"
msgid "小人族"
msgstr "Inchling"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "是针妙丸城主啊……"
msgstr "Oh, Dama Shinmyoumaru..."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "怎、怎么了？"
msgstr "¿Qu-qué pasa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "上次托您的福，小人族至今为止都没有办法抬头。"
msgstr ""
"¡Es gracias a ti que aún actualmente seamos "
"menospreciados!"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"这次，我们又被这些可怕的怪物杀了不知道多少人。"
msgstr ""
"Y ahora hemos perdido quién sabe cuántos de "
"nosotros a manos de estos abominables monstruos."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "我们现在境地如此，您……真的有做到什么吗。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, incluso en nuestra situación actual, "
"¿¡Ha hecho usted... Realmente algo, Dama "
"Shinmyoumaru!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "……！"
msgstr "...¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "我们好累……好痛……"
msgstr "Nosotros estamos agotados ... lastimados..."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "妈妈！妈妈！呜呜呜！我的妈妈！不要死！"
msgstr "¡Mamá! Mamá! ¡Waaah! ¡Mamá! ¡No mueras...!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "别再和那可恶的天邪鬼在一块了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Deja de tener a esa TONTA Amanojaku en tu lado!"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "该死的，这些怪物一定是你招来的吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Maldita sea! ¡Estos monstruos deben ser obra tuya!"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（怎、怎么回事！怎么会变成这样！）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡D-De ninguna manera! ¡Nunca "
"pensaría...!)</color>\""

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "对不起。我……"
msgstr "Lo siento, yo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid "针妙丸！你要去哪儿？！"
msgstr "¿¡Que vas a hacer!? ¡Shinmyoumaru!"

#. Description for talk sentence 24 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（针妙丸离场）"
msgstr "(Shinmyoumaru se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（小人族继续喧哗着。只是从自由的欢呼，"
"变成了伤痛的哭嚎，以及质疑的议论。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Los inchlings solo se hicieron más "
"ruidosos. Sin embargo, sus vítores por la libertad "
"se habían convertido en aullidos de tristeza, "
"junto con discusiones sobre la duda).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group castle_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（没有了针妙丸，我们不知所措，最后也只"
"能离开这里。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Sin Shinmyoumaru, no sabíamos qué "
"hacer, así que al final sólo pudimos irnos).</"
"color>"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_9
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第9天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 9 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9"
msgid "针妙丸昨天离开了我们，到现在还没有回来。"
msgstr ""
"Shinmyoumaru nos dejó ayer y todavía no ha "
"regresado."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9"
msgid "我有点担心她……"
msgstr "Me estoy preocupado por ella..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9"
msgid ""
"城里的凋灵骷髅已经被我们清理得差不多了，她不会有危"
"险的，放心吧。"
msgstr ""
"Hemos eliminado a la mayoría de los Esqueletos "
"Wither en el castillo. No te preocupes, no correrá "
"ningún peligro."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9"
msgid "比起关心这些——那些车辆是什么？"
msgstr ""
"Dejando eso de lado, ¿Qué son esos cacharros?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9"
msgid ""
"那些车还驮着一些黄色的棺材，里面好像还有绷带和灵魂"
"沙渗出来。"
msgstr ""
"Parecen llevan ataúdes amarillo. Creo ver vendajes "
"y arena de almas saliendo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9"
msgid ""
"战车，木乃伊，还有灵魂沙吗……凋灵骷髅的科技比我想象"
"的还要高啊。"
msgstr ""
"Un cacharro, momias y arena de alma... La "
"tecnología de los Esqueletos Wither es más "
"avanzada que yo creía."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9"
msgid "总之，注意别被碾了！"
msgstr "¡Lo importante es no dejarse atropellar!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_9_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第9天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 9 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_over"
msgid "啊！这个东西是……巨碗！"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Este es... el Bol Gigante!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_over"
msgid ""
"你可以把星之碎片放进里面进行存储，它也会自己缓慢生"
"成星之碎片！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puedes almacenan Fragmentos Estelares adentro, y "
"lentamente generará más!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_over"
msgid ""
"但是，一旦要取出它里面的星之碎片，就必须要把它砸毁"
"了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Sin embargo, al momento de querer agarrarlas, "
"tendrás que destruir el bol!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_over"
msgid "珍惜你放下的每一个巨碗吧！"
msgstr "¡Atesora cada Bol Gigante que dejes!"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_9_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第9天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 9 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "针妙丸……你回来了？"
msgstr "Shinmyoumaru... ¿Estas de regreso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "是，抱歉让你们担心了。"
msgstr "Sí... Gracias por preocuparte..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "昨天的事情……"
msgstr "Respecto lo de ayer..."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "我果然还是当不好一个领导者。"
msgstr "Lo sé. No soy una buena líder, ¿Verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "对不起，让你们失望了。"
msgstr "Lo siento si te decepcione."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "我不知道该怎么做。"
msgstr "No estoy segura de qué deba hacer."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid ""
"最后我还是没有靠自己的力量拯救辉针城。全都是因为我"
"害怕万宝槌的力量。"
msgstr ""
"Al final, no pude salvar el Castillo solo con mis "
"propias fuerzas. Aunque solo sea porque el poder "
"del Mazo Milagroso me asusta."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "万宝槌？"
msgstr "¿Mazo Milagroso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "就是这个。"
msgstr "Esta es..."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid ""
"它是我们小人族的魔宝，可以实现人的愿望，但也会付出"
"相应的代价。"
msgstr ""
"Es el tesoro maldito de nosotros, los Inchlings, "
"capaz de conceder cualquier deseo, pero exige un "
"precio igual."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "在它们入侵的时候，我本来就应该使用它的。"
msgstr ""
"Debí haberlo usado en el momento que fuimos "
"invadidos. "

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid ""
"可是，上次的混乱也是因它而起，我那时才知道万宝槌可"
"怕的能力。"
msgstr ""
"No obstante, el caos de la última vez también se "
"debió al mazo. Fue entonces cuando me di cuenta "
"del aterrador poder que posee el Mazo Milagroso."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "所以我这次才没有使用它，结果反而……"
msgstr ""
"Esa fue razón para no usarlo esta vez... Pero a "
"final de todo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "不，这不是你的错。"
msgstr "No, esto no es tu culpa."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "别说了，已经无法改变了不是吗。"
msgstr ""
"No hay necesidad. No puedes cambiar lo que ya "
"pasó, ¿verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "针妙丸还有最后一个请求，可以吗？"
msgstr ""
"Shinmyoumaru tiene una última petición. ¿Puedo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "什么？"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "正邪提到，这些黑色骷髅的首领叫做凋灵。"
msgstr ""
"Seija mencionó al líder de los esqueletos negros, "
"el Wither."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "请您帮我把它除掉吧——为了我的同胞们……"
msgstr ""
"Por favor... exterminarlo, por el bien de mi "
"gente..."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group castle_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_9_map"
msgid "我，知道了。"
msgstr "Lo haré."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_note
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "凋灵战书"
msgstr "Desafío del Wither"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_note"
msgid "这个东西是——凋灵骷髅的战书？"
msgstr ""
"¿Esta es una... Declaración de Guerra por los "
"Esqueletos Wither?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_note"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_note"
msgid "是时候了。"
msgstr "Ya era hora."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_note"
msgid ""
"该让那些该死的黑色骷髅为我们小人族的牺牲付出代价"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Ha llegado el momento de que esos malditos "
"esqueletos negros paguen el precio de todo lo que "
"han hecho sobre nosotros, los inchlings."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_note"
msgid "我明白了，交给我吧。"
msgstr "Ya veo. Déjamelo a mí."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_11
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第11天入场"
msgstr "Castillo Día 11 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid ""
"小心点，那个可怕的骷髅怪物——凋灵马上就要来了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Cuidado, porque la aterradora monstruosidad "
"esquelética que es el Wither estará aquí en "
"cualquier momento!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid ""
"它能冲锋，并且以它的威力，很可能一下冲锋就毁掉你一"
"整排的器械！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puede embestí, y con su poder, un solo golpe "
"puede muy bien destruir una fila entera de tus "
"artilugios!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid "……听起来确实难搞。"
msgstr ""
"...Eso suena a un dolor de cabeza con que lidiar."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid "不过，应该有办法能阻止它的。"
msgstr ""
"Pero deberías poder detenerlo de alguna manera."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid ""
"试试用强大的东西挡住它的去路，或者直接在它冲锋前把"
"它击垮！"
msgstr ""
"¡Intenta poner algo resistente para bloquear su "
"camino o simplemente hazlo tambalear antes de que "
"pueda embestí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid ""
"并且，金苹果对凋灵这种亡灵生物来说可能会产生奇效！"
msgstr ""
"¡Además, la Manzana Dorada debería ser mega "
"efectiva contra los muertos vivientes como el "
"Wither!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid "试着骗它吃掉一些金苹果！"
msgstr ""
"¡Intenta engañarlo para que coma algunas manzanas "
"doradas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid "我们小人族就靠你了，史蒂夫……"
msgstr ""
"Nosostros los inchlings contamos contigo, Steve..."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid "遵命。"
msgstr "Entendido."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（辉针城外乌云密布。这些乌云已经笼罩这"
"里太长时间了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Nubes oscuras envuelven este "
"castillo. Su sombra lo ha envuelto durante "
"demasiado tiempo).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（是时候该让它们散去了。）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(Es hora de disépalos).</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group castle_11_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第11天结束"
msgstr "Castillo Día 11 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_over"
msgid "结、结束了吗？"
msgstr "Esto... ¿Esto ya terminó?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_over"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_over"
msgid ""
"看起来是的，凋灵已经支离破碎，骷髅们也已经溃不成军"
"了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Parece que sí! ¡El Wither ha quedado hecho añicos "
"y los esqueletos restantes se han retirado!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_over"
msgid "……谢谢你们。"
msgstr "...Muchas gracias."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_over"
msgid "这下辉针城就彻底摆脱它们的控制了。"
msgstr ""
"Ahora el Castillo está libre del control de ellos."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_over"
msgid "谢谢你们为我和我的子民们所做的一切。"
msgstr ""
"Gracias por todo lo que han hecho los dos por mi "
"gente."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_over"
msgid "我永远不会忘记你们的这份恩情的。"
msgstr ""
"No olvidaré lo que han hecho por toda la eternidad."

#. Archive name for talk group castle_11_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "辉针城第11天地图"
msgstr "Castillo Día 11 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"你们帮我解决了这些怪物，解救了我的子……我们小人族，"
"真的不胜感激。"
msgstr ""
"No sé como agradeceros... Los dos exterminaron a "
"todos esos monstruos y salvaron a mi gent-... "
"Inchlings."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "……我不清楚。"
msgstr "... No estoy segura"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"我身为小人族的公主，却一次次地没能保护好我的人民。"
msgstr ""
"Como Princesa de los Inchlings, les he fallado una "
"y otra vez por protegerlos..."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "我真的不算什么合格的领导者。"
msgstr "Realmente soy una falla como líder."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "别这么说，针妙丸。"
msgstr "No digas eso, Shinmyoumaru."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "还是你写的信才带我们来到这里的。"
msgstr ""
"Nosotros no pudimos haber llegado aquí sin tu "
"carta."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"但是，最后事情还是你们解决的。我根本没派上什么用"
"场。"
msgstr ""
"Pero ustedes fueron quienes pusieron fin a todo. "
"No serví de nada."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "我真的……没脸见他们了。"
msgstr ""
"Realmente... No puedo animarme a darles cara."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "针妙丸……"
msgstr "Shinmyoumaru..."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "为了表示对你们的感谢，我想送你们这个。"
msgstr ""
"Para expresa todo mi agradecimiento hacia ustedes, "
"me gustara darte esto."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"这是正邪逃走时留下的一件道具，是我的万宝槌的仿制"
"品。"
msgstr ""
"Seija dejó esto atrás cuando ella huyó. Es una "
"imitación de mi Mazo Milagroso."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "虽说是仿制品，但也有不可小觑的力量。"
msgstr ""
"Esto podrá ser de imitación, pero el poder "
"interior que tiene no debería ser de burla."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"在送给你们之前，我、想最后一次，有一些君主的尊严，"
"可以吗？"
msgstr ""
"Antes de despedirme, yo... Solo por esta vez, "
"quisiera conservar la dignidad de un gobernante. "
"¿Puedo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "嗯。"
msgstr "...Seguro."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "好。谢谢。"
msgstr "Muy bien. Gracias. "

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "万宝槌，把我变大吧。"
msgstr "Vuélveme grande, Mazo Milagroso."

#. Description for talk sentence 19 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（针妙丸变大了）"
msgstr "(Shinmyoumaru se engrandece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"为答谢有功之士史蒂夫为小人族，及辉针城做出的贡献——"
msgstr ""
"Por sus contribuciones prestadas a los inchlings y "
"al Castillo-"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "本公主今日赐你宝具，务必收下。"
msgstr ""
"Yo, como la Princesa Shinmyoumaru, por este medio, "
"te concedo, Steve, este mazo. Acepta mi gracia."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid "感谢公主此等赏赐。"
msgstr "Sería un honor para mí aceptar esto."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（辉针城中，夕阳光下，我半跪在这位孤独"
"的公主面前，用充满仪式感的方式接受她的礼物。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(En el Castillo Shining Needle bañado "
"por la luz del sol, sobre una rodilla, acepté "
"ceremoniosamente el regalo de esta princesa "
"solitaria).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（周围格外的安静，没有臣民，没有其他的"
"小人族见证这一神圣的时刻。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(El ambiente estaba especialmente "
"silencioso. Nadie sería testigo de ese momento "
"sagrado).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（在那之后，针妙丸公主送我们离开，一直"
"送到了香霖堂。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Después de eso, la Princesa "
"Shinmyoumaru se despidió y nos acompañó hasta "
"Kourindou).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那时已经是晚上了。她道过别之后，什么"
"都没有说，便走上了回家的路。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Para entonces ya era de noche. Se "
"despidió y continuó su camino a casa sin decir "
"otra palabra).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group castle_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:castle_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（只是那背影，无比落寞，逐渐消失在了漆"
"黑的夜空中，化作了一颗小小的星星。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Su figura al irse era la de la "
"soledad, encogiéndose lentamente en la oscuridad "
"de la noche, transformándose en una pequeña "
"estrella).</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第1天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 1 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1"
msgid "欢迎来到梦境世界！"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido al Mundo de los Sueños!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1"
msgid "这里是哆来咪的领地，小心不要遇到野生的貘哦！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el territorio de Doremy! ¡Ten cuidado de "
"no chocar con ningún Baku!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1"
msgid ""
"对了，因为这里是白天，所以你的一些器械没办法用了！"
msgstr ""
"¡De todas formas, aquí es de día, con lo que "
"algunos de tus artilugios no se pueden utilizar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1"
msgid "比如说你的小型发射器，还有月光传感器！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por ejemplo, el Pequeño Dispensador, y el Sensor "
"Lunar."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1"
msgid ""
"此外，这里有一个泳池！不要以为你可以在这里游泳了！"
"你没办法直接在泳池上面放器械！"
msgstr ""
"¡Además hay una piscina muy nadable! ¡Pero no "
"creas que puedas nadar aquí! ¡No puedes poner "
"artilugios directamente en la piscina!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1"
msgid "那么，祝你好运吧，我的邻居！"
msgstr "¡Bueno, buena suerte, vecino!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_1_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第1天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 1 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_over"
msgid "啊哈！这是睡莲！"
msgstr "¡Aja! ¡Este es el Nenúfar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_over"
msgid "你可以把非水生器械放在它的上面！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puedes colocar artilugios no acuáticos encima!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_over"
msgid "也就是说，你现在可以在水上布置战线了！"
msgstr ""
"¡En otras palabras, ya puedes armas defensas en el "
"agua!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_over"
msgid "可惜它不能像它的祖先一样把船撞碎！"
msgstr ""
"¡Qué lástima que no pueda aplastar barcos como sus "
"antepasados!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_over"
msgid "外界的人类啊，让我看看你做了什么梦……"
msgstr ""
"Humanos del Mundo Exterior, déjeme ver los sueños "
"que ustedes…"

#. Description for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（哆来咪出场）"
msgstr "(Doremy aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_over"
msgid "等、等等！你是真身？"
msgstr "E-espera, ¿Tienen cuerpos físicos?"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_1_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第1天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 1 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid ""
"不是我说，为什么又有一个人真身进入梦境世界啊。而且"
"还有一个方块大鼻子怪人。"
msgstr ""
"Ughh, otra persona entrando al Mundo de los Sueños "
"con cuerpo físico junto con ese raro de nariz "
"grande cuadrado."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid "肯定不是在说我吧！"
msgstr "¡No creo que ella se refiera a mí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid ""
"而且你们是怎么真身来到这里的，难道你们也是想去月之"
"都的吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Cómo es que ustedes tienen cuerpos físicos? "
"¿También se dirigen a la Capital Lunar?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid "月之都？不是，我们是要去幻想乡内地！"
msgstr ""
"¿La Capital Lunar? ¡No, nosotros nos dirigimos "
"hacia Gensokyo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid "幻想乡内地？"
msgstr "¿Gensokyo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid ""
"你看，你的梦境世界里不也有这么多僵尸之类的怪物吗？"
msgstr ""
"Verás, ¿No habrás visto muchos monstruos como "
"zombis en tu mundito?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid "啊，这倒是确实。不过这关你们什么事？"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, eso es cierto. Pero, ¿Eso que tiene que ver "
"con ustedes?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid "我们当然是来清除这些家伙的了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Hemos venido aquí para limpiar todos esos "
"monstruos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid "你们——要清除这些方块怪物？"
msgstr ""
"¿Estás e-erradicando a todos estos monstruos "
"cuadrados?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_1_map"
msgid "来吧，邻居，让我们证明给她看！"
msgstr "¡Vamos, vecino! ¡Hay que demostrarle!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第2天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 2 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2"
msgid ""
"所以，你们通过一把钥匙来到这里的，要进入幻想乡，是"
"吧？"
msgstr ""
"¿Quieres decir, que entraron aquí usando una "
"llave, y que quieren entrar al Gensokyo, correcto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2"
msgid ""
"我可以让你们通过这里，不过目前遇到了一点难处。"
msgstr ""
"Puedo dejarte pasar, sin embargo, hay algunos "
"problemas en este momento."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2"
msgid "什么难处？"
msgstr "¿Qué problema?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2"
msgid ""
"梦境世界遭到了一些方形虫子的入侵，导致现在的环境比"
"较不稳定。"
msgstr ""
"El Mundo de los Sueños ha sido invadido por unos "
"bichos cuadrados, y eso provoca que el ambiente "
"esté inestable."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2"
msgid ""
"如果能清除掉这些虫子，也许就能顺利到达内地了。"
msgstr ""
"Si eliminas esos bichos, los dos podrían llegar "
"ahí sin problemas."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2"
msgid "杀虫是吗？我们随身带着杀虫剂呢！上吧伙计！"
msgstr ""
"¿Controlar plagas, eh? ¡Tenemos insecticidas! "
"¡Vamos, vecino!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_2_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第2天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 2 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_over"
msgid "高科技产品，驱动发射器！"
msgstr ""
"¡Producto de alta tecnología, el Dinamizador!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_over"
msgid "它能像普通发射器一样向敌人发射箭矢！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esto puede disparar flechas hacia los enemigos "
"como los Dispensadores!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_over"
msgid ""
"但你能够在它上面再放置驱动发射器，以提升每次发射的"
"箭矢数量！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero puedes colocar otra en la misma para "
"incrementar el número de flechas por disparo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_over"
msgid "最多能够提升4次，也就是一次发射5支箭矢！"
msgstr "¡Lo máximo son 5 flechas por disparo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_over"
msgid "一支解决不了的，那就用一堆！"
msgstr ""
"¡Si no puedes resolver el problema, usa una pila!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_2_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第2天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 2 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid ""
"看起来你们干的不错，能这么快就把那些蜘蛛一网打尽。"
msgstr ""
"Parece que ustedes hicieron un buen trabajo, "
"acabaron con esas arañas tan eficientemente."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "对了，我好像还没自我介绍。"
msgstr "Oh, cierto, no me he presentado todavía."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid ""
"我是哆来咪·苏伊特，这个梦境世界的管理者。不过你们看"
"起来早就知道了，还知道幻想乡的事情。"
msgstr ""
"Soy Doremy Sweet, la administradora de este mundo. "
"Pero se ve que ustedes ya lo saben, hasta con lo "
"que sucede en Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "当然了！我们可是一开始就是奔着这里来的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Claro! ¡Por eso mismo vinimos aquí desde un "
"principio!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid ""
"对了，我叫村民，叫我坑爹村民就行了！这是我的邻居，"
"叫——"
msgstr ""
"Oh, mi nombre es Aldeano, pero me puede llamar "
"Aldeano Loco! ¡Este es mi vecino, su nom-"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "史蒂夫是吧？我听说过你的名字。"
msgstr ""
"Su nombre es Steve, ¿Cierto? Ya he escuchado ese "
"nombre."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid ""
"幻想乡里某个人的梦境里有出现过你，梦中的那个和你长"
"得一模一样。"
msgstr ""
"Alguien de Gensokyo ha soñado contigo. Esa figura "
"se veía igual que a ti."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid ""
"哇哦，你在幻想乡里居然有女朋友！是哪个妖怪呢？"
msgstr ""
"¡Guau! ¿Tú realmente tienes una novia en Gensokyo? "
"¿Qué youkai es?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "没有！你为啥会这么想啊！"
msgstr "NO, no tengo, ¿¡Por qué piensas eso!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "哇，说话了！我还以为你是哑巴呢！"
msgstr "¡Vaya tú hablas! ¡Yo pensaba que eras mudo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（谁是哑巴啊！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿¡A quién le dices mudo!?)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，还有村民，是吧？欢迎你们的到来。"
msgstr ""
"¿Steve y Aldeano, correcto? ¡Bienvenidos al Mundo "
"de los Sueños!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "另外，希望你们能收下这个。"
msgstr "Por ciento, tomen esto."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "这是……枕头？"
msgstr "¿Esto es… una almohada?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "是我特制的安眠枕，能帮你们睡些好觉。"
msgstr ""
"Esa es mi especialidad, diseñar Almohadas de Dulce "
"Sueño, esto te ayudará a dormir bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid "这样啊，那我们就收下了。"
msgstr "Está bien, entonces lo tomaré."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group dream_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_2_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（嗯……也许这对器械也有用？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Hmm… ¿Tal vez esto también funcione "
"con los artilugios?)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第3天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 3 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3"
msgid ""
"你注意到了吗？不一定什么时候，天色突然就黑下来了！"
"虽然只有一小会。"
msgstr ""
"¿Lo notaste? ¡A veces, el cielo se vuelve de "
"repente a oscuras! ¡Aunque solo sea un momento!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3"
msgid "的确是这样，这是怎么回事？"
msgstr "Cierto, ¿Qué estará pasando?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3"
msgid "不过，只要有光明，再深邃的黑暗也挡不住我们！"
msgstr ""
"Pero, ¡Ni siquiera la oscuridad más profunda puede "
"interferir con nosotros, mientras haya luz!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3"
msgid ""
"试着携带一些会发光的东西吧！……如果真的有必要的话。"
msgstr ""
"¡Intenta llevarte contigo algunos artilugios "
"luminosos! ¡Si es necesario!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（是我眼花了吗？为什么水池看起来有点"
"红？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿Estoy mareado? ¿Por qué la piscina "
"se ve un poco <color=red>roja</color>?)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_3_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第3天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 3 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_over"
msgid "该上物理课了！"
msgstr "¡Es hora de clases de física!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_over"
msgid "这是重力板，可以加强上方物体的重力！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Panel Gravitatorio! ¡Esto incrementa "
"la gravedad de los objetos que pasen por arriba!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_over"
msgid ""
"不仅可以减速上面的怪物，还可以在面对低矮怪物的时候"
"拉低子弹的高度！"
msgstr ""
"¡No solamente puede reducir la velocidad de los "
"enemigos, también puede bajar los proyectiles para "
"dañar a los enemigos bajos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_over"
msgid "对了，不要把它放在苹果树下……"
msgstr ""
"Oh, pero no lo pongas debajo de un árbol de "
"manzanas…"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_3_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第3天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 3 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid "对了，哆来咪，幻想乡内地情况如何？"
msgstr "Bien, Doremy, ¿Qué está pasando en Gensokyo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid "内地的话，情况已经差不多稳定下来了吧。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, la situación de allá ya debería estar "
"estabilizada."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid ""
"可是，不是有方块生物入侵吗？在这些怪物入侵的情况"
"下，还能保持稳定？"
msgstr ""
"¿Pero no hay monstruos invadiendo? ¿Cómo puede "
"estar estable?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid ""
"是这样没错，这的确是一场规模很大的异变，不过大家都"
"已经习惯了。"
msgstr ""
"Es cierto que es un incidente a gran escala, pero "
"es Gensokyo, todos están acostumbrados."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid ""
"那些方形怪物的话，对于没有战斗能力的人类而言是相当"
"大的威胁，毕竟他们没有办法进行反抗。"
msgstr ""
"Esos monstruos cuadrados son una gran amenaza para "
"los humanos sin habilidades de combate, ya que no "
"tienen forma de contraatacar."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid ""
"但对于一些强大的妖怪来说可就不一定了。猎物反倒是那"
"些可怜的方块生物们。"
msgstr ""
"Pero no necesariamente para algunos youkais "
"poderosos, las pobres cosas cuadradas son las "
"presas en cambio."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid "那这么说，反倒不用我们出手了？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿No necesitamos interferir?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid ""
"并非如此，它们的数量太过于庞大了。异变整整持续了三"
"年，这些怪物的数量仍旧只增不减。"
msgstr ""
"No, hay demasiados monstruos. El incidente lleva "
"tres años, pero su número sigue aumentando."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_3_map"
msgid "看起来，必须要找个方法才能彻底根除它们了。"
msgstr ""
"Parece que debemos encontrar alguna forma de "
"erradicarlos para siempre."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第4天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 4 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "……唉。"
msgstr "... *suspiro*"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "哆来咪小姐，您怎么了？"
msgstr "Señorita Doremy ¿Estás bien?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "您好像看起来很疲惫。"
msgstr "Te ves cansada."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "啊，没什么，我这样其实已经挺久了。"
msgstr ""
"Ah, nada, ya hace bastante tiempo que estoy así."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "大概是管理梦境的工作有些多了吧。谢谢关照。"
msgstr ""
"Quizás me esfuerzo demasiado en gestionar los "
"sueños. Gracias por tu preocupación."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "那好吧，注意休息啊。"
msgstr "Vale, recuerda tomar un descanso."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "<color=blue>（……不过。）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(... Aunque)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（哆来咪小姐看上去不像是疲惫，更像是"
"——）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(La Señorita Doremy se ve más-)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4"
msgid "<color=blue>（虚弱？）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¿Débil?)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_4_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第4天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 4 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_over"
msgid "旋转吧！漩涡漏斗！"
msgstr "¡G I R A! ¡Es la Tolva de Vórtice!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_over"
msgid ""
"漩涡漏斗可以放置在水中，然后在被碰到的时候，会把周"
"围的怪物拉下水！"
msgstr ""
"¡La Tolva de Vórtice puede ser colocado en el agua "
"y arrastrar los enemigos bajo agua apenas surja "
"contacto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_over"
msgid "让僵尸都变成溺尸吧！"
msgstr "¡Déjalos que se ahoguen!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_4_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第4天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 4 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "嗯……有趣。"
msgstr "Hmm... Interesante."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "哆来咪，你在看什么？"
msgstr "Doremy, ¿Qué estas leyendo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "啊，是史蒂夫啊。我在观察你的梦。"
msgstr "Ah, Steve, Estoy viendo tus sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "梦？"
msgstr "¿Sueños?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "你以前做过的梦的记录，在我这边都能查到。"
msgstr ""
"Puedo encontrar los registros de todos los sueños "
"que tuviste antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid ""
"难、难道你在看我小时候哭着要戴夫给我买机械玩具——"
msgstr ""
"¿Es-estabas...? ¿Me estabas viendo llorar para que "
"Dave me comprara juguetes mecánicos cuando era "
"niño?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "不不不不不！当然不是这件事了。"
msgstr "¡No no no no no! Claro que no."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "虽然你那时候还挺可爱的……"
msgstr "Aunque pienso que eras bonito a esa edad..."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（好想去死！）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¡Me quiero morir!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "我比较在意的是，你梦里的那个坟墓。"
msgstr ""
"Lo que me importa es esa tumba en tus sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "坟墓？"
msgstr "¿Tumba?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid ""
"就是在那棵树旁边的的坟墓。你的梦中似乎一直出现它"
"呢。"
msgstr ""
"La tumba junto a ese árbol. Parece que sigue "
"apareciendo en tus sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "是吗？好像还真是这样。"
msgstr "¿En serio? Eso parece ser cierto."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid ""
"具体情况我不是很了解，但是一定是相当印象深刻的东西"
"吧。"
msgstr ""
"No sé mucho sobre lo que pasó, pero debe haber "
"sido algo que te haya marcado mucho."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid ""
"因为死者而感到印象深刻——我真的有点想同情你呢。"
msgstr ""
"Teniendo recuerdos tan fuertes de alguien que "
"falleció, realmente quiero simpatizar contigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（很奇怪，我似乎并不清楚这个坟墓是谁"
"的。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Eso es extraño, no estoy seguro de "
"quién es la tumba).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group dream_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_4_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（这到底是怎么回事呢？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>¿De qué se trata todo esto?</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_5_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第5天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 5 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_over"
msgid "嘿！兄弟！你找到了一个末影箱！"
msgstr ""
"¡Oye, vecino! ¡Encontraste un Cofre del Ender!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_over"
msgid ""
"我曾经在我的末影箱里放进了好多货物！知道这意味着什"
"么吗？"
msgstr ""
"¡He guardado un montón de objetos en mi Cofre del "
"Ender! ¿Sabes qué significa esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_over"
msgid "这意味着——坑爹村民的商店正式开张了！"
msgstr ""
"Que la Tienda de Aldeano el Loco ya está "
"oficialmente abierta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_over"
msgid "买一送零！来我这里买点东西吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Compra uno, llévate cero! ¡Vamos vamos compra "
"compra!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_5_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第5天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 5 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "对了，哆来咪，我有个问题想问问你。"
msgstr ""
"Oye, Doremy, hay algo que te quiero preguntar."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "是什么问题呢？"
msgstr "¿Cuál es la pregunta?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "为什么，有的时候这天突然就黑下来了？"
msgstr "¿Por qué a veces oscurece de repente?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "什么？"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid ""
"啊？就是战斗的时候天突然变黑了一下，伸手不见五指"
"的。"
msgstr ""
"¿Huh? Tú sabes, el cielo se torna oscuro durante "
"todas las batallas, y no podemos ver nada. "

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid ""
"我还以为是失明了，但那片黑暗却可以被光芒照亮。"
msgstr ""
"Yo creí que estaba cegado, pero esa oscuridad "
"puede ser iluminada por luz."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "你在说什么？天黑？"
msgstr ""
"¿De qué estás hablando? ¿El cielo se vuelve "
"oscuro? "

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "……？你不知道吗？天已经黑过很多次了啊。"
msgstr ""
"¿…? ¿No lo sabes? El cielo se volvió oscuro por un "
"tiempo antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "你都没有注意到这些吗？"
msgstr "¿No lo notaste?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "你、你说什么？"
msgstr "¿Qu-Qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "但是我，一次也没有见到过那种漆黑的景象啊！"
msgstr "¡Pero y- yo nunca he visto esa oscuridad!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "什么？你看不见那种景象吗？"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿No la puedes ver?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "我看不到黑暗？"
msgstr "¿No puedo ver la oscuridad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "难、难道说……"
msgstr "P-Podría ser…"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "是那家伙！"
msgstr "¡Esa cosa!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "怎么了？哆来咪？你怎么这么——"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa? ¿Doremy? Por que estas-"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid ""
"原来如此，我一直以为这里没什么异常，一直以来，我的"
"眼睛都被蒙骗了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esa cosa! ¡Creí que no había nada anormal aquí! "
"¡Mis ojos han sido engañados todo este tiempo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "你们呆在这里不要乱跑，我要去找那个东西！"
msgstr ""
"¡Los dos quédense aquí y no se muevan, iré a "
"encontrar esa cosa!"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "等、等一下！"
msgstr "¡Es-espera!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group dream_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_5_map"
msgid "怎、怎么回事？我还是第一次见到她这个表情……"
msgstr ""
"¿Qu-qué está pasando? Nunca la había visto así…"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_6
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第6天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 6 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6"
msgid "试过在梦中打砖块么？"
msgstr ""
"¿Alguna vez intentaste jugar Breakout en un sueño?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6"
msgid "那听起来就像做梦一样！"
msgstr "Suena como un sueño, ¿No es así?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6"
msgid "但现在你要打的不是砖块，而是僵尸！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero en lugar de golpear ladrillos, golpeas "
"zombis!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6"
msgid "不是铁珠，是灵异珠！"
msgstr ""
"¡También en lugar de bolas de acero, son bolas "
"mágicas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6"
msgid "当然不是我，而是你！"
msgstr "¡Y en vez de yo, serás TÚ!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_6_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第6天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 6 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_over"
msgid "活塞发射器！会伸缩的发射器！"
msgstr "¡El Pistensador! ¡Un dispensador retráctil!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_over"
msgid ""
"它会发射和箭矢类似的尖刺！并且在遇见飞行怪物的时候"
"会伸长脖子来攻击怪物！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esto puede disparar pichos similares a las "
"flechas! ¡Y encima, si un enemigo volador está en "
"su línea, este puede alargarse para atacarlo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_over"
msgid "对了，把气球拿远点！"
msgstr ""
"¡Un Pistensador al día mantiene alejados a los "
"Ghasts!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_6_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第6天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 6 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "哆、哆来咪，你怎么了？！"
msgstr "Do-Doremy. ¿Qué te está pasando?"

#. Description for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（哆来咪双手抱头痛苦不堪）"
msgstr ""
"(Doremy sostiene su cabeza con sus manos en agonía)"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "你、你们快走……"
msgstr "Ustedes dos, váyanse de aquí…"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "那家伙、要来了……"
msgstr "Ya, ya viene…"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "是、是谁把你变成这样的！"
msgstr "¿Qu-Quien viene?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "是……梦……魇……"
msgstr "Esa cosa… la Pesa… dilla…"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "哆来咪！"
msgstr "¡Doremy!"

#. Description for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（哆来咪倒地）"
msgstr "(Doremy se desmaya)"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那一瞬间，整个梦境世界都失去了色"
"彩。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(En ese momento, el Mundo de los "
"Sueños había perdido todo su color).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（这里的东西开始溶解、脱落，狞笑着向我"
"们展示着，它们真正的样子。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Todo empezó a disolverse y a caerse, "
"mientras algo estaba riéndose ferozmente de "
"nosotros mientras revelaba su verdadera forma).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那是我一生都无法遗忘的场面。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Esa escena es una que nunca la "
"olvidaré).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那时候，我才明白，哆来咪口中的“噩"
"梦”，到底是什么。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Fue entonces cuando comprendí… la "
"verdadera “pesadilla” de la que hablaba Doremy).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "——这、这是怎么回事！"
msgstr "¿Qu-Qué es esto?"

#. Description for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（噩梦世界展现了出来）"
msgstr "(El Mundo de la Pesadilla se revela)"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "这里，为什么会变成这样啊！"
msgstr "¿¡Po-Por qué este lugar se ve así!? "

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "所以，那些东西都只是幻象吗？！"
msgstr ""
"¿Entonces esto significa que todo lo que habíamos "
"visto eran solo camuflaje?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group dream_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_6_map"
msgid "这个地方，原来早就已经是这样子了？！"
msgstr "¿¡Este lugar ha sido así todo el tiempo!?"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_7
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第7天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 7 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7"
msgid "哆来咪没有大碍，她只是昏过去了。"
msgstr ""
"Doremy no está herida, solo sufrió un desmayo. "

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7"
msgid ""
"但是，她好像中了一种诅咒。具体情况我还在研究。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, parece que tiene una maldición. "
"Todavía la estoy estudiando."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7"
msgid ""
"而且，似乎有什么东西正在慢慢地剥夺她的生命，情况相"
"当的不乐观。"
msgstr ""
"Además, parece que algo le está quitando la vida "
"lentamente y las cosas no pintan bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7"
msgid "总之，等她醒了再问问吧！"
msgstr "¡Le preguntaremos cuando se despierte!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_7_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第7天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 7 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_over"
msgid "这是图腾发射器！"
msgstr "¡Este es el Tótensador!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_over"
msgid ""
"它能射出能够虚弱怪物的飞镖，让怪物完全无法造成伤"
"害！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puede disparar dardos que debilitan a los "
"monstruos, haciéndolos incapaces de dañar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_over"
msgid ""
"而且还能够向近处的敌人喷出火焰，持续进行灼烧！"
msgstr ""
"¡También puede lanzar fuego para quemar enemigos "
"cercanos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_over"
msgid "最后，来一发致命的毒素投枪吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por último, tira una lanza con gas debilitante!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_7_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第7天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 7 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "我、我在哪儿？"
msgstr "¿¡Do-Donde estoy!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "哆来咪，你醒了啊。"
msgstr "Doremy, finalmente estás despierta. "

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "你们是……？史蒂夫他们吗？"
msgstr "¿Son ustedes..? ¿Steve y Aldeano?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "是的。哆来咪，你感觉如何？"
msgstr ""
"Así es. Doremy, somos nosotros, ¿Cómo te sientes "
"ahora?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "我——"
msgstr "¿Por qué-"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "我为什么，什么也看不见？"
msgstr "¿Por qué no puedo… ver nada?"

#. Description for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（哆来咪睁开了她失明的双眼）"
msgstr "(Doremy abre sus ojos cegados)"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "！是诅咒吗？"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Es ese el efecto de la maldición?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "我、什么都看不到……你们在哪儿？"
msgstr "Y-Yo no veo nada… ¿Dónde están?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid ""
"哆来咪，能告诉我们，你在那个时候遇见了什么吗？"
msgstr ""
"Doremy ¿Puedes hacernos del favor de decirnos que "
"está pasando?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "就是你受到诅咒的那个时候。"
msgstr "Antes de que fueras maldecida"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "诅咒、是吗？那时……"
msgstr "En- en-... En ese momento..."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "我在找……一样东西。"
msgstr "Estaba buscando… algo"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid ""
"那是……一匹马。在你们来之前，就已经来到梦境的黑马。"
msgstr ""
"Esa cosa… era un caballo. Un caballo negro, eso "
"apareció antes de que ustedes vinieran. "

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "马？"
msgstr "¿Caballo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "我在几个月前、发现了它的存在。"
msgstr ""
"Yo había descubierto su existencia… algunos meses "
"antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid ""
"那个时候，它仅仅是一匹马而已……当我见到它时，感到非"
"常奇怪，但当时我并没有去深究。"
msgstr ""
"Era solo un caballo en ese momento… Cuando lo vi, "
"me sentí muy extraño, pero no le di mucha "
"importancia."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid ""
"我单纯的认为那只是其他妖怪罢了——但是第二天，它不见"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Pensé que tal vez era solo otro youkai… Pero al "
"día siguiente, desapareció."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid ""
"现在回想起来，那应该、是个非常恐怖的东西，它连我的"
"眼睛都能蒙骗过去。"
msgstr ""
"Ahora que lo pienso, para que me engañe incluso a "
"mí... debe ser algo extremadamente aterrador."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid ""
"当我听你们说梦境突然变得黑暗的时候，我意识到——这件"
"事情不可能这么简单。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando ustedes me informaron sobre que el mundo se "
"tornaba oscuro. Me di cuenta que algo estaba mal…"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "所以我才会拼了命的去找到那个东西……"
msgstr "Por eso busqué esa cosa desesperadamente…"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid ""
"最终，我找到了它，但那已经不是一匹马了，那是……一个"
"怪物。"
msgstr ""
"Lo había encontrado, pero ya no era un caballo, "
"era… un monstruo."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "然后，你就被诅咒了？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Fuiste maldecida?"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "没错、在那之后我就变成了现在这样子……"
msgstr ""
"Sí, es lo que me llevó a mi condición actual…"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group dream_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_7_map"
msgid "是吗，我们明白了。"
msgstr "Está bien, entendemos."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_8
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第8天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 8 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "呼、咳咳……"
msgstr "*cough*, *cough*…"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "我、喘不上气……"
msgstr "No… puedo respirar…"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "！有什么东西，正在吸取哆来咪的生命力！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Algo está drenado la vida de Doremy!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "是、梦魇——他在我身上下了咒……"
msgstr ""
"Es la Pesadilla, esa cosa me puso la maldición…"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "我，很快就会、失去所有力气……"
msgstr "Pronto… perderé toda mi fuerza."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "然后——"
msgstr "Luego-"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "不！怎么能这样！"
msgstr "No... ¡Eso no puede ser!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8"
msgid "我们真的只能眼睁睁地看着这一切发生吗……"
msgstr ""
"¿Realmente no podemos hacer nada al respecto…?"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_8_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第8天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 8 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_over"
msgid "太好了！这是梦境结晶！"
msgstr "¡Genia! ¡Este es el Cristal del Sueño!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_over"
msgid "它是一个可以自我再生的障碍墙！"
msgstr "¡Esto es una barrera que puede regenerarse!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_over"
msgid "也可以用来治疗其他的生命！"
msgstr ""
"¡No es todo, también puede curar a otros "
"artilugios cercanos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_over"
msgid "有了这个，我们就能治愈哆来咪了！……大概。"
msgstr ""
"¡Podemos curar a Doremy con esto!... Tal vez..."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_8_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第8天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 8 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "你感觉怎么样，哆来咪？"
msgstr "¿Cómo te estás sintiendo, Doremy?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "我、我，还是……"
msgstr "S-Sigo sin poder…"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid ""
"不行！梦境结晶的治愈效果，还是不能弥补生命的流失！"
msgstr ""
"¡No está funcionado! ¡El efecto curativo de "
"Cristal del Sueño no puede curarla!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "那、那我们该怎么办啊！"
msgstr "¿¡Qu-Qué se supone que haremos!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid ""
"我们只能看着哆来咪小姐她——我绝对不允许这种事情发"
"生！！"
msgstr ""
"¡Solamente podemos ver a ella-, no, no permitiré "
"que eso pase!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "史蒂夫！"
msgstr "¡Steve!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "你们、快走！不要……管我！用你们的钥匙走吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por favor, abandonen este lugar mientras ustedes "
"puedan! No me des importancia… ¡Usa tu llave y "
"vete!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "如果你们，还呆在这里的话，很快、你们也会……"
msgstr "Si ustedes siguen aquí, muy pronto, ustedes…"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid ""
"我、我是个不称职的梦境管理者……求求你们，快走吧！"
msgstr ""
"Soy solo una fracaso de una guardiana... ¡Te lo "
"ruego, por favor, VETE!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "戴夫。"
msgstr "Dave..."

#. Description for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（沉默）"
msgstr "(Silencio)"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "怎么了？"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "准备好所有器械。"
msgstr "Recarga todos los artilugios."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "你想干什么？"
msgstr "¿¡Qu-Qué estas planeado hacer!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "我要亲手干掉那个什么梦魇。"
msgstr "Voy a matar a ese demonio."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "你是认真的吗？！"
msgstr "¿¡E-Enserio!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "当然。快点！"
msgstr "¡Por supuesto, vamos apúrate!"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "史、史蒂夫！你，别做傻事！"
msgstr "¡St-Steve! ¡No seas un tonto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "咳、咳咳……"
msgstr "*cough*... *cough*…"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "戴夫，你知道我什么样。"
msgstr "Dave, sabes qué tipo de persona soy."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "我不会放过任何伤害别人的人。"
msgstr "Yo no perdonaría a quien dañe a los demás."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "也不会放弃任何一个孤独、承受着痛苦的人。"
msgstr "Tampoco dejaré que nadie sufra solo."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "那个梦魇，他该死了！"
msgstr "¡Esa pesadilla MORIRÁ!"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "你……"
msgstr "Steve..."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "果然还是这么莽撞啊。"
msgstr "Eres tan terco como siempre."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "好，准备好所有器械！"
msgstr ""
"¡De acuerdo, pero, debes recarga TODOS los "
"artilugios!"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "我会让他知道厉害！"
msgstr "¡Yo le daré una lección!"

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "明白了。看来我无论说什么也阻止不了你啊。"
msgstr ""
"Entendido. Igual tampoco es que te pueda parar. "

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group dream_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_8_map"
msgid "你们——为什么要这么做啊……"
msgstr "Por que… Estas haciendo esto… "

#. Archive name for talk group dream_9
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第9天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 9 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9"
msgid ""
"我已经尽我所能把那个梦魇给吸引过来了，你可要小心。"
msgstr ""
"Hice todo lo posible para atraer a ese demonio. "
"Ten cuidado."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9"
msgid "我知道，赶快开始吧。 "
msgstr "Ya lo sé. Terminemos con esto de una vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（说是要击败那个梦魇，但我心中却丝毫没"
"有底气。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Dije que derrotaría a esa Pesadilla, "
"pero tengo poca confianza en mí mismo).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（但是为了哆来咪小姐，我也只能这么做"
"了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Pero por la señorita Doremy, esto es "
"lo que tengo que hacer).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9"
msgid "我只能做到这里了。可别把自己的命给搭上。"
msgstr ""
"Esto es todo lo que puedo hacer. No pongas tu vida "
"en peligro, ¿de acuerdo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9"
msgid "等等，那边那个白色的蜘蛛是什么？"
msgstr "Espera, ¿Qué hace esa araña blanca ahí?"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_9_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第9天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 9 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_over"
msgid "又是一件梦境的物品！"
msgstr "¡Otro objeto de los sueños!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_over"
msgid ""
"这个是美梦丝！把它放在器械上面，器械就会睡着！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Hilo del Sueño! ¡Colócalo encima de un "
"artilugio y este se dormirá!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_over"
msgid ""
"在这个器械醒来之后，就会产生新的星之碎片，供你利"
"用！"
msgstr ""
"¡Posteriormente genera un Fragmento Estelar cuando "
"esta se despierte!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_over"
msgid "……对，我会试着用它来缓解哆来咪的痛苦的。"
msgstr ""
"…Intentaré usarlo para aliviar el dolor de Doremy."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_9_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第9天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 9 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "我说，哆来咪还是想见你一面。"
msgstr "Bien, Doremy quiere verte otra vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "还是在劝我们离开吗。"
msgstr "¿Sigue con lo que nos vayamos, verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "是的。你已经很久没看望过她了吧？"
msgstr "Sí. Hace tiempo que no la ves, ¿no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "我很抱歉。"
msgstr "Lo siento..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid ""
"我能明白你的心情。实际上，我也不打算就这么放弃。"
msgstr ""
"Entiendo como te sientes. En hecho, tampoco planeo "
"rendirme."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "我也有要见的人。"
msgstr "Hay alguien a quien tengo que ver."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "……？你要见谁？"
msgstr "¿...? ¿Quién?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_9_map"
msgid "没什么，自言自语罢了。"
msgstr "Nada, solo hablaba conmigo mismo."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_note
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "？？？"
msgstr "¿¿¿???"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_note"
msgid "这是什么？"
msgstr "¿Qué es esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_note"
msgid "一张废纸罢了。"
msgstr "Solo un simple papelito."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_note"
msgid ""
"上面似乎确实写着字。大概是因为梦境的缘故，上面的字"
"都看不清。"
msgstr ""
"Parece tener palabras. Probablemente, como estamos "
"en un sueño, las palabras no son claras."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_note"
msgid "我还是先收起来吧。"
msgstr "Será lo mejor que nos lo quedemos."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_10_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第10天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 10 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "明天，那个梦魇就来了吧？"
msgstr "¿Entonces la Pesadilla vendrá mañana?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "是的，你真的要这么做？"
msgstr "Sí. ¿Estás seguro que quieres hacer esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid ""
"我还是那句话，如果你真的做到了的话，我们的确就得救"
"了。"
msgstr "De nuevo, si lo logras, seremos salvados."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid ""
"但是，如果失败了的话，可不就止一条命这么简单了。"
msgstr ""
"Pero si tu fallas, esto costará más que tu vida. "

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "既然没有其他办法，那我只能这么做了。"
msgstr "No hay otro camino. Tengo que hacerlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "哆来咪的身体也濒临极限了。"
msgstr "La vida de Doremy está entre las cuerdas."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "哆来咪小姐，她一直希望我不去和它战斗。"
msgstr ""
"La Señorita Doremy… Ella nunca quiso verme luchar "
"de esta manera."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "但为了能救她，我只能选择不去见她。"
msgstr ""
"Pero lo hago por ella, solo puedo elegir no verla."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "我真的很抱歉。"
msgstr "Realmente que lo siento"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_10_map"
msgid "……我们会祝你好运的。"
msgstr "… Te deseamos buena suerte."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_11
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第11天入场"
msgstr "Mundo de la Pesadilla Día 11 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11"
msgid "好了，它应该快来了。"
msgstr "Bien, estará aquí pronto."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11"
msgid "仔细检查检查你手上的武器吧。"
msgstr "Revisa bien tu armamento."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11"
msgid ""
"我不知道梦魇究竟到底是什么，也并不知道它会什么，但"
"我知道，一定要保持清醒。"
msgstr ""
"No sé qué es la Pesadilla ni qué puede hacer. Pero "
"sí sé que debes mantener la mente despejada."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11"
msgid "一定要快点结束战斗，我们的时间已经不多了。"
msgstr ""
"Debemos terminar la batalla lo antes posible. "
"Nuestro tiempo se acaba."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11"
msgid "祝你好运。"
msgstr "Buena suerte... Hijo."

#. Archive name for talk group dream_11_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第11天结束"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 11 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid "Ohhhhhhhhh！真没想到你做到了！"
msgstr "¡Ohhhhhhhhh! ¡Tu realmente lo hiciste!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid "梦魇他——死了吗？！"
msgstr "La… ¿La Pesadilla murió? "

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid "那，哆来咪小姐她现在怎么样？！"
msgstr "¿¡Có-cómo está Doremy!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid "我、我能看见了？"
msgstr "¿P-Puedo ver?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid "而且——我的生命力回来了！"
msgstr "¡M-mi fuerza y vida está de vuelta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid "哆来咪小姐！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Señorita Doremy!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid "……您没事实在是太好了！"
msgstr "¡Qué bueno que estés bien!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_over"
msgid ""
"干的漂亮，邻居！现在，梦境世界的噩梦已经完全被消除"
"了！"
msgstr ""
"¡MARAVILLOSO, vecino! ¡Ahora la pesadilla en el "
"Mundo de los Sueños ha sido completamente "
"destruida!"

#. Archive name for talk group dream_11_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦境世界第11天地图"
msgstr "Mundo de los Sueños Día 11 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "我对我的鲁莽行为表示抱歉，哆来咪小姐。"
msgstr ""
"Le pido disculpas por mi comportamiento "
"imprudente, Señorita Doremy."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"不不不，不用道歉的。最后还是你拯救了整个梦境啊。"
msgstr ""
"No, no tienes que disculparte. Al final, salvaste "
"el Mundo de los Sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "你还真是个令人操心的孩子啊，但我不讨厌。"
msgstr ""
"Realmente que eres un niño muy preocupante. Aunque "
"no puedo decir que lo odie."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（哆来咪像看着孩子一样看着我……）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Doremy me ve como un niño...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "真没想到你居然做到了。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque no puedo creer que hayas podido lograrlo…"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"器械之间的无瑕配合，你的指挥力和谋略，如此年轻的孩"
"子居然拥有这般不可小觑的力量。"
msgstr ""
"Cada artilugio formando una armonía perfecta, la "
"forma de planificar y dar órdenes… Pensar que un "
"niño tan pequeño podría poseer una fuerza tan "
"insuperable."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "说实话，甚至比我还要强大。"
msgstr "Sinceramente, eres aún más poderoso que yo."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"如果是你的话，说不定幻想乡的问题真的能得到解决。"
msgstr ""
"Contigo, quizás, el problema por fin pueda "
"resolverse."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "真的吗……？"
msgstr "¿Me lo dices... en serio?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "啊，对了，有件事我得告诉你。"
msgstr "Oh sí, hay algo que quiero decirte."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "什么，告诉我吗？"
msgstr "¿Algo, tienes algo que decirme?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "不不不，是史蒂夫。"
msgstr "No, yo me refería a Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "肯定是在说我吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Lo sabía! ¡Estás hablando de mí a mis espaldas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（这家伙也回来了……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Bueno, al menos ALGUIEN volvió a la "
"normalidad…)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "你还记得，关于你梦中的那个墓吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Aún te acuerdas de... esa tumba de tus sueños?"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "！墓……？"
msgstr "¿Tumba?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"我之前仔细查询了一下，发现，那个墓其实是在你很小的"
"时候就见过的一座墓。"
msgstr ""
"Busqué a fondo y descubrí que la tumba en realidad "
"era una que viste cuando eras muy joven."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"那时候，我还没来得及告诉你，就被卷入了梦魇的阴谋"
"中。现在该告诉你了。"
msgstr ""
"Siento que por el plan de la Pesadilla haya "
"interrumpido en ese momento antes de poder "
"decírtelo, ahora es el momento de contártelo."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"我很小时候的墓？但是，我不记得戴夫家附近有什么墓"
"啊。"
msgstr ""
"¿Una tumba cuando era niño? Pero no recuerdo haber "
"visto ninguna tumba cerca de la casa de Dave."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "那是更早之前的事了。那时，你还是个婴儿。"
msgstr "Fue antes. Eras un bebé en ese momento."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "婴……婴儿？！"
msgstr "¿¡Un… Un bebé!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（我小时候的记忆，只停留到大约两三岁时"
"候的事情。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Mi recuerdo de infancia solo cubre el "
"momento en que tenía dos o tres años).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那个时候，我没有父亲，也没有母亲，只"
"有作为养父的戴夫抚养着我。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(No tuve padre ni madre. Solo Dave, "
"como padre adoptivo, él me crio).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（但是，我并不是像戴夫一样的方块生物，"
"因此常常被当作异类对待。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Pero no soy una criatura cuadrada "
"como Dave, por eso a menudo me tratan como a un "
"fenómeno).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（因此，我很在意，我的亲生父亲和母亲，"
"到底是谁。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Por eso siempre me pregunto quiénes "
"son mis padres biológicos).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "那、那到底是谁的墓！"
msgstr "Entonces… ¿¡De quién es la tumba!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "不清楚。"
msgstr "Desconozco eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "诶？"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"你的记忆似乎到此为止，连这梦中的人的模样都记不得"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Tu memoria parece detenerse aquí. Ni siquiera "
"recuerdas cómo es esa persona en tu sueño."

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "我只能说很遗憾。"
msgstr "Solamente puedo decir que lo lamento."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "……是这样吗。还是多谢了，哆来咪小姐。"
msgstr ""
"… Está bien. Igualmente muchas gracias, Señorita "
"Doremy."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "我其实曾经是个孤儿，是戴夫一直以来抚养着我。"
msgstr ""
"En realidad, era huérfano. Dave me ha estado "
"criando."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"这些年来，我一直都很想知道自己的亲生父母到底是谁。"
msgstr ""
"Durante todos estos años, siempre me he preguntado "
"quiénes eran realmente mis padres biológicos."

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "这样子啊。不过，我们以后大概还会再见的。"
msgstr ""
"Ya veo. Bueno, probablemente nos volvamos a ver."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"你在做梦的时候，可能还会遇见我，那个时候我们再聊聊"
"吧。"
msgstr ""
"Quizás me vuelvas a encontrar cuando estés "
"soñando. Hablaremos de nuevo en ese caso."

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"而在幻想乡那段时间内，我就好好的翻翻你的梦吧。"
msgstr ""
"Durante tu tiempo en Gensokyo, podré seguir viendo "
"tus sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（——希望你不要再翻我的那些黑历史了！）"
"</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Solo espero que ella no vea mis "
"vergonzosas memorias de nuevo!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid ""
"另外，为了表示感谢，在你们离开之前，我有东西要送给"
"你们。"
msgstr ""
"Además, por agradecimiento, tengo algo para ti "
"antes de que te vayas."

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "请收下这个吧。这个是梦境世界的梦蝶。"
msgstr ""
"Toma esto. Esta es la Mariposa del Mundo de los "
"Sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "它能够保护你，还有器械们免受某些灾难。"
msgstr ""
"Ella te protegerá, y a los artilugios de algunos "
"desastres."

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "祝你们一路平安！"
msgstr "¡Les deseo un viaje seguro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "好，谢谢哆来咪小姐了！"
msgstr "¡Ok, gracias, Señorita Doremy! "

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "好了，我们终于可以去幻想乡了！"
msgstr "¡Bueno, por fin podemos llegar a Gensokyo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group dream_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:dream_11_map"
msgid "我们早就已经准备好了！出发吧！"
msgstr "¡Siempre estuvimos listos! ¡Vamos!"

#. Archive name for talk group entered_gensokyo
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "进入幻想乡"
msgstr "Entrando a Gensokyo"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "好了！我们终于到幻想乡了！"
msgstr "¡Genia! ¡Finalmente llegamos a Gensokyo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "这里……居然真的存在？"
msgstr "Este lugar… ¿Realmente existe?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "我还以为你一直以来都是在发疯呢。"
msgstr ""
"Yo pensaba que solo era uno de tus cuentos locos."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "你以为我是谁呢，邻居！"
msgstr "¡Piensa en con quien estás hablando, vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "我这次还特地画了张地图呢！"
msgstr "Incluso traje un mapa conmigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "好简陋？"
msgstr "Se ve muy... rústico."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "方向标和比例尺都没有啊你这地图。"
msgstr ""
"Ni siquiera tiene brújula ni escala. Vaya mapa tan "
"chafa."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "问题不大！"
msgstr "¡Aún así es funcional!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "那么，接下来去哪儿？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Hacia dónde?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "嗯……"
msgstr "Hmm..."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "诶，我有个想法！"
msgstr "¡Tengo una idea!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "要不先去卖货的香霖堂吧，我正好有点缺货了！"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué no visitamos Kourindou? ¡Venden cosas, y "
"a mí me faltan cosas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group entered_gensokyo's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:entered_gensokyo"
msgid "去吧，邻居，该进货了！"
msgstr "¡Vamos vecino! ¡Es hora de gastar!"

#. Archive name for talk group kourindou_first_visit
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "第三章-访问香霖堂"
msgstr "Capítulo 3-Visita a Kourindou"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "啊！有人来了！"
msgstr "Ah, ¡Un cliente!"

#. Speaker Name for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "character.name"
msgid "店主"
msgstr "Tendera"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "欢迎来到——"
msgstr "Bienvenido a—"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡!!!"

#. Description for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（村民出场）"
msgstr "(Aldeano aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
msgstr "¡Eeeeeeeeek!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "方块怪物！不要吃我！！我不好吃！！！"
msgstr ""
"¡Monstruos cúbicos! ¡¡No me coman!! ¡¡¡No tengo "
"buen sabor!!!"

#. Description for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（店主躲起来了）"
msgstr "(Tendera se esconde)"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "……？"
msgstr "...¿?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "嗯？是说我吗？"
msgstr "Uhh, ¿Ella se refiere a mí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "那个，不是的，我们不是怪物，不会吃你的。"
msgstr ""
"¿Hola, señorita? No somos monstruos, y no estamos "
"aquí para comerte."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "这位是我的朋友戴夫，他很友善，不会伤害你的。"
msgstr ""
"Este es mi amigo, Dave. Él es buena persona y no "
"te hará daño."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "是、是吗？"
msgstr "¿E-Enserio?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "不、不好意思，我失态了。"
msgstr ""
"Yo... lo siento. Eso fue inapropiado de mi parte."

#. Description for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（店主出来了）"
msgstr "(Tendera sale)"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "最近方块怪物实在是太多了，我太害怕了。"
msgstr ""
"Realmente todos esos monstruos cúbicos me están "
"poniendo de las casillas últimamente."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "没事的，我们只是普普通通的顾客而已，放心。"
msgstr ""
"No pasa nada. Somos clientes habituales, como "
"cualquier otro. No te preocupes."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "那、不好意思——"
msgstr "Yo... confiaré en ti entonces..."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"重新问候一遍吧，欢迎来到香霖堂！这里有来自外界的各"
"种稀奇小玩意！"
msgstr ""
"Empecemos otra vez. ¡Bienvenido al Kourindou! "
"¡Tenemos todo tipo de curiosidades del Mundo "
"Exterior!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "我是这家店的店主，你们可以叫我……朱鹭子！"
msgstr ""
"¡Soy la dueña de la tienda, me pueden llamar... "
"Tokiko!"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "随便看看吧，有什么感兴趣的东西么？"
msgstr ""
"Echa un vistazo. ¿Encontraste algo que te guste?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "等等，你是这家店的——店主？"
msgstr "Tú eres... ¿La dueña?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"我从朋友那里听说过这家店，这里确实是香霖堂，但我记"
"得店主应该叫……森近 霖之助才对。"
msgstr ""
"Un amigo mío me contó acerca de esta tienda antes. "
"Kourindou, ¿no? Si lo recuerdo correctamente... El "
"dueño de la tienda solía ser uno llamado... "
"Rinnosuke Morichika."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "这是怎么回事？"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa con ello?"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "森近 霖之助……"
msgstr "Rinnosuke Morichika..."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "已经有三年没人提过这个名字了。"
msgstr ""
"Ese nombre no la he escuchado en tres años..."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "……三年没有提过？发生什么事了吗？"
msgstr ""
"... ¿No has la escuchado en tres años? ¿Le pasó "
"algo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "你们是外界来的人吧。"
msgstr "No eres de por aquí, ¿cierto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "如果是幻想乡的居民，肯定听说过他的事情。"
msgstr ""
"Seguramente sabrías qué fue de él si fueras de "
"Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "什么？"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "在异变开始的时候，他就已经不在这里了。"
msgstr ""
"Él ya se había ido cuando comenzó este incidente."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "好像是……三年前的那个时候。"
msgstr ""
"Creo que fue... Por ese tiempo, hace unos tres "
"años."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"幻想乡开始慢慢地出现那些由方块组成的僵尸怪物。它们"
"如同行尸走肉一般，攻击我们所有人。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando estos zombis de cubos invadieron lentamente "
"Gensokyo, actuaron como no muertos, atacando a "
"todos sin pensar."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"而霖之助——他是整个异变中第一个死……失踪的人。三年来"
"一直杳无音讯。"
msgstr ""
"Siendo Rinnosuke, el primero en perecer... "
"Desapareció tras el incidente. Desde entonces, "
"nadie ha sabido nada de él."

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"没有人能找到他的人——或者是尸体，他就这么突然地消失"
"了，留下我一个人……"
msgstr ""
"Nunca lo encontramos, ni tampoco su cuerpo. "
"Simplemente desapareció de repente un día, "
"dejándome sola..."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"这起异变直到现在还在持续着，大街上到处都是方块僵"
"尸，这让我一直很害怕……"
msgstr ""
"El incidente sigue en su apogeo. Las calles están "
"llenas de esos zombis cúbicos. Tengo mucho miedo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "霖之助，他失踪了是吗？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Rinnosuke desapareció?"

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "所以，你才会一直待在这里，为他照顾这个店？"
msgstr ""
"¿Es por eso que te quedas aquí, cuidando su tienda?"

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "不过，你并没有这个理由啊。"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué? No deberías tener ninguna razón para eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"你应该只是在喜欢在店门口读书的一只普通的妖怪而已，"
"和他应该没有什么太大的关系吧？"
msgstr ""
"¿No eres solo un youkai común y corriente al que "
"le gusta leer fuera de la tienda? No tienes ningún "
"parentesco importante con él, ¿no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "那是因为……"
msgstr "Eso es porque..."

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "不好意思，我不想说。"
msgstr "Lo siento pero preferiría no decirlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "是么，很抱歉问了你这么难过的问题。"
msgstr ""
"Ok, entonces... Pido disculpas por preguntar."

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"对了，不如我们把这里作为我们在幻想乡的作战基地吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Lo tengo! ¿Por qué no usamos este lugar como base "
"para nuestras batallas en Gensokyo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "正巧了！我也有想卖的对付怪物的利器！"
msgstr ""
"Adivina que. ¡También tengo armas para matar "
"monstruos como mercancía!"

#. Text for talk sentence 44 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "？你怎么突然开腔了？"
msgstr "¿Huh? ¿Qué mosca te pico?"

#. Text for talk sentence 45 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"把这里作为作战基地……？听起来好像很不错的样子！"
msgstr ""
"¿Usar este lugar como base...? ¡Suena genial!"

#. Text for talk sentence 46 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"我也挺讨厌这些方块怪物的，这样一来应该就能把那些家"
"伙赶走了！"
msgstr ""
"A mí personalmente no me gustan mucho esos "
"monstruos cúbicos. ¡Deberíamos poder ahuyentarlos "
"por completo entre ustedes dos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 47 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"而且，我在这里一直挺孤单的，有几个人陪着的话应该也"
"不错。"
msgstr ""
"Además, uno se siente bastante solo aquí, así que "
"creo que tener compañía no estaría tan mal."

#. Text for talk sentence 48 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "很高兴你能同意！"
msgstr ""
"ASÍ ES, ¡Me alegro de que estemos en la misma "
"página!"

#. Text for talk sentence 49 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid ""
"好了！那这里就变成了坑爹村民和我邻居的新基地了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Bien! Declaro esto: ¡La nueva base del Aldeano "
"Loco y el Vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 50 in talk group kourindou_first_visit's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_first_visit"
msgid "商店也再次开张了！有什么想买的吗？"
msgstr ""
"¡La tienda también está reabierta! ¿Quieres "
"comprar algo?"

#. Archive name for talk group exited_kourindou
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "第三章-离开香霖堂"
msgstr "Capítulo 3-Abandonando Kourindou"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "差不多该走了吧？"
msgstr "¿No deberíamos irnos pronto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "没错，但……该去哪儿呢？"
msgstr "Sí, pero... ¿Hacia dónde?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "得先有个目标吧！"
msgstr "¡Tenemos que tener ALGÚN LUGAR adonde ir!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "那个那个，如果说是帮忙的话，我这里有个东西。"
msgstr "Oigan, si buscas ayuda, tengo esto conmigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "什么？"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid ""
"有天，我在窗口发呆的时候，外面突然飘来一封信。"
msgstr ""
"Un día estaba mirando por la ventana cuando de "
"repente cayó una carta."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "就是这个。"
msgstr "Aquí esta, mírenla."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "这是？辉针城的求助信？"
msgstr ""
"Esto es... ¿Una solicitud de ayuda desde el "
"Castillo Shining Needle?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "看来，我们的下一站就是辉针城了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Decidido! ¡Nuestro próximo destino será al "
"Castillo Shining Needle!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid ""
"我事先问一下，这个辉针城，该不会是半空中的那个倒过"
"来的城……吧？"
msgstr ""
"Corrígeme si me equivoco, pero ese lugar no sería "
"ese castillo al revés que flota en el aire... "
"¿Verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "没错！"
msgstr "¡Bingo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "怎么上去？"
msgstr "¿Cómo se supone que llegaremos ahí arriba?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "你不是会机械吗？造个活塞虫呗！"
msgstr ""
"¿Tu no eres el chico de los artilugios? ¡Un "
"ascensor de pistón debería ser la solución!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "这能行吗！"
msgstr "¿¡Siquiera eso funcionará!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group exited_kourindou's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou"
msgid "试试就知道了！"
msgstr "¡Solo intenta y veras!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第1天入场"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 1 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "到终点了！就这儿！"
msgstr "¡Llegamos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "……幻想乡入口呢？"
msgstr "Pero… ¿Dónde está la entrada hacia Gensokyo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "反正一定能找到的，我以我的胡子起誓！"
msgstr ""
"¡No podemos simplemente tomar un autobús hasta "
"allá!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "顺便，这里也有那些僵尸啊。"
msgstr ""
"Además, parece que también hay zombis por aquí…"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "出于我的一片好心，你就把他们清理了吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Muy amablemente te dejo que tú los elimines a "
"todos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "哦对了，顺带一提："
msgstr "Ah, sí, por cierto:"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "我们的矿场是以太阳能工作的，而现在是晚上。"
msgstr ""
"Nuestro Minero funciona con energía solar… y "
"bueno, es de noche."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "所以，它现在没法被使用了！"
msgstr ""
"Así que no hay energía para que el generador de "
"energía genere energía."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group halloween_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1"
msgid "靠着你的熔炉活过今晚吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Confía en tus Hornos si quieres sobrevivir esta "
"noche!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_1_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第1天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 1 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_over"
msgid "这位是我们的老朋友，小型发射器！"
msgstr ""
"¡Te presento a nuestro viejo amigo, el Pequeño "
"Dispensador!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_over"
msgid "和我们的小伙伴打个招呼吧！"
msgstr "¡Saluda a nuestro pequeño amiguito!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_over"
msgid ""
"小型发射器不需要能量就能放置，能够喷射短距离的雪"
"球，是夜晚的一大利器！"
msgstr ""
"Los Pequeños Dispensadores no necesitan energía "
"para colocarse. ¡Lanzan bolas de nieve a corta "
"distancia, son perfectos para las noches!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_over"
msgid "好好利用吧！"
msgstr "¡Haz un buen uso de ellos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_over"
msgid "……你们是？"
msgstr "...¿Quiénes son ustedes dos?"

#. Description for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（欧兰特出场）"
msgstr "(Orant aparece)"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_1_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第1天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 1 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid "哇！野生的女巫出现了！"
msgstr "¡Guau! ¡Una bruja salvaje apareció!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid "啊？好像不是……"
msgstr "¿Eh? Parece que ella no lo es realmente…"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid "请问一下，你们是什么人，怎么到这里来的？"
msgstr ""
"Disculpa, ¿Quiénes son, y cómo llegaron hasta aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid ""
"我们就是专门清理这些僵尸的人，顺着一个藏宝图来的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Encontramos un mapa del tesoro! ¡Así que iremos "
"adonde nos indique!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid "……这样啊，我明白了。"
msgstr "…Hmm, ya veo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid "那个，如果可以的话，能不能帮我一个忙？"
msgstr "¿Podrían hacerme un favor?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid ""
"就是……这里的僵尸和死者，都开始复活了起来，能不能帮"
"我……让他们安息？"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente han aparecido más zombis y no muertos… "
"¿Podrías ayudarme a… dejarlos descansar?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group halloween_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_1_map"
msgid "没问题！交给我坑爹村民——的伙计，史蒂夫吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ningún problema! ¡Déjaselo a MI COMPA STEVE!"

#. Archive name for talk group starshard_tutorial
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "星之碎片教程"
msgstr "Tutorial de los Fragmentos"

#. Archive text for talk group starshard_tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "开始段落"
msgstr "Sección comenzada"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group starshard_tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:starshard_tutorial"
msgid "嘿，伙计，我来给你分享一些神奇的事情！"
msgstr ""
"¡Oye, colega! ¡Déjame mostrarte unas cosas MÁGICAS!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group starshard_tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:starshard_tutorial"
msgid ""
"这个东西叫做星之碎片！它能随着当前地方变形成一种道"
"具！"
msgstr ""
"Esto se llama Fragmento Estelar. ¡Cambia de forma "
"según el lugar donde estemos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group starshard_tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:starshard_tutorial"
msgid ""
"但是，它的效果都是一样的！都能让你的器械爆发！"
msgstr ""
"Pero su efecto siempre es el mismo: ¡Activar la "
"habilidad de Evocación de tus artilugios!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group starshard_tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:starshard_tutorial"
msgid "好了，现在来试试吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Muy bien, probemos el Caramelo Mágico, que es el "
"Fragmento Estelar de esta zona!"

#. Archive text for talk group starshard_tutorial's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "教程完成后"
msgstr "Después del tutorial"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group starshard_tutorial's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:starshard_tutorial"
msgid "干得不错！伙计！"
msgstr "¡Buen trabajo, vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group starshard_tutorial's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:starshard_tutorial"
msgid ""
"噢！天哪！看起来又有一大批客人来要我们招待了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ay, caramba! ¡Parece que más invitados quieren "
"diversión!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group starshard_tutorial's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:starshard_tutorial"
msgid "一起来吧！我——坑爹了！"
msgstr "¡Vamos allá! ¡ESTOY LOCOOOOO!!!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_2_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第2天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 2 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_over"
msgid "嘿！这是月光传感器！"
msgstr "¡Eh, mira! ¡Este es el Sensor Lunar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_over"
msgid ""
"它能依靠月光或黑暗，自动为你增加能量！而且一段时间"
"后会提高生产量！"
msgstr ""
"¡Genera energía automáticamente bajo la luz de la "
"luna o en la oscuridad! ¡También conforme pase el "
"tiempo, podrá producir más!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_over"
msgid "因为它的廉价，用它来代替熔炉吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Deberías usarlo en lugar de los Hornos, por su "
"bajo costo de energía!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_2_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第2天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 2 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid "你们看起来……的确是有一手。"
msgstr ""
"Veo que tienes... habilidades bastante "
"impresionantes."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid "对了，我好像还没有自我介绍。"
msgstr ""
"Ah… Creo que no me he presentado correctamente."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid ""
"我是欧兰特，是一位灵魂术士，在这里……等候一些人的到"
"来。"
msgstr ""
"Soy Orant, una hechicera de almas. Estoy aquí… "
"esperando a ciertas personas."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid "不会是在等我们吧？"
msgstr "¿Nos estabas esperando a nosotros?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid "……抱歉，我不能说。"
msgstr "...Lo siento, no puedo decirlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid "啊，好吧。"
msgstr "Oh... está bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid ""
"您是一位灵魂术士，那您知道这些僵尸为什么会复活吗？"
msgstr ""
"Dices que eres una hechicera de almas… ¿Sabes por "
"qué estos zombis están resucitando?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid ""
"我不太清楚。自从一段时间前开始，这些僵尸和骷髅就开"
"始出现了。"
msgstr ""
"No estoy segura. Desde hace un tiempo han empezado "
"a aparecer zombis y esqueletos."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid ""
"不止如此，还有一些更加危险的怪物藏在这里，请务必小"
"心。"
msgstr ""
"No solo eso… también hay monstruos más peligrosos "
"escondidos por aquí. Por favor, tengan cuidado."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group halloween_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_2_map"
msgid "看来我们得好好招待这些万圣节的客人了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Parece que vamos a tener que tratar muy bien a "
"estos invitados de Halloween!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第3天入场"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 3 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3"
msgid "话说回来，那些雕像是什么啊？"
msgstr "Por cierto… ¿Qué son esas estatuas?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3"
msgid "那些石像啊……好像是叫石像鬼。"
msgstr ""
"Esas estatuas… He oído que se llaman Gárgolas."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3"
msgid "具体的信息我不是很清楚了，需要看看图鉴。"
msgstr ""
"No estoy muy segura de los detalles. Necesito "
"revisar mi Almanaque."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3"
msgid "……说起来，我的图鉴呢？"
msgstr "…¿Eh? ¿Dónde está mi Almanaque?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3"
msgid "……对啊，图鉴……"
msgstr "...Cierto, el Almanaque..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3"
msgid ""
"好吧，看来今天我们是没法得知这些东西是什么了。"
msgstr ""
"Parece que hoy no vamos a aprender qué son las "
"Gárgolas."

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_3_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第3天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 3 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_over"
msgid "这个是荧石，可以照亮并驱散周围的浓雾！"
msgstr ""
"Esta es la Piedra Luminosa. Puede iluminar el área "
"alrededor y disipar la niebla."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_over"
msgid "不过……这月光照耀的地方哪来的雾啊……"
msgstr ""
"Pero… este lugar está lleno por la luz de la luna, "
"no hay niebla."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_over"
msgid "那它是用来干什么的呢？"
msgstr "¿Entonces… para qué sirve?"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_3_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第3天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 3 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_map"
msgid "看来……嗯，图鉴是弄丢了。"
msgstr "El Almanaque… Desapareció."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_map"
msgid "大概是和那些怪物战斗的时候弄丢的吧。"
msgstr ""
"Seguramente la perdí luchando contra esos "
"monstruos."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_map"
msgid "嗯……那还真是不幸。"
msgstr "Hmm… Qué mala suerte."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_map"
msgid ""
"不过不必担心，那些僵尸大概也会把图鉴带回来的吧。"
msgstr ""
"No te preocupes. Tal vez alguno de esos zombis nos "
"lo devuelva."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_map"
msgid "因为——嗯……他们会拿着他们遇到的……一些东西。"
msgstr ""
"Porque… hmm… Parece que recogen cualquier cosa que "
"se encuentran."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_map"
msgid "大概，他们也会把我的图鉴带来吧。"
msgstr "Puede que uno de ellos tenga mi Almanaque."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_3_map"
msgid "是吗？那么我们也来帮忙找找吧！"
msgstr ""
"¿En serio? ¡Hora de cazar a ese zombi lector!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第4天入场"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 4 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4"
msgid "你们之前拿到的东西是荧石吧？"
msgstr "¿Llegaste a obtener Piedra Luminosa antes?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4"
msgid "来源于下界的发光石头，人间的确不多见。"
msgstr ""
"Es una piedra brillante del Nether… Extremadamente "
"rara en el Mundo Exterior."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4"
msgid ""
"它只会发光，可是这里好像没什么需要照亮的东西。"
msgstr ""
"Brilla, sí… ¿Pero para que necesitamos iluminación?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4"
msgid "也许……"
msgstr "Quizás..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4"
msgid "幽灵要开始游荡了。"
msgstr "Los fantasmas comenzarán a vagar."

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_4_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第4天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 4 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_over"
msgid "这个是冲击活塞！"
msgstr "¡Este es el Pistón Golpeador!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_over"
msgid ""
"它能够击退前方的怪物一大格距离！并且重创脆弱的石头"
"或者其他东西！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esto puede empujar a los monstruos a una larga "
"distancia! ¡Incluso puede dañar muy fuerte a las "
"piedras frágiles u otros objetos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_over"
msgid ""
"不过，在它击退之后会坏掉，需要一段时间来维修自己！"
msgstr ""
"Pero se romperá tras el golpe… y necesita tiempo "
"para repararse."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_over"
msgid "冲散它们的阵型吧！"
msgstr "¡Vamos, darles un FALCON PUNCH!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_4_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第4天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 4 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_map"
msgid "说起来，这片沼泽着实怪异。"
msgstr ""
"Ahora que lo pienso… este pantano es realmente "
"raro."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_map"
msgid "我们明明已经在这里呆了4天，却一直都是万圣夜！"
msgstr ""
"Llevamos 4 días aquí… y sigue siendo la víspera de "
"Halloween!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_map"
msgid "啊，那是因为这里被施了魔法的原因吧。"
msgstr ""
"Ah, eso es porque este lugar ha sido embrujado."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_map"
msgid ""
"或者可以说是诅咒……总之这里的沼泽时间永远都会保持在"
"万圣节前一天。"
msgstr ""
"O maldito, podrían decir… El tiempo aquí se "
"congeló en la víspera de Halloween."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_map"
msgid "就像一幅画一样……时间永远停止在这一刻。"
msgstr ""
"Como un cuadro… atrapado para siempre en el mismo "
"tiempo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_map"
msgid "这还真是奇怪。不过好像和我们没什么关系。"
msgstr ""
"Suena raro y todo eso, pero dudo que eso tenga que "
"ver con nosotros."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_4_map"
msgid "那么，朋友，再去帮忙找找欧兰特的图鉴吧！"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, amigo, ¡Sigamos buscando ese Almanaque!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_5_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第5天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 5 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid "啊哈！我们终于找到欧兰特的图鉴了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ajá! ¡Por fin encontramos el Almanaque de Orant!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid "真的！这是……我的图鉴！"
msgstr "¡Sí! ¡Este es… mi Almanaque!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid "谢谢……不过，你们应该比我更需要这个图鉴吧。"
msgstr ""
"Gracias… Pero, tal vez ustedes lo necesiten más "
"que yo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid "嗯？"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid ""
"……这个图鉴会自动记录遇到的所有器械、怪物，是个非常"
"方便的东西。"
msgstr ""
"...Este almanaque registrará automáticamente "
"artilugios, monstruos y otra información con la "
"que te vaya topando, es una herramienta realmente "
"conveniente."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid "如果是你们的话，应该能发挥它最大的作用。"
msgstr ""
"Creo que ustedes podrían sacarle mucho más "
"provecho."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid ""
"同时为了表达对你们的感谢，这本图鉴就送你们吧。"
msgstr ""
"Para demostrar mi gratitud… por favor, acéptenlo "
"como regalo."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group halloween_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_over"
msgid "哦，是吗？那我们就收下吧！"
msgstr "¿En serio? ¡Qué genial! ¡Muchas gracias!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_5_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第5天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 5 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid ""
"对了，说起来……你们是为什么跟着地图来到这里的？"
msgstr ""
"Hmm… Ya que estamos, ¿Por qué siguieron ese mapa "
"hasta aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "啊！我差点忘了！"
msgstr "¡Ah, casi lo olvido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid ""
"我们要去另一个叫做幻想乡的世界！所以在四处寻找方"
"法！"
msgstr ""
"¡Queremos ir a otro mundo llamado Gensokyo! "
"¡Llevamos tiempo buscando una forma de llegar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "去……另一个世界是吗。正好，我这里有一个方法。"
msgstr ""
"Ir a… otro mundo… Ya veo. En realidad, sí tengo un "
"método para eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid ""
"我有一把神奇的钥匙，它能够打开梦境之门，并与其他的"
"世界联通。"
msgstr ""
"Tengo una llave mágica que puede abrir un portal "
"hacia el Mundo de los Sueños… la cual conecta con "
"otros mundos."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "是么？那么，可以帮忙把我们送到那里么？"
msgstr ""
"¡Oooh, ¿en serio?! ¿Entonces podrías ayudarnos a "
"llegar?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "唔……说实话，我也有点难处……"
msgstr "Eh… Para ser sincera, eso será difícil."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "那把钥匙被抢走了。"
msgstr "Esa llave fue robada."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "……？被抢走了？"
msgstr "¿...? ¿Robada?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "我在附近巡逻的时候，遭到了一个……怪物的袭击。"
msgstr ""
"Mientras patrullaba cerca de aquí, fui atacada por "
"un… monstruo."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid ""
"那个怪物……过于强大，我只能逃跑。在那时候，钥匙就被"
"抢走了。"
msgstr ""
"Ese monstruo era tan fuerte que lo único que pude "
"hacer fue huir. Y fue entonces cuando me robaron "
"la llave."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group halloween_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_5_map"
msgid "噢，天哪，这可真是不妙！"
msgstr "…Eso no suena nada bien."

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_6
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第6天入场"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 6 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6"
msgid ""
"虽然很不幸钥匙丢了，但还是注意一下今天的作战吧！"
msgstr ""
"Lo de la llave fue una lástima… ¡Pero deja eso de "
"lado y concéntrate en la pelea de hoy!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6"
msgid "今天开始下暴雨了，天色一片昏暗！"
msgstr ""
"¡La tormenta ruge, y el cielo está completamente "
"oscuro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6"
msgid ""
"虽然今天没有任何的僵尸，但要命的是，幽灵现在能完全"
"隐形了！"
msgstr ""
"Hoy no hay zombis, ¡Pero no ignores a los "
"fantasmas! ¡Algunos pueden volverse completamente "
"invisibles!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6"
msgid "不过不要怕，我们还是能用闪电的光发现它们！"
msgstr ""
"¡No temas! Aún podemos detectarlos con los "
"relámpagos: su luz los delata."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6"
msgid ""
"拿起你的铁剑砍掉他们！不过注意不要砍到路过的好幽"
"灵，不然它们会惩罚你！"
msgstr ""
"¡Toma tu espada y lánzate al combate! Pero "
"cuidado: si atacas a los fantasmas inocentes que "
"solo están de paso… te castigarán."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6"
msgid "让我们来猎杀那些陷入黑暗的人吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ahora, vamos a cazar a los que han caído en la "
"oscuridad!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_6_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第6天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 6 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_over"
msgid "艺术就是爆炸！"
msgstr ""
"¡Feliz cumpleaños! ¡Aquí tienes tu pastel "
"explosivo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_over"
msgid ""
"这个是TNT！在你触发他之后，他就会爆炸，炸飞周围的所"
"有敌人！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esto es la TNT! Cuando la actives, hará ¡BOOM!, y "
"destruirá a todos los enemigos cercanos."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_over"
msgid "什么？怎么触发？"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Que cómo se activa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_over"
msgid "下一次，我们就来试试吧！"
msgstr "¡Je, je, je, ya te enseñaré luego!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_6_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第6天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 6 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_map"
msgid "所以，是什么怪物袭击了你？"
msgstr ""
"Entonces… ¿Qué clase de monstruo fue el que te "
"atacó?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_map"
msgid ""
"一个巨大而又强壮的可怕尸体怪物，它的身上充满了电"
"流。它被叫做——科学怪人的怪物。"
msgstr ""
"Un ser enorme, terrible, con un cuerpo parecido al "
"de un zombi, cargado con una cantidad colosal de "
"electricidad. Se le conoce como el Monstruo del "
"Frankenstein."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_map"
msgid "科学怪人？但那只是个小说故事啊！"
msgstr ""
"¿¡Frankenstein!? ¡Pero si eso es de una novela de "
"ficción!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_map"
msgid "我也以为是……但它真的存在。"
msgstr "Yo también lo creía… pero es real."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_map"
msgid "很抱歉我疏忽了，事情本不应该是这样。"
msgstr ""
"Lamento mi negligencia. Esto no debería haber "
"terminado así."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_map"
msgid "没事，只需要把钥匙抢回来就可以了！"
msgstr ""
"¡No te preocupes! ¡Solo tenemos que recuperar la "
"llave!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_6_map"
msgid "如果你们想和那个怪物战斗的话，请务必小心。"
msgstr ""
"Si deseas enfrentarte a ese monstruo… por favor, "
"ten mucho cuidado."

#. Archive name for talk group trigger_tutorial
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "触发教程"
msgstr "Tutorial de Engranaje"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group trigger_tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:trigger_tutorial"
msgid "好了！今天我来教你如何触发器械！"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, para empezar, ¡Déjame enseñarte cómo "
"activar tus artilugios!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group trigger_tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:trigger_tutorial"
msgid "那么，现在来开始吧！"
msgstr "¡Muy bien, inténtalo ahora!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_7
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第7天入场"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 7 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7"
msgid "另外，朋友！我们之前拿到了欧兰特的图鉴！"
msgstr ""
"Además, vecino, ¡Ya hemos conseguido el Almanaque "
"de Orant antes!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7"
msgid ""
"图鉴的作用不止是记录见到的东西，它同时还是一个制"
"品！"
msgstr ""
"El Almanaque no sólo sirve para registrar lo que "
"hemos visto, ¡Sino que también es un artefacto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7"
msgid ""
"携带的制品可以为你在一整局对战中提供额外的效果！"
msgstr ""
"¡Los artefactos que llevas pueden proporcionar "
"efectos adicionales durante la batalla!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7"
msgid "好好利用制品吧！"
msgstr "¡Asegúrate de hacer buen uso de ellos!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_7_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第7天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 7 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_over"
msgid "我会夺取你的灵魂！"
msgstr "¡Tu alma será mía!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_over"
msgid ""
"看吧，灵魂熔炉！它能发射致命的灵魂火球，击中后还会"
"焚烧一群敌人！"
msgstr ""
"¡Contempla el Horno de Almas! Lanza bolas de fuego "
"de alma MORTALES que queman grupos de enemigos al "
"impactar."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_over"
msgid ""
"但代价是什么？它需要牺牲前方的器械来当作它的燃料！"
msgstr ""
"¿Pero a qué precio? ¡Necesita que sacrifiques el "
"artilugio que esté justo frente a él como "
"combustible!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_over"
msgid "让怪物们下地狱吧！"
msgstr "¡Que los enemigos ARDAN EN EL INFIERNO!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_7_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第7天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 7 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_map"
msgid "所以，那个钥匙实际上是个什么样的东西呢？"
msgstr "Sobre esa llave… ¿Exactamente qué es?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_map"
msgid "那个东西叫做梦境钥匙。"
msgstr "Esa llave se llama la Llave del Sueño."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_map"
msgid ""
"梦境钥匙是我们这里能够进入到其他世界的方法之一，它"
"能够让人进入到不同世界的梦境。"
msgstr ""
"La Llave del Sueño te permite entrar al mundo "
"onírico de otros mundos."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_map"
msgid ""
"然后从梦境再转折到那个世界的现实，以达到穿梭世界的"
"目的。"
msgstr ""
"Con lo que, desde ese sueño, puedes cruzar hacia "
"la realidad de ese mundo… logrando viajar a él por "
"completo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_map"
msgid "真是个神奇的东西啊！"
msgstr "¡Eso suena increíble!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_7_map"
msgid "如果有它的话，我们就能进入到幻想乡了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Si la conseguimos, seguro podremos ir a Gensokyo!"

#. Archive name for talk group seventh_slot
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "蓝图槽位交易"
msgstr "Trato de ranura"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group seventh_slot's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:seventh_slot"
msgid "嘿邻居！我寻思你需要第七个器械槽位了！"
msgstr ""
"Antes de empezar, ¡Seguro que necesitarás una "
"séptima ranura para artilugios!"

#. Archive text for talk group seventh_slot's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "如果金钱足够"
msgstr "En caso de tener el dinero"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group seventh_slot's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:seventh_slot"
msgid "只要$750，怎么样？"
msgstr "¿$750 por el séptimo puesto? ¿Qué te parece?"

#. Archive text for talk group seventh_slot's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "如果金钱不足"
msgstr "En caso de no tener el dinero"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group seventh_slot's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:seventh_slot"
msgid "需要$750，但你的钱不够啊！"
msgstr ""
"¿$750 por el séptimo puesto?, pero... Parece que "
"andas algo pobretón..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group seventh_slot's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:seventh_slot"
msgid "在你攒到足够的钱之后，再回这个关卡吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Vuelve a este nivel cuando consigas el dinero "
"suficiente!"

#. Archive text for talk group seventh_slot's section 3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "如果成交"
msgstr "En caso de aceptar"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group seventh_slot's section 3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:seventh_slot"
msgid "这场交易真是大快人心！"
msgstr "¡Trato hecho, que tenga una excelente noche!"

#. Archive text for talk group seventh_slot's section 4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "如果拒绝"
msgstr "En caso de rechazar"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group seventh_slot's section 4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:seventh_slot"
msgid "真可惜！如果你又想要了，再回到这个关卡吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Qué lástima! Si cambias de opinión, ¡Vuelve a "
"este nivel!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_8_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第8天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 8 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_8_over"
msgid "完美而潇洒的发射器参上！"
msgstr ""
"¡El Dispensador perfecto y elegante ya está aquí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_8_over"
msgid ""
"这是银制发射器！它的利刃可以刺穿肉体，造成更高的伤"
"害！还可以穿透任何不是很硬的物体！"
msgstr ""
"¡Aquí viene el Dispensador Plateado! ¡Dispara "
"cuchillos que pueden perforar carne y infligir un "
"gran daño! ¡Además pueden atravesar todo que no "
"sea duro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_8_over"
msgid "试一试时停的正确用法吧！"
msgstr "¡Ya es hora de mostrarle esto al mundo!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_9
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第9天入场"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 9 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_9"
msgid "那个……我觉得应该提醒你们一下。"
msgstr ""
"Escucha... creo que deberías estar advertido."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_9"
msgid "这片墓地包括死去的死灵法师。"
msgstr ""
"Algunos Nigromantes fueron enterrados bajo este "
"cementerio."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_9"
msgid "虽然他们已经死去，但是死灵巫术的能力仍在。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque estén muertos, su magia prohibida sigue "
"latente."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_9"
msgid ""
"如果它们也复活了，恐怕你要见识一下他们那些禁忌的魔"
"法了。"
msgstr ""
"Si se levantan… verás de primera mano lo que es la "
"necromancia sin control."

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_9_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第9天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 9 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_9_over"
msgid "有没有想起三个月亮的疯狂？"
msgstr ""
"¿Recuerdas a esa hada payasa salida del infierno?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_9_over"
msgid ""
"魔术箱！它会吃掉前方的一个怪物，然后自己变成一个星"
"之碎片！"
msgstr ""
"¡El Cofre Mágico! ¡Se traga al monstruo que tiene "
"delante y luego se transforma en un Fragmento "
"Estelar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_9_over"
msgid "谁渴望来一场华丽的表演？"
msgstr "¿Quién quiere un espectáculo de magia?"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_note
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣节邀请函"
msgstr "Invitación de Halloween"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_note"
msgid "一封邀请函！僵尸发来的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Una invitación! ¡De parte de los zombis! ¡A una "
"fiesta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_note"
msgid "这……字好难看啊。"
msgstr "Esa… esa letra es horrible."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_note"
msgid ""
"等等，射击……和电弧？这正是那个怪物的攻击手段！"
msgstr ""
"Espera… ¿Rayos eléctricos y disparos? ¡Así ataca "
"ese monstruo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_note"
msgid "可能……你们会迎来一场恶战了。"
msgstr ""
"Me parece que… lo que nos espera no será una "
"fiesta cualquiera."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_note"
msgid "嘿，邻居，你难道会错过这次机会吗？肯定不会！"
msgstr "¡Vecino! ¡Esto no nos lo podemos perder!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_11
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第11天入场"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 11 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11"
msgid "在我们开始之前，这里有一些战斗的提示！"
msgstr ""
"Antes de empezar, un gran consejo para enfrentarte "
"a jefes:"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11"
msgid "尝试找出那家伙可以做什么，会做什么！"
msgstr ""
"¡Fíjate bien en los movimientos raros y busca con "
"qué contraatacarlos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11"
msgid "总会有东西是拿来反制它的！明白了嘛？"
msgstr ""
"Ya sabes, algunas cosas con que contrarrestar eso, "
"¿Me sigues?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11"
msgid "记住，在这场战斗中，灵魂熔炉至关重要。"
msgstr ""
"También considera con cuidado qué artilugios "
"sacrificar… y cuáles no."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11"
msgid ""
"并且据我所知，TNT可以吸收闪电，并且在那之后会变得非"
"常……危险。"
msgstr ""
"He notado que los bloques de TNT pueden absorber "
"rayos… y volverse muy peligrosos."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11"
msgid "让我们好好利用它们吧！"
msgstr "¡Entonces usémoslo a nuestro favor, vecino!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_11_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第11天结束"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 11 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_over"
msgid "这是我的梦境钥匙！你们做到了！"
msgstr "¡Mi Llave del Sueño! ¡Lo lograste!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_over"
msgid "怪物也已经回到属于他的地方去了。"
msgstr ""
"Con eso, ese monstruo también regresó al lugar al "
"que pertenece."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_over"
msgid "我由衷地感谢你们至今为我做的一切。"
msgstr ""
"Estoy sinceramente agradecida por todo lo que has "
"hecho hasta ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_over"
msgid ""
"这种事怎么弄得着感谢？我们只是我做了我们该做的罢"
"了！"
msgstr ""
"¡No hay de qué, solo hicimos lo que teníamos que "
"hacer!"

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_11_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜第11天地图"
msgstr "Halloween Noche 11 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "再次表达我对你们的感谢。"
msgstr "Una vez más… gracias por todo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "按照约定，我会把你们传送到幻想乡。"
msgstr ""
"Como prometí, ahora los teletransportaré a "
"Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "嘿！伙计，我们终于到那里了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Vecino! ¡Al fin vamos a ir hacia Gensokyo de "
"verdad!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "不过有两件事需要注意。"
msgstr ""
"Pero antes, hay dos cosas que deben tener en "
"cuenta."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid ""
"一是，这把钥匙只能把你们送到那里的梦境世界，要去那"
"里的现实还需要你们自己努力。"
msgstr ""
"Primero: esta llave solo puede enviarlos al Mundo "
"de los Sueños. Si quieren llegar al Gensokyo, "
"tendrán que encontrar un método para cruzar a su "
"mundo físico."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "二是……幻想乡那里现在十分的混乱。"
msgstr "Segundo… Gensokyo está hecho un desastre."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "嗯？那是为什么？"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Por qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid ""
"如你所见，这里凭空出现了很多怪物，而且它们都是方形"
"的。"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente han empezado a aparecer muchos "
"monstruos extraños… Todos tienen formas cuadradas, "
"como si vinieran de otro mundo."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid ""
"幻想乡也被这些方形怪物入侵了，现在那里的现实已经乱"
"成一片。"
msgstr ""
"Esos seres invadieron Gensokyo, y ahora su "
"realidad está sumida en el caos."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "不过，如果是你们的话，应该可以解决这些吧？"
msgstr ""
"Pero si por ustedes llegan… tal vez puedan cambiar "
"el rumbo de ese mundo."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "看来，我们的战斗还有很长的路要走啊！"
msgstr ""
"¡Parece que nuestra aventura todavía tiene cuerda "
"para rato!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group halloween_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_11_map"
msgid "那么，我这就准备传送门，祝你们好运。"
msgstr ""
"Así es… Prepararé el portal. Les deseo mucha "
"suerte… a los dos."

#. Archive name for talk group halloween_final
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "万圣夜临别"
msgstr "Despedida de Halloween"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group halloween_final's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_final"
msgid "传送门已经准备好了，已经可以出发了。"
msgstr ""
"El portal está listo. Ahora pueden continuar su "
"viaje."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group halloween_final's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_final"
msgid "那……祝你们好运。"
msgstr "Entonces… les deseo buena suerte."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group halloween_final's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_final"
msgid "嘿，邻居！我们终于可以去到幻想乡了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Llegó la hora, vecino! ¡Empecemos nuestra "
"travesía hacia Gensokyo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group halloween_final's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_final"
msgid "一起来吧！"
msgstr "¡Allá vamos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_final's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_final"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Description for talk sentence 4 in talk group halloween_final's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（史蒂夫和村民前往了梦境世界。）"
msgstr ""
"(Steve y el Aldeano va hacían el Mundo de los "
"Sueños)."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group halloween_final's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:halloween_final"
msgid "该你出场的时候了，朋友。"
msgstr "Buen viaje, amigos…"

#. Archive name for talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "第四章-访问香霖堂"
msgstr "Capítulo 4-Visita a Kourindou"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "昨晚久违地做了一次梦，还梦到了哆来咪小姐。"
msgstr ""
"Anoche, tuve mi primer sueño de mucho, mucho "
"tiempo. Incluso vi a la Señorita Doremy."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "哦，怎么样？她跟你说了什么？"
msgstr "Oh, ¿Qué tal? ¿Qué te dijo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"她看到了我在辉针城的的那些功绩，还夸奖了我，昨晚因"
"此还睡得格外舒服。"
msgstr ""
"Ella vio todo lo que hicimos en el Castillo. Ella "
"también me elogió. Dormí excepcionalmente bien "
"anoche gracias a eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"哆来咪小姐是梦境世界的管理者吧？好慈祥的人啊，跟妈"
"妈一样。"
msgstr ""
"¿Esa Señorita Doremy es la gobernante de Mundo de "
"los Sueño, verdad? Suena como una persona bastante "
"benévola, casi como una madre."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "说起来，戴夫。"
msgstr "Hablando de eso, Dave"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "咋了？"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"我想起来，我们离开梦境世界前，好像捡到过一张纸条。"
msgstr ""
"Creo que recuerdo que recogí esa nota cuando nos "
"fuimos del Mundo de los Sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"之前那上面的字因为梦境的原因完全看不清，所以只能放"
"起来了。"
msgstr ""
"En ese momento, no pude entender ninguna de las "
"palabras debido al que estábamos en un sueño, así "
"que lo guardé."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"现在已经离开梦境世界了，我挺好奇上面究竟写了什么。"
msgstr ""
"Ahora que no estamos allí, realmente me muero de "
"curiosidad que tiene escrito ahí."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "那张纸条应该在你身上来着，看看吧。"
msgstr ""
"Deberías tener la nota contigo. Echémosle un "
"vistazo."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "哦！说的是！我差点就把它给忘了！"
msgstr "¡Ah, cierto! ¡Casi se me olvida!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "好！让我看看！"
msgstr "¡Bien! ¡Voy a echarle una miradita!"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "……！"
msgstr "...¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "怎、怎么了？"
msgstr "¿Qu-qué pasa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "……啊！没啥！"
msgstr "...¡Ah! ¡Nada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "不是什么重要的东西，我来处理就行！"
msgstr ""
"¡Solo son palabrerías sin importancia! No te "
"preocupes, me desharé de esto por ti!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "……？让我看看？"
msgstr "...¿? ¿Puedo verla?"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "好了，我先收起来吧！"
msgstr "¡No, está bien! ¡Lo guardaré por ahora!"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "<color=blue>（……太可疑了！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(...¡Algo está pasando "
"definitivamente!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "打扰了，史蒂夫在这吗？"
msgstr "Disculpai mi intrusión. ¿Está Steve aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "啊，我在，您是？"
msgstr "Ese seria yo. ¿Con quién tengo el gusto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"吾乃物部 布都，受神子大人之命，请汝来到命莲寺地下的"
"祀庙遗址帮我们清除异变。"
msgstr ""
"Futo, soy Descendiente del Clan Mononobe. El "
"Príncipe de la Corona me ha mandado suplicar vuesa "
"ayuda en el incidente acaecido bajo el Templo "
"Myouren."

#. Description for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（布都出场）"
msgstr "(Futo aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "不知汝意向如何？"
msgstr "Decidme, ¿Qué respondéis vos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "命莲寺？那里发生了什么？"
msgstr "¿Templo Myouren? ¿Qué esta pasando ahí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"命莲寺后方即是一片大墓地，久之，其地下埋藏吾们用于"
"复活的梦殿大祀庙，如今已经成了遗址。"
msgstr ""
"Hacia la parte postrera del Templo Myouren se "
"halla un vasto camposanto. Debajo yace el Gran "
"Mausoleo del Salón de los Sueños, del cual nos "
"servimos para resucitarnos ha largo tiempo. Desde "
"entonces, tornóse en lugar histórico."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"之后，那里又曾用于封印一只巨型僵尸，吾们称其为“巨"
"人”。如今封印薄弱，束缚即将打破。"
msgstr ""
"Después desto, volvió a emplearse para sellar a un "
"zombi grande, llamado el “Gigante”. Mas hoy día, "
"el sello hállase debilitado, casi a punto de "
"deshacerse."

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"吾们听说了汝于辉针城的事迹，特此托汝前往，铲除此"
"怪。"
msgstr ""
"Nuevas nos han llegado de vuestras proezas en el "
"Castillo Shining Needle, y por ende os requerimos "
"que nos prestéis vuestro socorro para desterrar "
"tales monstruos."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（……文绉绉的，有点听不懂。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(...Es detallada, aunque un poco "
"difícil de entender).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"总之，命莲寺的底下有一只巨型僵尸要突破封印了，要我"
"们帮忙，对吗？"
msgstr ""
"En resumen, hay un zombi gigante debajo del Templo "
"Myouren que está a punto de liberarse, y necesitas "
"nuestra ayuda. ¿Es eso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "是。"
msgstr "Efectivamente."

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"好的，我搞清楚了，那稍等我们一会，之后带我们去那里"
"吧。"
msgstr ""
"Bien, entiendo la situación. Solo deme unos "
"momentos."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_1"
msgid "是，随时恭候阁下大驾光临！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ciertamente, con gran anhelo aguardaremos vuestra "
"venida!"

#. Archive name for talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "第四章-离开香霖堂"
msgstr "Capítulo 4-Abandonado Kourindou"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "差不多该走了。布都，带我们去吧。"
msgstr "Es hora de irnos. Guíanos, Futo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "遵命。"
msgstr "Claro."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "到了，此处乃是吾们梦殿大祀庙上方的墓地。"
msgstr ""
"Ya hemos arribado. Esta es nuestra morada, la cual "
"se alza sobre el Gran Mausoleo del Salón de los "
"Sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "嗯？那边好像有人？"
msgstr "¿Hm? ¿Esa persona de ahí es...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "那个人是——魔理沙？她在这里干什么？"
msgstr "¿Esa no es... Marisa? ¿Ella qué hace aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "嗯？"
msgstr "¿Oh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "生面孔呢，你们是？"
msgstr ""
"No los he visto a ustedes ronda aquí antes. "
"¿Quiénes son?"

#. Description for talk sentence 6 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（魔理沙出场）"
msgstr "(Marisa aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid ""
"你好，我们是前来帮助你们清除僵尸的人，这位——大鼻子"
"也是。"
msgstr ""
"Hola, tenemos a quienes pediste que te ayudaran a "
"eliminar a los zombis. Eso incluye al Sr. Nariz "
"Larga."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid ""
"原来是你们啊，我听说过你们的事迹。是把针妙丸从亡灵"
"的手中救出来了吧？"
msgstr ""
"Oh, son ustedes. He oído hablar de ustedes. "
"Salvaron a Shinmyoumaru de esos no muertos, "
"¿verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "是的。"
msgstr "Lo somos."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid ""
"没想到你年纪轻轻，就能做出如此惊人之事啊。真是不可"
"思议daze⭐。"
msgstr ""
"Mmm, no esperaba que todos esos logros asombrosos "
"pertenecieran a alguien tan joven. Un verdadero "
"misterio, ¿verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "那么，魔理沙小姐在干什么呢？"
msgstr "Entonces ¿Qué haces aquí, Marisa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "……扫墓。"
msgstr "...Visitando a un amigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "扫墓？"
msgstr "¿Amigo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "霖之助的衣冠冢。"
msgstr ""
"El monumento conmemorativo de Rinnosuke está aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid ""
"香霖这个笨蛋，仗着自己的体质就去冒险。结果成了这个"
"样子。"
msgstr ""
"El idiota decidió arriesgar su cuello en alguna "
"aventura, y, bueno, así fue como terminó."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid ""
"每年的这一天，我都会来这里一趟，前来纪念这个家伙。"
"今天正好是他失踪的那一天啊。"
msgstr ""
"Se ha convertido en una tradición anual para mí "
"visitar este lugar en este día, en su memoria. Hoy "
"es el día de su desaparición."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "很抱歉提到了你的伤心往事。"
msgstr ""
"Mis condolencias. No quise revivir viejas heridas."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "没事啦，都让它过去吧。"
msgstr "Está bien, está bien. No pienses en ello."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "我也该离开了，再见喽。"
msgstr "Bueno, ya es hora de que me vaya. Nos vemos."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group exited_kourindou_mausoleum's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:exited_kourindou_mausoleum"
msgid "好了，布都，我们继续吧。"
msgstr "Bien, hasta la próxima. Sigamos, Futo."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第1天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 1 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1"
msgid "布都，你们到了？"
msgstr "Ah, ya has vuelto, Futo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1"
msgid "很好，史蒂夫先生，我们现在需要你的帮助。"
msgstr ""
"Bien, bien. Tú debes ser Steve. Necesitamos de tu "
"ayuda."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"详细内容我从布都那里听说了，要清除这里的怪物，保证"
"封印能够正常巩固不受干扰，是吧。"
msgstr ""
"Futo ya me dio todos los detalles. Eliminar a "
"todos los monstruos presentes y asegurar de que el "
"sello permanezca intacto y en buen estado. ¿Se me "
"escapa algo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1"
msgid "是的。"
msgstr "No, eso es todo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1"
msgid ""
"那么，眼前的这些僵尸，就交给我的邻居了，加油吧！"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, seguro que mi vecino sabe qué hacer con "
"esos zombis que se nos acercan. ¡Mucha suerte!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_1_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第1天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 1 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_over"
msgid "这是音符盒！"
msgstr "¡Este es el Bloque de Notas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_over"
msgid ""
"它能发射近程的音符，音符会在音符盒和敌人之间来回反"
"弹！"
msgstr ""
"¡Dispara notas musicales de corto alcance que "
"rebotan entre sí junto al enemigo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_over"
msgid ""
"也就是说，它与敌人的距离越近，造成的伤害就越高！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es decir, cuanto más cerca esté un enemigo, más "
"daño recibirá!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_over"
msgid "让怪物们听听这美妙的音乐吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Darles a estos monstruos una melodía digna de "
"premios!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_1_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第1天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 1 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid ""
"辛苦你了，果真和传闻中的一样，击杀怪物不费吹灰之"
"力。"
msgstr ""
"Buen trabajo. Es como dicen los rumores, tú "
"mataste todos esos monstruos como si nada."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "之后还有几天需要您的帮助，届时就拜托您了。"
msgstr ""
"Contamos contigo también los próximos días. Espero "
"que no sea mucha molestia."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "明白了。"
msgstr "No, no hay problema."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "以及，我想问您一些问题。"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, ¿Me permitirías hacerte un par de "
"preguntas?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "您和这位……白袍先生是什么关系？"
msgstr ""
"El... hombre que trajiste contigo. ¿Es tu amigo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid ""
"这位叫戴夫，是我的养父，曾经是一名村庄的图书管理"
"员。"
msgstr ""
"Lo puedes llamar Dave. Él es mi padre adoptivo, "
"suele trabajar de librero en la aldea."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid ""
"而我并不是戴夫世界的人，是从外界流落进来的，和其他"
"人都不一样，因此其他人都害怕我。"
msgstr ""
"Y no pertenezco en el mundo de Dave. Vengo de otro "
"mundo, así que todos me tienen miedo porque no soy "
"como ellos."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "只有戴夫接受了我，把我当作他的孩子一样对待。"
msgstr ""
"Dave es el único que me aceptó y me trató como su "
"propio hijo."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "我明白了。另外，您的右臂是义肢吗？"
msgstr ""
"Ya veo. Por cierto, ¿Tu brazo derecho es una "
"prótesis?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "嗯，是的。"
msgstr "...Sí... Lo es"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid ""
"不知道什么时候，我失去了右手，然后就陷入了昏迷。"
msgstr ""
"No estoy seguro de cuándo sucedió, pero perdí mi "
"brazo derecho y caí en coma."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "等我醒来之后，我的右手就已经是这个样子了。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando desperté, vi que mi brazo derecho fue "
"reemplazado."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "发生了什么吗？"
msgstr "¿Fue un accidente?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "我想不太起来了。"
msgstr "Para mí todo está borroso."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid ""
"我只记得，我醒来的时候，我的手臂变得非常陌生。"
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que recuerdo es despertar y sentir mi "
"brazo derecho como si no fuera mío."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "然后，戴夫，他突然就变得疯疯癫癫的。"
msgstr ""
"Desde entonces, a Dave le faltan un par de "
"tornillos."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "我才不疯呢！"
msgstr "¡Tonterías! ¡Mis tornillos SIGUEN intactos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "说起来，我来到这里，也是因为你啊。"
msgstr ""
"Ahora que lo pienso, venir aquí también fue por "
"ti, ¿eh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid ""
"你之前天天说什么幻想乡幻想乡，我本来以为这种地方真"
"的不存在。"
msgstr ""
"No parabas de hablar de Gensokyo esto, Gensokyo "
"aquello. Pensé que era imposible que existiera un "
"lugar así."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "结果居然真的有这种地方。"
msgstr "Con lo que... bueno, mira dónde estamos."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "当然，我可是坑爹村民啊，邻居！"
msgstr ""
"¡Exacto! ¡No me llaman Aldeano Loco por nada, "
"vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "戴夫，你什么时候才能好起来呢？"
msgstr ""
"En serio, Dave. ¿Cuándo volverás a la normalidad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group mausoleum_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_1_map"
msgid "我还是希望你能再叫我一声孩子……"
msgstr ""
"Todavía prefiero que me llamen \"el niño\"..."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第2天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 2 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"啊，似乎出现了新的怪物，一种手持魔法障壁的僵尸。"
msgstr ""
"Ah, semeja que un nuevo enemigo se cierne sobre "
"nos, un zombi que empuña una barrera arcana."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2"
msgid "此种障壁吾曾见过，乃是回声障壁，可反弹射弹。"
msgstr ""
"Ya había visto una barrera tal con anterioridad. "
"Era una barrera de ecos, capaz de tornar contra su "
"emisor de los proyectiles."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2"
msgid "原来是能够反弹子弹的僵尸啊，多谢你提醒我。"
msgstr ""
"Vaya, entonces este zombi es capaz de regresar "
"proyectiles. Gracias por el aviso."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"不必多礼。不过，其实看着汝战斗，吾有很多地方都看不"
"懂。比如——"
msgstr ""
"Ruego que no le deis mayor importancia. Mas, a "
"decir verdad, hallo no pocos aspectos de vuestras "
"batallas harto desconcertantes. Por ejemplo…"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2"
msgid "“器械”是何物？"
msgstr "¿Qué es ese “artilugio” de que habláis vos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2"
msgid "要不我们之后再解释吧？"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué tal si lo dejamos eso para otro momento?"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_2_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第2天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 2 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_over"
msgid "这是闪电之珠！"
msgstr "¡Este es el Orbe Relámpago!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_over"
msgid "它能够阻挡怪物的前进，并且免疫对方的子弹！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esto detiene el avance de ls monstruos, además de "
"anular los proyectiles enemigos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_over"
msgid ""
"并且，当敌人的子弹击中它时，它反而可以利用它恢复自"
"己的耐久！"
msgstr ""
"¡Incluso, en lugar de recibir daño cuando es "
"golpeado por proyectiles enemigos, puede usarlos "
"para curarse!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_over"
msgid "这可是高阶的法术器械！"
msgstr "¡Un artilugio de alto grado de hechicería!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_2_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第2天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 2 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid "巨人是什么来头？当年发生了什么？"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué es eso del gigante? ¿Qué pasó exactamente "
"hace tantos años?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid ""
"巨人是在两年前突然出现在幻想乡的，那时它伴随着另一"
"只可怕的巨兽同时出现，带来了很多混乱。"
msgstr ""
"Ese gigante apareció en Gensokyo hace dos años, "
"estaba acompañado de otro monstruo gigante. Fue "
"bastante repentino y causó mucho caos."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid ""
"我们和命莲寺势力达成合作，我们制伏了巨人，把它封印"
"在了这里。而命莲寺方面则负责击退那只巨兽。"
msgstr ""
"Se llegó a un acuerdo con el Templo Myouren. "
"Nosotros someteríamos al gigante y lo "
"encerraríamos aquí; ellos se encargarían del otro "
"monstruo gigante."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid "那么，巨人到底是什么？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Qué es exactamente el Gigante?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid "虽说是巨人，但它其实是一群僵尸的集合体。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque se llama el Gigante, es realmente un grupo "
"de zombis fusionados juntos."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid ""
"它体内的某种魔力把它们的血肉融合在了一起，如同软泥"
"一般变化无常，可以变成很多生物的模样。"
msgstr ""
"Una especie de magia en su interior fusionó su "
"carne y sangre en una sola. Puede adoptar "
"múltiples formas, como si fuera arcilla blanda."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid ""
"因为它的这个特点，我们没有什么办法彻底杀死它，只能"
"把它封印在我们之前复活使用的梦殿大祀庙遗址这里。"
msgstr ""
"Esta propiedad en particular es la razón por la "
"que no tenemos forma de destruirla "
"definitivamente. La única solución que teníamos "
"era sellarla donde reconstruimos el Gran Mausoleo."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_2_map"
msgid "是吗，我明白了。"
msgstr "Bien, lo entiendo."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第3天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 3 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3"
msgid "对了，顺带一提。"
msgstr "Ah, debería mencionar..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3"
msgid ""
"战场上的那些笼子是由巨人的魔力产生的，它能召唤新的"
"僵尸。"
msgstr ""
"Esas jaulas que ves en el campo de batalla son "
"producto de la magia del Gigante. Son capaces de "
"invocar nuevos zombis."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3"
msgid ""
"我们所使用的封印魔法比较特殊，它对其他魔力或者生物"
"非常敏感。"
msgstr ""
"La magia que usamos para aplicar el sello era un "
"poco especial. Es bastante sensible a otras "
"criaturas u otras formas de magia."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3"
msgid ""
"如果周围有什么僵尸存在的话，封印很有可能会失败。"
msgstr ""
"Si algún zombi se acerca a él, existe una gran "
"posibilidad de que el sello pierda su efecto."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3"
msgid "这就是我们要去找你的原因。"
msgstr "Por eso tuvimos que pedirte ayuda, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3"
msgid "原来如此，明白了。"
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_3_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第3天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 3 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_over"
msgid "双向发射器登场！"
msgstr "¡Entra nuestro queridísimo Bispensador!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_over"
msgid ""
"它能够像发射器一样向前发射箭矢，并且还可以同时向后"
"方发射双倍的箭矢！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esto dispara enfrente como lo haría un "
"dispensador, pero también dispara doble por detrás!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_over"
msgid "当心你的背后！"
msgstr "¡Mira tu espalda!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_3_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第3天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 3 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "请问，是史蒂夫吗？"
msgstr "Oye jovencito, ¿Tú eres Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "是我，您是？"
msgstr "Ese soy yo. ¿Con quién tengo el gusto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "啊，我是神子的朋友，青娥。"
msgstr "Soy Seiga. Una amiga de Miko."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "史蒂夫小弟弟，我找你有些事情。"
msgstr ""
"Estoy aquí porque tengo algunos asuntos contigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "什么事？"
msgstr "¿Cuáles?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid ""
"听说你正在为神子她们清理僵尸，然后还要帮她们巩固封"
"印，对吧？"
msgstr ""
"He oído que estás ayudando al grupo de Miko a "
"eliminar zombis y reforzar el sello. ¿Es cierto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "是的。"
msgstr "Así es."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "那——我这里有些灵符，交给你。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, aquí tienes algunos talismanes. Consérvalos."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "灵符？这是什么？"
msgstr "¿Qué es esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid ""
"就是能控制僵尸的工具啦，能让僵尸为你们而战哦。"
msgstr ""
"Algo que pueda controlar zombis, ¿Sabes? Puede "
"hacer que luchen por ti."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "这么好用的东西？"
msgstr "Suena demasiado bueno para ser verdad."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "不过，能答应我的一个请求吗？"
msgstr "¿Podrías prometerme una cosa a cambio?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "在神子她们巩固封印的时候，就使用这些灵符吧。"
msgstr "Úsalo cuando estén reforzando el sello. "

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "另外，不要告诉她们哦。"
msgstr ""
"También, no se lo digas a nadie. ¿De acuerdo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "好的。"
msgstr "De acuerdo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "哎呀，真听话啊。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, ciertamente sabes cómo recibir órdenes."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "那么，再见了，小弟弟。"
msgstr "Hasta la próxima, Stevie."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（很可疑啊！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Seguro que aquí pasa algo raro!)</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group mausoleum_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_3_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（我还是不要照她说的做好了……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Probablemente sea mejor que no siga "
"lo que ella me dijo que hiciera...)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第4天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 4 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "有新敌人，似乎道士的力量被它们学了去！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ved ahí un nuevo enemigo! Parece que han "
"alcanzado el poder de los taoístas."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "不，那僵尸看上去似乎更像邪仙？"
msgstr ""
"No, no… por su atavío, más semejase a ermitaños "
"malvados."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "邪仙？"
msgstr "¿Ermitaños Malvados?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "就是会用灵符控制僵尸，行穿墙之术的邪恶仙人！"
msgstr ""
"¡Viles ermitaños que ejercitan artes impías, que "
"atraviesan muros y sojuzgan a los no-muertos "
"mediante talismanes!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "这么说，昨天的那位也是邪仙吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Lo cual significa que ella también era una "
"ermitaña malvada?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "什么？"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4"
msgid "啊，没什么，准备战斗吧！"
msgstr "Ah, nada, nada. ¡Empecemos esta batalla!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_4_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第4天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 4 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_over"
msgid "这是吞噬者！"
msgstr "¡Este es el Devorador!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_over"
msgid "它的内部存在许多圆锯，可以锯掉场上的刷怪笼！"
msgstr ""
"¡Su interior está compuesto por numerosas hojas de "
"sierra, lo que le permite cortar los generadores "
"en el campo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_over"
msgid ""
"并且，它还可以将场上的器械回收，变回一张蓝图！"
msgstr ""
"¡Además, también puede convertir a los artilugios "
"en su estado de planos devuelta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_over"
msgid "好好利用吧！"
msgstr "¡Corre corre que el Devorador viene!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_4_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第4天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 4 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid ""
"你做的很好，史蒂夫。明天我们应该就能重新封印巨人"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Lo has hecho bien, Steve. Deberíamos poder volver "
"a sellar al Gigante mañana."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid "那就好。"
msgstr "Eso es bueno."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid "对了，关于这场异变的源头，你们知道些什么吗？"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, ¿Tienes alguna idea sobre el origen de "
"este incidente?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid ""
"嗯……很抱歉，我们常在仙界，对这些事情不是很了解。"
msgstr ""
"Hm... Lo siento, pero a menudo nos quedamos en el "
"reino de los ermitaños, por lo que no sabemos "
"mucho sobre todo esto."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid "不过，我可以告诉你们一些我所知的事情。"
msgstr "Sin embargo, puedo contarles lo poco que sé."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid "是什么呢？"
msgstr "Me interesa, cuenta."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid "这场异变开始的时候，大概是三年前。"
msgstr "El incidente comenzó hace unos tres años."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid ""
"而在更早的四年前，幻想乡突然出现了两位外界来的旅"
"人。"
msgstr ""
"Hace cuatro años, antes de eso, dos forasteros "
"llegaron repentinamente a Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid ""
"据说一位身材娇小，且十分聪慧。另一位好像很擅长和机"
"械打交道。"
msgstr ""
"Oí que uno de ellos era bastante bajo y muy "
"inteligente. El otro parecía experto en artilugios."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid ""
"他们来到这里，与这里的许多人类和妖怪都交流过，并在"
"这里行商，带来一些从没见过的东西。"
msgstr ""
"Interactuaron con muchos humanos y youkai después "
"de llegar aquí, e incluso abrieron una tienda, "
"trayendo cosas que nunca habíamos visto antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid ""
"但是，不久之后，异变就发生了。并且他们两个"
"<color=red>再也没有出现在幻想乡过</color>。"
msgstr ""
"Pero poco después, ocurrió el incidente y esos dos "
"fueron <color=red>nunca se volvieron a ver en "
"Gensokyo</color>."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid "我怀疑他们两个和这场异变有很大的关系。"
msgstr ""
"Sospecho que este incidente está muy relacionado "
"con ellos."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid ""
"我所知道的和异变有关的事情，大概就只有这些了。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque ese es el alcance de mi conocimiento sobre "
"este incidente."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_4_map"
msgid "好，感谢帮忙。"
msgstr "Bien. Aprecio esa información."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_5
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第5天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 5 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5"
msgid "差不多了，马上就要到重新封印巨人的时候了。"
msgstr ""
"Pronto volveremos a aplicar el sello al Gigante."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5"
msgid "在这场战斗结束后，巨人将再度得到封印。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando esta batalla termine, el Gigante quedará "
"sellado una vez más."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5"
msgid ""
"史蒂夫，到时候你的工作就完成了，非常感谢你的帮忙。"
msgstr ""
"Ese sería el fin de tu trabajo aquí, Steve. Nos "
"has hecho un gran favor."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5"
msgid "嗯，我了解了。"
msgstr "Has sido gusto servile, Señorita Miko."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_5_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第5天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 5 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_over"
msgid "命令方块回来了！"
msgstr "¡El Bloque de Comandos ha VUELTO!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_over"
msgid ""
"它能够模仿任意的普通器械，并且允许你在一场战斗中携"
"带两份同样的器械！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es capaz de imitar cualquier artilugio normal, lo "
"que te permite llevar dos del mismo artilugio a la "
"batalla!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_over"
msgid "这两份器械的充能时间分开计算！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero estos dos artilugios tienen temporizadores "
"de recarga separados!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_over"
msgid "不过不要在服务器里乱用，小心被封号！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero ten cuidado con lo que haces con ellos en "
"los servidores! ¡No quiero que te baneen!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_5_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第5天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 5 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "好了，是时候该重新封印巨人了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Muy bien, ya es hora de volver a sellar al "
"Gigante!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "布都，屠自古，听令！"
msgstr "¡Futo, Tojiko, en formación!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "在！"
msgstr "¡Listo!"

#. Speaker Name for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "character.name"
msgid "屠自古"
msgstr "Tojiko"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "看起来没有我什么事了呀！"
msgstr "Bueno, ¡Parece que no tengo que hacer nada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（呼，终于能轻松一些了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Finalmente un momento de descanso).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（这些灵符，都不知道有啥奇怪的效果。）"
"</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Me pregunto qué tipo de efecto "
"extraño tendrán estos talismanes).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（鬼才会相信她呢！）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¡Ni hablar la creería!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "等等，怎么回事！"
msgstr "Espera, ¡Eso no está bien!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（灵符——自己飞走了！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Los talismanes... ¡Volaron solos!)</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "等等——"
msgstr "Espera—"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "什么——"
msgstr "¿Qué—"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "喔嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷！"
msgstr "GRRRRRAAAAARRRRRGH!"

#. Speaker Name for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "character.name"
msgid "巨人"
msgstr "El Gigante"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（灵符自己朝着巨人飞过去了！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Los talismanes volaron hacia el "
"Gigante por su cuenta!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "等一下，封印！"
msgstr "¡Maldita sea, el sello!"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "封印破了！"
msgstr "¡El sello ha sido roto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "到底怎么回事！"
msgstr "¿¡Qué está pasando!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（灵符，贴到了巨人头上？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Los talismanes... ¿Se pegaron a la "
"cabeza del Gigante?)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（巨人好像被控制住了？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿El gigante ha sido subyugado?)</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "什、什、什、什么！居然脱落了？！"
msgstr "¿¡Qu-qu-qu-qué!? ¡¿Se cayó?!"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，你快跑！我们试着把它重新控制住！"
msgstr ""
"¡Steve, sal de aquí! ¡Intentaremos controlarlo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "该死……怎么会这样！"
msgstr ""
"Maldita sea... ¡Esto no debería haber sucedido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group mausoleum_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_5_map"
msgid "快回香霖堂！"
msgstr "¡Regresemos a Kourindou!"

#. Archive name for talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "访问香霖堂-梦殿大祀庙"
msgstr "Visita a Kourindou-Mausoleo"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "啊，你们——"
msgstr "Oh, eres tu-"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "发生什么了？"
msgstr "¿Pasa algo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"神子在封印巨人的时候，不知道怎么回事，突然就有符纸"
"飞到它的头上了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Mientras Miko estaba sellando al Gigante, estas "
"extrañas cosas de papel aparecieron de la nada y "
"volaron hacia su cabeza!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"然后这符纸就干扰了施法，巨人的封印就这样被打破了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esos papeles alteraron el ritual y el sello que "
"contenía al Gigante se rompió!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "怎、怎么会发生这种事……"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¡No hay manera..."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "都是我的错。"
msgstr "Esto es mi culpa"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "史蒂夫？"
msgstr "¿Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"之前有一位邪仙，她来找我，让我在神子施法的时候使用"
"她给我的符纸。"
msgstr ""
"Había una ermitaña malvada. Quería que usara esos "
"talismanes cuando Miko realizaba el ritual."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"我本来并不想听她的，但是，那符纸自己飞了过去。"
msgstr ""
"No la escuché, pero los talismanes actuaron por sí "
"solos."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "如果不是我的话——"
msgstr "Si no fuera por mí..."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"没事的，史蒂夫，你没有错。你只是被她利用了而已。"
msgstr ""
"No pasa nada, Steve. No hiciste nada malo. Solo te "
"usó, eso es todo."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"我其实也听说过一些那位邪仙的传闻。据说她十分邪恶，"
"别人的想法她都不会去考虑，唯一会想着的只有自己。"
msgstr ""
"De hecho, yo misma he oído rumores sobre esa "
"malvada ermitaña. Dicen que es una insecto, que no "
"tiene consideración por los demás. Solo piensa en "
"sí misma."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid ""
"她也常常会去人类村庄找人，被她利用也不是什么稀奇的"
"事情了。"
msgstr ""
"A menudo ataca a la gente de la Aldea Humana. Que "
"te use no es nada fuera de lo común."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "原来如此。"
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "……只是不知道，怎么该向神子她们交代呢？"
msgstr ""
"...Simplemente no sé cómo debería explicarle esto "
"a Miko y a los demás."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "别太难过了，史蒂夫，开心一些吧。"
msgstr ""
"No te castigues por ello, Steve. Intenta sonreír "
"un poco."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "对了，我还有一些东西可以卖了！"
msgstr "¡Ah sí, tengo más cosas para vender!"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_mausoleum_2"
msgid "那么，开始令人兴奋的购物环节吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es hora de la parte más emocionante: ir de "
"compras!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_6
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第6天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 6 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6"
msgid "今天来转换一下心情吧！"
msgstr "¡Hoy vamos a cambiar las cosas para variar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6"
msgid ""
"既然要转换心情，不如把立场也倒过来，扮演一次僵尸！"
msgstr ""
"¡Con lo que no hay mejor manera de hacerlo que "
"cambiar de bando y luchar del lado de los zombis!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6"
msgid ""
"我专门搞了个模拟场地，用来更好的研究僵尸会怎么进攻"
"我们！"
msgstr ""
"¡He preparado este campo de batalla simulado para "
"que podamos analizar mejor cómo nos atacarán los "
"zombis!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6"
msgid "好了，作为僵尸，去干掉每一行的侦测器吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡De acuerdo, Señor Come Sesos! ¡Destruye todos "
"esos observadores de cada fila!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_6_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第6天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 6 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_over"
msgid "燃烧吧！"
msgstr "¡Arde!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_over"
msgid ""
"这是地狱火，它能点燃飞过它的箭矢，造成额外的火焰伤"
"害！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Fuego Infernal! ¡Esto prende las "
"flechas que pasen encima, provocado mayor daño con "
"fuego!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_over"
msgid "不如一起大喊：“地狱火！！！！！！”"
msgstr ""
"¡¡¡¡Deja que el infierno castigue a estos no "
"muertos!!!!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_6_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第6天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 6 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "啊，史蒂夫，你回来了。"
msgstr "Oh, Steve, estás de vuelta."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "怎么回事？"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "嗨，你好呀，小弟弟……"
msgstr "Oye, hola de nuevo, Stevie..."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "你把那些灵符给了史蒂夫？"
msgstr "¿Le diste esos talismanes a Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "是啦……"
msgstr "Estoy segura de que ..."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "……唉。"
msgstr "...Hmph."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "怎么回事，巨人现在怎么样？"
msgstr "¿Qué pasó? ¿Que paso con el Gigante?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid ""
"青娥的灵符扰乱了我们的法阵，我们是重新把它控制住"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Después de que el talismán de Seiga alteró nuestro "
"ritual, logramos controlarlo nuevamente."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "但是封印……比之前脆弱太多了。"
msgstr ""
"Pero el sello... es mucho más débil que antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "不出几天就会再次被突破。"
msgstr "Sólo durará unos pocos días como máximo."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "怎么会这样！"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Pero cómo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "还是让这位邪仙来解释吧。"
msgstr ""
"Sería mejor que esta malvada ermitaña se explicara."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "啊，怎么说呢——"
msgstr "Oh, bueeeeeno..."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid ""
"你知道的，我是邪仙嘛，就是经常控制僵尸的那种仙人。"
msgstr ""
"O sea, ya sabes, soy una ermitaña malvada. De esos "
"que suelen controlar a los no muertos."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid ""
"巨人这种东西，那可是一块巨大的僵尸啊，用作邪术修炼"
"再合适不过了。"
msgstr ""
"Y fiel a su nombre, sin duda era un zombi gigante. "
"Sería el ejemplar ideal para practicar las artes "
"ermitañas."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid ""
"所以我就想把它抓来嘛……可没想到它居然是很多僵尸的集"
"合体，哎呀真是的。"
msgstr ""
"Así que... tenía ganas de tenerlo en mis manos... "
"Nunca se me pasó por la cabeza que fuera un montón "
"de zombis fusionados. Jaja, ups."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "我确实是贪心了啦。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, esta vez me puse demasiado codiciosa, la "
"verdad."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "这大概就是所谓的“人心不足蛇吞象”吧。"
msgstr ""
"Supongo que eso es lo que la gente quiere decir "
"cuando dice \"morder más de lo que se puede "
"masticar\", ¿eh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "对你的处分我之后再决定。"
msgstr ""
"Tu castigo se decidirá en una fecha posterior."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "只不过，史蒂夫，可能你得多留这里几天了。"
msgstr ""
"Dicho esto, Steve, es posible que necesitemos que "
"permanezcas unos días más."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "再封印它吗？"
msgstr "¿Para sellarlo de nuevo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid ""
"不，已经没有机会再次封印它了，这里的东西差不多被摧"
"毁了一半。"
msgstr ""
"No, hace mucho que no vimos esa ventana. Casi la "
"mitad del mausoleo se ha perdido."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "可能，你得把它除掉了。"
msgstr ""
"Es posible que necesites derrotarlo de una vez por "
"todas."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（开玩笑的吧！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Debes estar bromeando!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "不是开玩笑，史蒂夫。"
msgstr "No estoy bromeando, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid ""
"从之前的战斗中，我能看出，你的实力其实非常强。"
msgstr ""
"He visto tus batallas hasta ahora. Sé lo fuerte "
"que eres."

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "如果是你的话，说不定真能做到。"
msgstr "Quizás puedas lograrlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "发生这种事真的非常抱歉，还是有劳你了。"
msgstr ""
"No puedo disculparme lo suficiente por la "
"situación en la que estamos, pero aún necesitamos "
"su ayuda."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group mausoleum_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_6_map"
msgid "…唉。"
msgstr "...Oh... aquí vamos de nuevo."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_7
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第7天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 7 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7"
msgid "我们还要在这里多呆几天吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Tenemos que quedarnos aquí un par de días más?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7"
msgid "唉，是的，多亏了那个该死的邪仙。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, deberías agradece a esa tal ermitaña por eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7"
msgid "既然事情已经成了这样，那就接受吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Bueno, no tiene sentido llorar sobre la leche "
"derramada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7"
msgid "还有，好像有一种拿着竹竿的僵尸出现了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por cierto, creo que ha aparecido algún tipo de "
"zombie con una vara!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7"
msgid ""
"那似乎是尸解仙打扮的僵尸，就是那种通过道具复活后成"
"仙的人！"
msgstr ""
"¡Parece que están vestidos con un traje de "
"shikaisen, ermitaños que han revivido mediante el "
"uso de objetos ordinarios!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7"
msgid "当心他们会复活吧！"
msgstr "¡Recuerda matarlos dos veces!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_7_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第7天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 7 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_over"
msgid "死者开始复活！"
msgstr "¡La Disco nunca muere! O algo así era..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_over"
msgid ""
"这是死灵墓碑，它可以不停召唤骷髅战士，为你而战！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es la Tumba Nigromante! ¡Invoca una "
"infinidad de ejercito de esqueletos guerreros para "
"luchar por ti!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_over"
msgid "开始骨海战术吧！"
msgstr "¡Solo recuerda motívalos!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_7_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第7天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 7 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "汝还安好吗？史蒂夫。"
msgstr "¿Cómo te halláis, Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "布都，你来找我了？"
msgstr "¿Me estabas buscando, Futo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid ""
"是。之前封印的失败让吾受了一些伤，今天吾已恢复得差"
"不多了。"
msgstr ""
"En efecto. El fallo del sello me causó leve herida "
"con todo, ya casi me he restituido."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "我也没事，只不过还得再留下来把巨人干掉了。"
msgstr ""
"Yo también estoy bien. No me queda más remedio que "
"quedarme y acabar con el Gigante para siempre."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "有劳阁下了。"
msgstr "Su servicio es apreciado."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid ""
"之前都是因为青娥那厮，封印突然就被扰乱，把吾惊扰得"
"不轻。"
msgstr ""
"El sello fue quebrantado por la sin corazón de "
"Seiga. En verdad, causóme gran espanto."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid ""
"唉……自从三年前的那场命案后，吾这么提心吊胆还是第一"
"次啊。"
msgstr ""
"Ufff... Es ésta la primera vez que tan gran temor "
"me asalta desde aquel homicidio de tres años ha."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "……？等一下。"
msgstr "¿...? Espera."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "三年前有命案？"
msgstr "¿Un asesinato ocurrió hace tres años?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "啊，不不不，汝就当吾什么都没有说吧！"
msgstr ""
"Ah… no, no, en absoluto. Haz de cuenta que ni una "
"sola palabra pronuncie."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "……？"
msgstr "...¿?"

#. Description for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（布都离场）"
msgstr "(Futo se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_7_map"
msgid "这件事情我没听说过啊……"
msgstr "La primera vez que escucho sobre eso..."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_8
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第8天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 8 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8"
msgid "……戴夫去哪儿了？"
msgstr "... ¿Dónde se fue Dave? "

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8"
msgid "戴夫？那白袍村人？"
msgstr "¿Dave? ¿No es que lleva el atavío blanco?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8"
msgid "是的，不知道为什么，最近他是到处乱跑。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, por alguna razón sigue yéndose últimamente."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8"
msgid ""
"然后很长时间之后才回来，也不知道他去干什么了。"
msgstr ""
"Además, se toma su tiempo también. No tengo ni "
"idea de qué demonios está tramando."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8"
msgid "嗯……吾亦不清楚。"
msgstr ""
"Hm… Mucho me temo no tener respuesta que ofrecerte."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8"
msgid "总之，还是准备今天的战斗吧。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, todavía tenemos una batalla por delante."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_8_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第8天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 8 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_over"
msgid "啊！看来我回来的正是时候！"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¡Parece que llegué justo a tiempo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_over"
msgid ""
"这是黑洞炸弹，它在引爆后会炸出一个小型黑洞，吸引周"
"围的怪物！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es la Bomba de Agujero Negro! ¡Al explotar, "
"crea un agujero negro en miniatura que absorbe a "
"todos los monstruos de los alrededores!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_over"
msgid "并且，能持续对范围内的敌人造成伤害！"
msgstr ""
"¡Además, inflige daño continuamente a los enemigos "
"dentro del alcance!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_over"
msgid "集中火力对付他们吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Concentren toda la potencia de fuego! ¡Astronauta!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_8_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第8天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 8 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid ""
"戴夫，你这几天去哪儿了？你有时候总是看不见人影。"
msgstr ""
"¿Adónde has estado estos últimos días, Dave? A "
"veces parece que desapareces en el aire."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "随便逛逛！找找能卖的东西！"
msgstr ""
"¡Solo voy a dar un paseo! ¡También busco cosas "
"para vender!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "我就靠这招找到过不少绿宝石呢！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es mi verdadero método para encontrar muchas "
"esmeraldas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "我脸上有萤火虫吗？"
msgstr "¿Luciérnagas en mi cara?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "戴夫。"
msgstr "Dave."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "你是不是，在瞒着我什么呢？"
msgstr "¿Estas... ocultándome algo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "嗯？确实！"
msgstr "¿Hm? ¡Tienes razón!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "我就故意没告诉你，昨天香霖堂偷偷打折了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ayer puse en secreto los artículos en Kourindou "
"con descuento y no te lo dije intencionalmente!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（算了，还是别想这么多了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Da igual. Será mejor que no piense "
"demasiado en ello).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（毕竟戴夫……疯了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Después de todo... Dave se ha vuelto "
"loco).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "没事我就先走了！我又看到一颗巨大的绿宝石了！"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, si no me necesitas para nada más, ¡Veo otra "
"gran esmeralda con mi nombre en ella!"

#. Description for talk sentence 14 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（村民离场）"
msgstr "(Aldeano se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "那位先生……实在是个可怜人。"
msgstr "¡Qué hombre tan lamentable es!"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "……？"
msgstr "...¿?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "神子大人？"
msgstr "¿Señorita Miko?"

#. Description for talk sentence 17 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（神子出场）"
msgstr "(Miko aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "不过，他也很幸运——他有你这样的孩子。"
msgstr ""
"Pero también tiene mucha suerte de tener un hijo "
"como tú."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，这么多天以来，实在是辛苦你了。"
msgstr ""
"Una vez más, perdón por darte tanto trabajo estos "
"últimos días, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "介意和我多说说关于你的事情吗？"
msgstr "¿Te importaría si hablamos un poco de ti?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "你的内心，似乎有一种强烈的欲望挥之不去。"
msgstr ""
"Siento un fuerte deseo dentro de ti. Uno que no se "
"desvanecerá fácilmente."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "……嗯。"
msgstr "...Sí."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid ""
"之前说过了，戴夫是我的养父。我本不属于他们的世界。"
msgstr ""
"Ya te lo dije antes, Dave es mi padre adoptivo. No "
"pertenezco a su mundo."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid ""
"我和你们很像，是一名普通的人类。但是他们那里的居民"
"都是方形的。"
msgstr ""
"Al igual que ustedes, parezco una persona común y "
"corriente. En cambio, todos los que están ahí son "
"cuadrados."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid ""
"在那里，我几乎无时无刻不被人视作怪胎……只有戴夫才对"
"我好。"
msgstr ""
"La gente de allí constantemente me ve como un "
"fenómeno por eso... Dave es el único que es amable "
"conmigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid ""
"因为这些痛苦的回忆，我很长时间里都无比渴望得到一个"
"答案——"
msgstr ""
"Estos dolorosos recuerdos dieron lugar a una "
"pregunta que he tenido durante mucho tiempo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "<color=red>我的亲生父母到底是谁？</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=red>¿Quiénes son mis padres bilógicos?</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "神子小姐，您知道我的父母——"
msgstr "Señorita Miko, sabes quién-"

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "很抱歉，我并不清楚。"
msgstr "Realmente lo siento, pero no lo sé."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "啊，对、对不起，我、我稍微有些多嘴了……！"
msgstr ""
"Ah, lo-lo siento. Yo... ¡Debería haberme "
"callado...!"

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，我觉得你可能需要注意一下。"
msgstr "Steve, creo que deberías dar un paso atrás."

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "你太过于在意这件事了。"
msgstr ""
"Tu obsesión con este asunto puede ser un poco "
"insalubre."

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "对、对不起！我冒犯您了！"
msgstr "¡Lo siento! ¡No quise ofenderte!"

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "我、我、我、我不该问的！抱歉！"
msgstr ""
"¡Yo... yo... nunca debí haber preguntado! ¡Lo "
"siento!"

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "等、等等！"
msgstr "¡E-espera!"

#. Description for talk sentence 39 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（史蒂夫离场）"
msgstr "(Steve se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group mausoleum_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_8_map"
msgid "别走啊……"
msgstr "No te vayas..."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_9
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第9天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 9 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9"
msgid "看，那边有一种新的怪物！"
msgstr "¡He aquí un nuevo tipo de monstruo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9"
msgid "穿着锦绣华丽，简直如同古代中国的皇帝一般！"
msgstr ""
"¡Vestido con sedas exóticas, cual emperadores de "
"la Antigua China!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9"
msgid "呃……中国是什么地方？"
msgstr "Uhh... ¿Qué, China?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9"
msgid "一个庞大的文明古国，拥有众多的——呃。"
msgstr ""
"Un onolito de una civilización de tiempos "
"pretéritos. Poseían gran multitud de… eh…"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9"
msgid ""
"记不清了，距离吾上次知道那里的事情也已经一千多年"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Poco más puedo traer a la memoria. Han pasado mil "
"años desde que oí nuevas de ellos."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9"
msgid ""
"但要注意，皇帝这种职位，尤其能够强化他的人民！"
msgstr ""
"Mas advertid, un emperador descuella sobremanera "
"en fortalecer a los suyos."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_9_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第9天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 9 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_over"
msgid "我的回合，抽卡！"
msgstr "¡Mi turno! ¡Roba carta pichón!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_over"
msgid ""
"这是欲望壶，它在拥有星之碎片的怪物出现时，会复制怪"
"物身上的星之碎片！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es el Jarrón del Deseo! ¡Cuando aparezca un "
"monstruo con un Fragmento Estelar, creará una "
"copia de ese Fragmento!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_over"
msgid "不过，他的兄弟差不多都已经进禁卡池了！"
msgstr "¡Vamos, sigue robando cartas, vecino!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_9_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第9天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 9 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（战斗过后，大家又都开始忙其他的事情去"
"了，就剩我一个人留在这儿。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Cada uno se fue ocuparse de sus "
"asuntos después de la batalla. Soy el único que "
"queda).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（难得景色不错，继续在这儿呆一会吧。）"
"</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Supongo que el paisaje no está tan "
"mal hoy. Puedo quedarme aquí un rato).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "哎呀，瞧瞧这是谁？"
msgstr "Oh querido, que lindo verte aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "！谁在那儿！"
msgstr "¡¿Quién está ahí?!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "你、你、你——你不是之前那个——"
msgstr "¡T-T-T-Tú! ¿No eres tú-"

#. Description for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（青娥出场）"
msgstr "(Seiga aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "又见面了呢，小弟弟。"
msgstr "Nos encontramos de nuevo, Stevie."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "你一定在想我为什么会在这里，对吧？"
msgstr ""
"Debes estar preguntándote qué estoy haciendo aquí, "
"¿no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"我也就被关了几天而已，对于不老不死的仙人而言，一眨"
"眼可就过去了哦。"
msgstr ""
"Me encerraron un par de días. Apenas tiempo para "
"pestañear para un ermitaño inmortal."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "所以，你来这儿是为了——"
msgstr "Entonces, estás aquí por..."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "放松，小弟弟。你的身上有我想要的力量。"
msgstr ""
"Relájate. Verás, Stevie, tienes habilidades que me "
"encantan."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "所以，我这次还是来请你帮忙的哦。"
msgstr ""
"Por eso estoy aquí hoy, para pedir oficialmente tú "
"ayuda."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "不行，你的忙我绝对不会再帮了！"
msgstr "¡Jamás! ¡No te ayudaré nunca más!"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "哈哈，我就知道。"
msgstr "Ajaja, sabía que dirías eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "不过，我这里恐怕有些你想知道的事情哦。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque... me temo que conozco algunas cosas que te "
"interesarían mucho saber."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "……什么？"
msgstr "...¿Qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "<color=red>史蒂夫·奥格拉斯</color>，是吧？"
msgstr "<color=red>Steve Ogras</color>, no es así?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"我之前，好像见过有些人，在找有这个名字的人呢，而且"
"和你长得很相似。"
msgstr ""
"Puede que me haya topado con varias personas que "
"buscan a alguien con este nombre. Se parece mucho "
"a ti."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "说不定，他们和你可能会有什么血缘关系呢。"
msgstr ""
"¿Quién sabe? Quizás tengan algún parentesco de "
"sangre."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "！你、你怎么会知道……！"
msgstr "¡¿C-cómo lo sabes...?!"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "所以，小弟弟，要不要再帮我一些忙呢？"
msgstr ""
"Entonces, ¿te importaría hacerme otro favor, "
"Stevie?"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"连同上次没有给你的报酬一起，这次，我会告诉你一些很"
"重要的东西呢。"
msgstr ""
"Todavía te debo una recompensa por el favor que te "
"hice la última vez. Me aseguraré de contarte cosas "
"muy importantes esta vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "不、不行……怎么能听你的！"
msgstr ""
"¡Me niego! ¡No puedo confiar en nada de lo que "
"dices!"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"<color=red>就算再也不知道自己的身世，被人歧视，孤独"
"地活在这个世界上</color>，也是可以的嘛？"
msgstr ""
"<color=red>¿Aunque eso signifique que nunca sabrás "
"quiénes son tus padres? ¿Te parece bien seguir "
"viviendo solo en este mundo, siendo un exiliado?</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "！！"
msgstr "¡¡!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "我……"
msgstr "Yo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "我不想再那样活着……可是……"
msgstr "No quiero seguir viviendo así... Pero..."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "我帮你。"
msgstr "Lo haré."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "但……你必须要告诉我那些事情！！！"
msgstr "Pero... ¡¡TIENES que decirme lo que sabes!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "放心放心，我可向来都信守承诺的哦。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, sí, no te preocupes. Nunca he roto una promesa "
"antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "只不过，现在还不能告诉你，别太贪心哦。"
msgstr ""
"Aún no puedo decirte lo que sé. No ahora. No seas "
"demasiado codicioso, ¿de acuerdo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "呵呵，那我们说好咯，那我就——"
msgstr ""
"De acuerdo. Eso significa que tenemos un trato. "
"Ahora, yo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "你就滚回之前的牢里去吧。"
msgstr "Puedes volver a pudrirte en una celda."

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "你果然还是那个青娥。"
msgstr "Nunca cambias, ¿Verdad, Seiga?"

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "哎、哎呀……是神子啊……"
msgstr "Oh... Hola, Miko..."

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "原谅我吧~看在我们是老友的份上？"
msgstr ""
"¿No puedes perdonarme? Por que somos viejas "
"amigas, ¿no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"我们是老友不错，你为了自己在外面再怎么作恶，我也管"
"不到。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, somos viejas amigas. Cualquier vileza que "
"cometas afuera para tu propio beneficio no es "
"asunto mío."

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "但我实在无法忍受，你如此欺骗和利用史蒂夫！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero no permitiré que engañes a Steve con tus "
"mentiras!"

#. Text for talk sentence 45 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"拜托，我也没做什么伤天害理的事情啊，只是让他帮我做"
"事而已~"
msgstr ""
"Vamos, no es que quiera hacerle daño a nadie. Solo "
"necesito que me haga un par de favores."

#. Text for talk sentence 46 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"我不想听你的任何解释。现在回到之前的监牢里去，再待"
"上几年！"
msgstr ""
"No escucharé excusas. ¡Te tendré de vuelta en esa "
"celda unos años más!"

#. Text for talk sentence 47 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "切~算了。"
msgstr "Awww... Oh, bueno."

#. Text for talk sentence 48 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "那么，再也不见咯~史蒂夫小弟弟。"
msgstr "Entonces, chao, Stevie."

#. Description for talk sentence 49 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（青娥离场）"
msgstr "(Seiga se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 50 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"你怎么样，史蒂夫？青娥她没做什么伤害你的事情吧？"
msgstr ""
"¿Estás bien, Steve? Seiga no te hizo ningún daño?"

#. Text for talk sentence 51 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "没有，但是，她说她知道我父母的事情……"
msgstr ""
"No, estoy bien, pero ella dijo que sabía sobre mis "
"padres..."

#. Text for talk sentence 52 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "不可能的。这是她向来用于哄骗别人的伎俩。"
msgstr ""
"Mentiras. Ya ha usado este mismo truco con mucha "
"gente antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 53 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"你和我之前的对话，她当时可能也在偷听，才知道了这些"
"事情。"
msgstr ""
"Es posible que ya hubiera estado espiando nuestra "
"conversación. Eso explicaría por qué lo sabe."

#. Text for talk sentence 55 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "所以，答案又消失了吗……"
msgstr "Así que ahí van mis respuestas de nuevo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 57 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "我真的——好想、好想知道……"
msgstr "Realmente, realmente quiero saber..."

#. Text for talk sentence 58 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "还是说，我其实也跟她说的一样——太贪心了吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿O acaso no soy diferente de lo que ella dijo que "
"era, demasiado codicioso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 59 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "我本来就不该有这种欲望，对吗？"
msgstr ""
"Nunca debería haber tenido estos deseos en primer "
"lugar, ¿verdad?"

#. Text for talk sentence 61 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "不是的，孩子。"
msgstr "Eso no es verdad"

#. Text for talk sentence 62 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "人有欲望，这件事本身并不是问题。"
msgstr ""
"Los deseos humanos en sí mismos no son un problema."

#. Text for talk sentence 63 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"问题是，<color=red>人失去了控制欲望的能力，而去做坏"
"事。</color>"
msgstr ""
"Sólo se convierte en un problema cuando "
"<color=red>uno pierde la capacidad de controlarlos "
"y como resultado comete malas acciones.</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 64 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "你对自己父母这件事情的执念实在是有些太深了。"
msgstr ""
"Tu obsesión con tus padres es demasiado profunda."

#. Text for talk sentence 65 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"但是，你仍然有知道答案的权利。而这个答案只能由你自"
"己去寻找，并且，绝不要像青娥那样，使用如此邪恶的手"
"段。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, aún tienes derecho a saber la "
"respuesta. Es una respuesta que tendrás que buscar "
"tú mismo, y recuerda que no debes recurrir a "
"medios deshonestos como Seiga."

#. Text for talk sentence 66 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "嗯……"
msgstr "De acuerdo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 67 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "起来吧，史蒂夫，冷静一下。"
msgstr "Vamos, Steve, tranquiliza tu cabeza."

#. Text for talk sentence 68 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid ""
"之后还要解决巨人的问题，这几天就不要去想这些事情"
"了，你需要休息。"
msgstr ""
"Aún queda el asunto del Gigante. No pienses en eso "
"durante los próximos días. Necesitas descansar."

#. Text for talk sentence 69 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "嗯。"
msgstr "...De acuerdo."

#. Text for talk sentence 70 in talk group mausoleum_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_9_map"
msgid "谢谢你，神子大人。"
msgstr "Gracias, Señorita Miko."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_10
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第10天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 10 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid "神子大人，前天那件事，我还是想找你道歉。"
msgstr ""
"Creo que todavía le debo una disculpa por lo que "
"pasó hace dos días, Señorita Miko."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid "我那个时候太激动了……"
msgstr "Mis emociones me dominaron y..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid "没关系的，我理解你。"
msgstr "Esta bien, lo entiendo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid ""
"那种环境下长大的孩子，多多少少会对这些事情有些敏"
"感。"
msgstr ""
"Todos los niños que crecen en esos entornos son "
"más o menos sensibles a estos temas."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid "谢谢您。"
msgstr "Gracias."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid "比起那些事情——巨人的封印已经快要松动了。"
msgstr ""
"Aparte de eso ... El sello del gigante no durará "
"mucho más."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid "希望你能够准备好迎接这场艰难的战斗。"
msgstr ""
"Tienes una batalla difícil por delante. Espero que "
"tengas tus preparativos en orden."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10"
msgid "嗯，我会的。"
msgstr "Lo sé y lo haré."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_note
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "僵尸卷轴"
msgstr "Pergamino Zombi"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_note"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_note"
msgid "看不懂。"
msgstr "No lo entiendo."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_note"
msgid "……何物？"
msgstr "...¿Qué es esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_note"
msgid "似为僵尸之战书，但用者为古中国之文言文所作。"
msgstr ""
"Esto semeja una declaración de guerra de los "
"zombis, aunque escrita en lengua de la Antigua "
"China."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_note"
msgid "你看得懂吗，布都？"
msgstr "¿Puedes leerlo, Futo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_note"
msgid "否。"
msgstr "No."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_note"
msgid "那算了。"
msgstr "Bueno, ya no importa entonces."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_10_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第10天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 10 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "明天巨人差不多就要打破封印了，史蒂夫。"
msgstr ""
"El Gigante probablemente romperá el sello mañana, "
"Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "请你做好准备吧。"
msgstr ""
"Por favor, asegúrate de estar completamente "
"preparado."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "明白。"
msgstr "Entendido"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "还有，关于那件事，希望你能够镇静。"
msgstr ""
"Además... Respecto a \"eso\", espero que puedas "
"mantener la calma."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid ""
"在巨人的问题解决之后，你也许可以去找找我认识的一位"
"高僧。"
msgstr ""
"Quizás podrías visitar a cierta sacerdotisa que "
"conozco después de esta terrible experiencia con "
"el Gigante."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "也许，她能够帮你在这些问题上指条明路。"
msgstr ""
"Ella podría ofrecerte alguna orientación para tus "
"problemas."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "这、这样吗。"
msgstr "Supongo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "感谢你，神子大人。"
msgstr "Gracias, Señorita Miko"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "这是我应做的。"
msgstr "Sólo hago lo que debo."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_10_map"
msgid "加油吧，孩子，祝你能找到属于自己的光。"
msgstr ""
"Mucha suerte, pequeño. Seguro que algún día "
"encontrarás la luz que te pertenece."

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_11
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第11天入场"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 11 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"巨人马上就要打破封印了。在那之前，僵尸们也开始大量"
"出现了。"
msgstr ""
"El Gigante está a punto de liberarse. Hasta "
"entonces, una gran horda de zombis se acercará."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid "巨人是如何战斗的？"
msgstr "¿Cómo lucha el Gigante?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"它会化作许多尸块，进行撞击，并使用它腐烂的器官进行"
"特别的攻击。"
msgstr ""
"Se dividirá en un montón de pedazos y te golpeará. "
"También usa sus órganos podridos para realizar "
"ataques especiales."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"并且，他还会变化为许多我们从来没见过的奇怪形态。"
msgstr ""
"Además, se transformará en muchas formas extrañas, "
"diferentes a todo lo que hayamos visto antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"不过，此前之战，吾似乎见过汝使用与之相关器械。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, mis ojos vieron los artilugios "
"relevantes en las batallas pasadas."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid "试用此些器械攻之！"
msgstr "¡Intenta usar estos artilugios en tu asalto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"另外，它的吼叫十分吵闹。不过，如果有办法能利用它的"
"声音，也许连他自己也会承受不住。"
msgstr ""
"Además, sus rugidos son bastante fuertes. Sin "
"embargo, si pudieras usarlo a tu favor, quizá el "
"propio Gigante no soportaría el ruido."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid "好，明白了！"
msgstr "¡Bien, lo tengo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那些欲望的化身——小神灵，在此也开始大"
"量聚集。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Pequeños espíritus divinos, la "
"manifestación de los deseos, han comenzado a "
"reunirse en grandes cantidades).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（它们点缀着这地下的黑暗，把这里变成了"
"一片星空。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Su presencia salpica el oscuro "
"subsuelo, formando un mar de estrellas).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（而我，也该在这欲望的宇宙里——开启新的"
"道路了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Yo... forjaré mi propio camino, a "
"través de este mar de deseos).</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_11_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第11天结束"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 11 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_over"
msgid "巨人……已经解体了！"
msgstr "El gigante ... ¡Se ha desmoronado!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_over"
msgid "棒极了！你做到了我们都没有做到的事情。"
msgstr ""
"¡Buen trabajo! Has logrado algo que ni nosotras "
"podríamos lograr."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_over"
msgid "如此力量，实在是令人咋舌！"
msgstr ""
"¡Quedo sin habla ante tan desmesurada fuerza!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_over"
msgid "好了，巨人现在已经不能再造成任何的威胁了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Lo logramos! ¡El Gigante ya no representará una "
"amenaza para nadie!"

#. Archive name for talk group mausoleum_11_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "梦殿大祀庙第11天地图"
msgstr "Mausoleo Día 11 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "正如我之前所说的，史蒂夫，你的力量十分强大。"
msgstr ""
"Como he dicho antes, Steve, posees una fuerza "
"insuperable."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "如今，你的行为确实也印证了这一点。"
msgstr "Lo has demostrado con tus acciones hoy."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "实际上，哆来咪小姐也说过类似的话。"
msgstr ""
"La señorita Doremy dijo algo similar, en realidad."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "那位梦境的管理者吗？"
msgstr "¿La guardiana de los sueños, no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "可是，这些力量不是我所想要的。"
msgstr ""
"Pero... nunca quise este poder en primer lugar."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid ""
"有了这些力量，我必须要利用它清除这些僵尸，反而感觉"
"更累了。"
msgstr ""
"Tener este poder significa que necesito usarlo "
"para derrotar a estos zombis, lo que me cansa aún "
"más."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "其实我只想做个普通人，过正常的生活。"
msgstr ""
"Honestamente lo único que quiero es ser una "
"persona normal, vivir una vida normal."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "很好，史蒂夫，我理解你的想法。"
msgstr ""
"Eso es genial, Steve. Entiendo cómo te sientes."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "不过，幻想乡的大家仍然还需要这份力量。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, Gensokyo todavía requiere tu fuerza."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid ""
"也许，等到这一切——幻想乡的异变结束之后，你的这份力"
"量可能就会消失。"
msgstr ""
"Quizás una vez que todo esto termine, cuando "
"Gensokyo vuelva a la normalidad, tu poder "
"desaparecerá."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid ""
"到了那时候，你也许就可以回到自己的家里，如愿以偿"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Desde que eso pase, entonces, tal como lo habías "
"deseado, podrás regresar a casa."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "是这样吗。"
msgstr "Sí eso es así..."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "在那之前，你还需要不停战斗。"
msgstr ""
"Pero hasta que ese día llegue, no puedes dejar de "
"luchar ni un momento."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "因此，我有一份礼物给你，希望你能收下。"
msgstr ""
"Por eso tengo un regalo para ti. Por favor, "
"acéptalo."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "炸弹？"
msgstr "¿Una bomba?"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid ""
"这是我特制的圣光炸弹，它在爆炸时会产生炫目的光芒，"
"刺伤那些邪恶的怪物。"
msgstr ""
"La llamo la Bomba de Luz. Produce un destello "
"cegador al activarse, abrasando a todas las "
"criaturas del mal."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "如果你能好好利用，他一定能发挥巨大的作用。"
msgstr ""
"Ponlo en buen uso y estoy segura de que te servirá "
"bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "这样啊，谢谢神子大人。"
msgstr "Ya veo. Gracias, Señorita Miko."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "要走了吗，史蒂夫？"
msgstr "¿Partís tan presto, Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "此与汝共，我得其所学甚多。"
msgstr ""
"He aprendido muchas cosas maravillosas durante el "
"tiempo que hemos pasado juntos."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "感激不尽！"
msgstr "¡Tenéis mi gratitud!"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "嗯，布都也是，那么我们下次——"
msgstr "Sí, igual, Futo. Hasta la próxima-"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "叮铃铃铃……"
msgstr "*Tono de llamada*"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "嗯？电话？"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿De quién es ese teléfono?"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "朱鹭子打来的？她有什么事吗？"
msgstr "¿Llama Tokiko? ¿Pasa algo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "哔。"
msgstr "Beep."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "朱鹭子？你——"
msgstr "¿Tokiko? ¿Cómo—"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "你们快回来！快回香霖堂呀！！！"
msgstr ""
"¡Tienes que volver! ¡Ven a Kourindou! ¡¡¡¡Date "
"prisa!!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "这里有好多僵尸！！！快、快来救我！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Hay tantos zombis aquí!!! ¡¡¡S-sálvame!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "什、什么？！"
msgstr "¿¡Q-Qué!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "呀啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡KYAAAAAAAAA!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "嘟——嘟——嘟——"
msgstr "Beep—Beep—Beep—"

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "不好！快回去！"
msgstr "¡Tenemos que darnos prisa!"

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "看样子有情况发生了，你们快回吧！"
msgstr ""
"Parece que ha surgido un problema. Estaremos bien; "
"¡Vayan! ¡Rápido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "明白了，改日我们再见吧！"
msgstr "Entendido. ¡Nos vemos otro día!"

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "该死，怎么会……"
msgstr "Maldita sea, esto no se suponía que..."

#. Description for talk sentence 35 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（来到香霖堂）"
msgstr "(Yendo camino hacia Kourindou)"

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "喂，你要干什么！跑进去就是送死啊！"
msgstr ""
"¡Oye!, ¿Qué crees que estás haciendo? ¡Un placaje "
"es un suicidio!"

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "可是，朱鹭子还在里面！"
msgstr "¡Pero Tokiko todavía está dentro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "先把这些僵尸都给清理干净再说吧！！！"
msgstr ""
"¡Podremos hablar una vez que hayamos eliminado a "
"estos zombis!"

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "全都干掉了！"
msgstr "¡Ese es el último de ellos!"

#. Description for talk sentence 39 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（僵尸被击杀）"
msgstr "(Los Zombis son derrotados)"

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "朱鹭子！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Tokiko!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "朱鹭子，你没事吧！"
msgstr "¿Estás bien? ¡Tokiko!"

#. Description for talk sentence 41 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（冲进香霖堂）"
msgstr "(Entrando en Kourindou)"

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "我、我没事……我没受伤……"
msgstr "Yo... estoy bien... no estoy herida..."

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "呜呜呜……呜呜……好可怕……"
msgstr "Fue tan...tan...aterrador..."

#. Text for talk sentence 44 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "我……一直躲在里面……好害怕……"
msgstr ""
"Yo ... estaba escondida dentro ... temblando ..."

#. Text for talk sentence 45 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "手机……也被我……不小心弄坏了……呜呜呜……"
msgstr ""
"El teléfono... lo... rompí accidentalmente... y... "
"Waaaaaah..."

#. Text for talk sentence 46 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "该死，为什么香霖堂也会来僵尸！"
msgstr ""
"¡Maldición! ¿Por qué habría zombis en Kourindou?"

#. Text for talk sentence 47 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "请你们听着。"
msgstr "Escúchenme, los dos anormales."

#. Text for talk sentence 48 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "你、你是什么人！"
msgstr "¿¡Q-Quién eres tu!?"

#. Description for talk sentence 48 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（神秘影像出场）"
msgstr "(El Holograma aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 49 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "呵，你居然也到了这里，真的是命运的捉弄啊。"
msgstr ""
"Je, de todas las personas que podrían haber venido "
"aquí... El destino sí que es caprichoso, ¿no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 50 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "史蒂夫。"
msgstr "Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 51 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "你——为什么知道我的名字？"
msgstr "¿C-Cómo sabe mi nombre? "

#. Text for talk sentence 52 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "我警告你们。"
msgstr "Esto es una advertencia."

#. Text for talk sentence 53 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "不要让我再看到你。"
msgstr "No quiero verte de ahora en adelante."

#. Text for talk sentence 54 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "不然我会让你们付出惨痛的代价的。"
msgstr ""
"De lo contrario, te haré sentir lo dolorosas que "
"pueden ser las consecuencias."

#. Text for talk sentence 55 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Description for talk sentence 55 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（神秘影像离场）"
msgstr "(El Holograma desaparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 56 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "该死，这家伙，到底是谁？"
msgstr "Eugh, ¿Quién demonios era ese?"

#. Text for talk sentence 57 in talk group mausoleum_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:mausoleum_11_map"
msgid "呜呜呜……呜呜呜……"
msgstr "Waaaaah.... Waaaaah...."

#. Archive name for talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "第六章-访问香霖堂"
msgstr "Capítulo 6-Visita a Kourindou"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "啊，久违的香霖堂，又回来了啊。"
msgstr ""
"Ahh, Kourindou... Ha pasado mucho tiempo. Me "
"alegra estar de vuelta."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "是啊，不知道朱鹭子有没有在好好看店呢。"
msgstr ""
"Así es. Me pregunto si Tokiko ha estado cuidando "
"bien la tienda."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "朱鹭子，我们回来了。"
msgstr "Oye, Tokiko, estamos de vuelta."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "……？朱鹭子？"
msgstr "...¿? ¿Tokiko?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "门半掩着？"
msgstr "¿La puerta está entreabierta?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "朱鹭子？你在吗？"
msgstr "¿Tokiko? ¿Estás aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "<color=blue>（进去看看吧。）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(Entremos a ver).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "？！朱鹭子？怎么回事？朱鹭子？！"
msgstr "¿¡!? ¿Tokiko? ¿¡Qué pasó!? ¡¡¡Tokiko!!!"

#. Description for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid ""
"（村民打开门，发现店内的朱鹭子已经昏迷，少量血液从"
"头部流出。）"
msgstr ""
"(El Aldeano abre la puerta y encuentra a Tokiko "
"inconsciente, con una pequeña cantidad de sangre "
"goteando desde su cabeza)."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "怎怎怎怎么回事？！"
msgstr "¿¡Qu-Qu-Qué paso!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "<color=red>（血、血！！！）</color>"
msgstr "<color=red>(¡¡¡S-Sangre!!!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "朱鹭子，快醒醒！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Tokiko, despierta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "香霖堂不是有器械保护着吗，怎么会发生这种事！"
msgstr ""
"¿Acaso no había artilugios que protegieran "
"Kourindou? ¿Cómo pudo haber sucedido esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "该死，呼吸越来越弱了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Maldita sea, su respiración se está debilitando!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "不行，必须赶紧送医！不然……"
msgstr ""
"Esto es malo... ¡Necesitamos llevarla a un médico "
"ahora!"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "但是，永远亭离这里太远了啊！恐怕不到那里就……"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero Eientei está demasiado lejos! Si no llegamos "
"a tiempo, podría..."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "怎么回事？发生什么事了？"
msgstr "¡¿Qué está pasando?! ¡¿Qué sucedió aquí?!"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "你——你是……"
msgstr "T... tu eres..."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "怎、怎么回事，她怎么了？"
msgstr "¿Qu-Qué paso aquí? ¿Por qué ella..."

#. Description for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（魔理沙出现）"
msgstr "(Marisa aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "没时间了。魔理沙，拜托你一件事！"
msgstr ""
"¡No hay tiempo, Marisa, necesito que hagas algo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "什么？"
msgstr "¿Huh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "拜托你把朱鹭子送去永远亭！"
msgstr "¡Lleva a Tokiko hacia Eientei! ¡Por favor!"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "要我，送她？"
msgstr "¿Quieres que... la lleve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"我知道你和她之间有些不合，但是这是唯一的希望！"
msgstr ""
"¡Sé que ustedes dos no se han estado llevando "
"bien, pero esta es su única oportunidad!"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "求你了！看在霖之助的份上！"
msgstr "¡Por favor! ¡Por el bien de Rinnosuke!"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "霖之助……"
msgstr "Rinnosuke..."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "我明白了。"
msgstr "Bien, entiendo."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "快，搬到我的扫帚上！"
msgstr "¡Rápido! ¡Súbela arriba de mi escoba!"

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "好了，我走了！你们也尽快赶到！"
msgstr ""
"¡Muy bien, me voy! ¡Ustedes dos vayan allí lo más "
"rápido que puedan!"

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"邻居，你先去永远亭吧，我去检查一下有没有什么东西丢"
"了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Vecino, ve tú primero a Eientei! ¡Yo revisaré si "
"falta algo en la tienda!"

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "明白了！"
msgstr "¡Entendido!"

#. Archive text for talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "史蒂夫来到了永远亭。"
msgstr "Steve llega a Eientei."

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "病人已经脱离危险了。"
msgstr "La paciente está fuera de peligro ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"头部遭扁平物体重击，失去意识，带有头皮裂伤及出血。"
"好在经过治疗之后已经没事了。"
msgstr ""
"Recibió un golpe en la cabeza con un objeto plano, "
"perdió el conocimiento y sufrió una laceración en "
"el cuero cabelludo con hemorragia. Tras recibir "
"tratamiento, se encuentra bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "实在是感谢。"
msgstr "Muchas gracias de verdad."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "我去看看其他病人了。"
msgstr "Ahora iré a checar a mis demás paciente."

#. Description for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（永琳离开）"
msgstr "(Eirin se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "啊，魔理沙。"
msgstr "Oh, Marisa."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "谢谢你的帮忙。"
msgstr "Agradezco por tu ayuda."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "不用谢。"
msgstr "No lo menciones."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "其实我现在、有些愧疚。"
msgstr "Para se honesta... Siento culpa."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"我因为霖之助而对她感到厌恶，觉得她配不上这个香霖"
"堂。"
msgstr ""
"No la soportaba por culpa de Rinnosuke. Pensaba "
"que no se merecía Kourindou."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "甚至还在想，把她就这样放着不管算了。"
msgstr ""
"Incluso pensé en dejarla así y olvidarme del "
"asunto."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "但是好好想想，我自己又配得上吗？"
msgstr ""
"Pero pensándolo bien, ¿Realmente merezco Kourindou?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "我一个见死不救的人……"
msgstr ""
"Yo, que soy de las que dejarían morir a una "
"persona..."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "香霖绝对不会这么做的。"
msgstr "Kourin jamás haría eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "没事的，魔理沙。"
msgstr "Está bien, Marisa."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "好了，该走了。"
msgstr "Muy bien, debería irme."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "我不想——让那个孩子看见我。"
msgstr "Yo... no quiero que ella me vea."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "请你们不要告诉她我的事，好吗？"
msgstr ""
"Por favor, no le digas que me involucre, ¿De "
"acuerdo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "嗯。"
msgstr "Seguro."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "那、我走了。"
msgstr "Bueno... Ya me voy."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "再见。"
msgstr "Adiós."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（香霖堂到底发生了什么……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿Qué habrá pasando en Kourindou...?)</"
"color>"

#. Description for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（魔理沙离开）"
msgstr "(Marisa se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "戴夫？你来了？"
msgstr "¿Dave? ¡Finalmente estás aquí!"

#. Description for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（村民入场）"
msgstr "(Aldeano aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "我检查了一遍，香霖堂没有任何物品丢失。"
msgstr ""
"He revisado todo el lugar. No falta nada en "
"Kourindou."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "诶？那犯人为什么——"
msgstr "¿Eh? Entonces, ¿Por qué el culpable...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "不知道啊。总之先去问问朱鹭子吧。"
msgstr ""
"Ni idea. Vamos a preguntarle primero a Tokiko."

#. Archive text for talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "史蒂夫和村民去找了朱鹭子。"
msgstr "Steve y el Aldeano quieren ver a Tokiko."

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "……？"
msgstr "...¿?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "朱鹭子，你醒了？"
msgstr "Ah, Tokiko, has despertado."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "你没事吧？"
msgstr "¿Te encuentras bien?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "呃……"
msgstr "Uhh..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "是谁打了你，你还记得吗？"
msgstr "¿Recuerdas quien fue que te golpeó?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "那个，不好意思。"
msgstr "Um, lo siento... pero..."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "你们是哪位？"
msgstr "¿Quiénes... son ustedes dos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "还有，我是……？"
msgstr "¿Quién... soy yo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "看起来她是失忆了啊。"
msgstr "Parece que tiene amnesia."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "头部遭受扁平物体重击，有的时候难免会这样。"
msgstr ""
"Un golpe en la cabeza a veces puede provocar este "
"tipo de afección."

#. Description for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（永琳入场）"
msgstr "(Eirin aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "那，大夫，有没有什么办法——"
msgstr "Entonces, doctora, ¿Hay una manera de-"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "治疗的办法有倒是有，不过我最近有点忙不过来。"
msgstr ""
"Hay un tratamiento, pero últimamente he estado "
"bastante ocupada."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "最近像她这样被袭击的人实在是太多了。"
msgstr ""
"Como ves, hay muchísimas personas que han sido "
"atacadas recientemente de la misma manera que ella."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "还有其他被袭击的人？！"
msgstr "¿¡Hay más victimas!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "是，最近非常多。"
msgstr "Sí. Últimamente hay muchos."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"不过，找回她的记忆的话，我倒是有个两全其美的办法。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, conozco a alguien que puede abordar "
"los recientes ataques y que pueda ayudarla a "
"recuperar la memoria."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"居住于地下的觉妖怪，曾经因为这些袭击案件而来与我这"
"里的病人交流过，她似乎也在调查这些事件。"
msgstr ""
"La youkai satori que habita en el Inframundo vino "
"una vez aquí a interrogar a mis pacientes debido a "
"estos ataques. Parece que también está "
"investigando estos incidentes."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"那位觉妖怪也是催眠术的高手，使用催眠术应该是能帮忙"
"找回她的记忆的。靠她的帮助兴许还能把犯人也揪出来。"
msgstr ""
"También es experta en hipnosis, lo que debería "
"ayudar a restaurar la memoria del paciente. Con su "
"ayuda, incluso podrías dar con el culpable."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"这样啊，那我们要不就去那里吧。不过朱鹭子去的话，没"
"问题吧？"
msgstr ""
"Ya veo. En ese caso, ¿Qué tal si vamos al "
"Inframundo? Pero... ¿Estaría bien que Tokiko "
"viniera?"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"病人的身体经过治疗应该可以自由行动了，没有什么大问"
"题。"
msgstr ""
"Después de los tratamientos, la paciente debe "
"recuperarse bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "那就出发吧。"
msgstr "Entonces, vámonos."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid ""
"没事，朱鹭子，我们在路上也会和你讲讲你过去的事情。"
"你一定能找回记忆的！"
msgstr ""
"No te preocupes, Tokiko. Te contaremos sobre tu "
"pasado a lo largo del camino. ¡Seguro que "
"recuperarás tus recuerdos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group kourindou_visit_palace_1's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_palace_1"
msgid "……？嗯。"
msgstr "...¿? ¿De acuerdo...?"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第1天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 1 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1"
msgid "哦呀……？您是最近那位很有名的——史蒂夫先生吧？"
msgstr ""
"¿Oh...? ¿Tu debes ser el famoso Señor Steve que "
"todos han estado hablando últimamente, correcto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1"
msgid "是。"
msgstr "Efectivamente, soy yo."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1"
msgid "很少有人会来地灵殿的……原来是因为这件事啊……"
msgstr ""
"No mucha gente viene al Palacio de los Espíritus "
"de la Tierra... Ya veo, así que por eso estás "
"aquí..."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1"
msgid "……？"
msgstr "...¿?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1"
msgid "等等，这里也有僵尸攻过来吗？"
msgstr ""
"Espera, ¿También aquí están atacando los zombis?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1"
msgid "……既然您想帮忙，那就拜托您了。"
msgstr "...Ya que quieres ayudar, te lo dejare a ti."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1"
msgid "呃，好——好的。"
msgstr "Eh, d-de acuerdo, entonces."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_1_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第1天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 1 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_over"
msgid ""
"这是变形发射器！通过触发它，可以让它在两种不同的模"
"式下进行切换！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Transmisador! ¡Puedes activar dos "
"modos con esto, usando el engranaje!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_over"
msgid ""
"一般情况下它会发射光灵箭，让击中的目标发光并受到更"
"多伤害！"
msgstr ""
"¡Normalmente, dispara flechas espectrales, "
"causando daño al objetivo y hacerlo brillar, con "
"lo que recibirá más daño!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_over"
msgid ""
"触发之后会变为激光模式，使用激光穿透前方的所有敌"
"人，使他们发光并持续受到伤害！"
msgstr ""
"¡Una vez activado con el engranaje, puede cambiar "
"a su modo láser que dispara un rayo que perfora "
"todo monstruos frente suyo, haciéndolos brillar y "
"ocasionando daño continuo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_over"
msgid "射穿你的敌人吧！"
msgstr "¡Haz brillar a tus superestrellas!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_1_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第1天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 1 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid "解决了，那个——"
msgstr "Eso debería solucionarlo. Así que, eh..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"找回记忆的事情，我会做些准备，你们现在这里安顿下来"
"吧。"
msgstr ""
"En cuanto a restaurar los recuerdos de ella, "
"primero haré algunos preparativos. Por ahora, "
"pueden acomodarse aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid "哦，不好意思，我还没向你们解释。"
msgstr ""
"Oh, mis disculpas por no haberme presentado "
"todavía."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"我是觉，这座地灵殿的主人，是一名<color=red>能读取他"
"人内心想法</color>的妖怪。"
msgstr ""
"Soy Satori, la ama del Palacio de los Espíritus de "
"la Tierra, una youkai <color=red>capaz de leer la "
"mente de otros</color>."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid "你们来这里的原因不必多说，我自然能了解。"
msgstr ""
"Con lo que no hay necesidad de explicarme porque "
"estas aquí. Ya lo sé."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid "原来是这样啊。"
msgstr "Ya lo note..."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"三年前的异变发生后，这里便产生了大量的怪物，前方的"
"旧地狱街道也变得冷清了许多。拜托您清理这些怪物了。"
msgstr ""
"Después de estallido del Incidente de hace tres "
"años, un gran número de monstruos aparecieron "
"aquí, y las calles del Viejo Infierno se han "
"quedado silenciosas. Con lo que me gustaría que "
"limpies a todos esos monstruos fuera de aquí, por "
"favor."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"以及，关于你们那家香霖堂受到的袭击，我确实有一直在"
"调查类似的案件。"
msgstr ""
"Asimismo, en relación con la agresión en "
"Kourindou, de hecho he estado investigando casos "
"similares."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"最近地上和地下都出现了很多袭击案件，受害者都有类似"
"的情况——就是头部受到扁平物体打击。"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente se han producido numerosos asaltos "
"tanto en la superficie como en el subsuelo, y "
"todas las víctimas comparten una característica "
"similar, han sido golpeadas en la cabeza con un "
"objeto plano."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid "和朱鹭子的情况一模一样……！"
msgstr "¡Justo lo mismo que le paso a Tokiko...!"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"你们这位其实算是幸运的了。有些受害者在受到袭击之"
"后，就再也没醒来过。"
msgstr ""
"Tu amiga es una afortunada. Muchas victimas nunca "
"despertaron después de ser atacados."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid "再也没醒过来……"
msgstr "¿Nunca despertaron...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"不过倒也不是死了，他们确实还活着，但是却处在长时间"
"失去意识的状态。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, no están muerto. Todavía siguen con "
"vida, pero ellos permanecen en un estado "
"prolongado de inconsciencia."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"先不说那么多了。明天我会试着帮你找回你的记忆的。"
msgstr ""
"Dejémoslo así por ahora. Intentaré ayudar a que tu "
"amiga recupere la memoria mañana."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid ""
"不过请你做好准备，我帮你找回记忆的手段是一种催眠"
"术，也不是什么情况都有效的。"
msgstr ""
"Pero recuerden que el método que utilizo es una "
"forma de hipnosis y no es eficaz en todos los "
"casos."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_1_map"
msgid "好——好的，谢谢您……"
msgstr "E-esta bien, gracias..."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第2天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 2 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "介绍一下，这两位是我养的宠物。"
msgstr "Permíteme presentar a mis dos mascotas."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "你好，咱的名字是火焰猫 燐，叫咱阿燐就行了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Holi, me llamo Rin Kaenbyou!, ¡Pero solamente "
"dígame Orin!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "你好！我是灵乌路 空，负责核能相关的事情！"
msgstr ""
"¡Hola, soy Utsuho Reiuji, me pueden decir Okuu! "
"¡Además yo me encargo de todo lo relacionado con "
"la energía nuclear!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid ""
"她们两位也和你一样，与这些怪物们战斗过，希望你和她"
"们能好好相处。我先告辞了。"
msgstr ""
"Ellas dos, al igual que tu, también lucharon "
"contra monstruos y espero que te lleves bien con "
"ellas dos. Me despido hasta ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "好的。"
msgstr "Está bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "今天的怪物里面有一种黑色的生物！"
msgstr ""
"¡Entre los monstruos de hoy, hay una criatura "
"negra!"

#. Description for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（觉离开）"
msgstr "(Satori se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "看起来像是一种……细胞？"
msgstr "Se parece como a una... ¿Célula biológica?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "那种生物一旦被杀死，就会变成两个小的分身！"
msgstr ""
"¡Cuando esa criatura es derrotada, se divide de "
"dos copias suyas pequeñas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2"
msgid "小心应对，它们在分裂后还会换行！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ten cuidado, cambian de carril después de "
"separarse!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_2_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第2天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 2 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_over"
msgid "老朋友，沙砾投手！"
msgstr "¡Un viejo amigo, la Gravapulta!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_over"
msgid "它能向敌人投出燧石，攻速慢，伤害一般！"
msgstr ""
"¡Le lanza pedernales a los enemigos, pero tiene "
"una velocidad de ataque lenta y un daño promedio!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_over"
msgid ""
"不过它有概率会投出沙砾，这些沙砾能够暂时定住敌人，"
"不让它们移动或攻击！"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, ¡Tiene una probabilidad de lanzar un "
"bloque de grava que inmoviliza un enemigo "
"temporalmente, previniendo su movimiento y ataque!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_over"
msgid "别弄得自己满头都是沙砾！"
msgstr "¡No dejes que te caiga grava en la cabeza!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_2_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第2天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 2 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid ""
"事先说明一下，我确实是能施展催眠术，不过能不能找回"
"记忆可能就要另说了。"
msgstr ""
"Permítanme aclarar algo primero. Puedo practicar "
"la hipnosis, pero si puedo restaurar sus recuerdos "
"o no... eso es otra cuestión completamente "
"distinta."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid ""
"催眠术只能用来找回那些刻在内心深处，印象极度深刻的"
"内容。"
msgstr ""
"La hipnosis solo puede traer de vuelta "
"experiencias vívidas y memorables que se "
"encuentran en lo más profundo de la mente."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid ""
"像是日常回忆这样印象并不深刻的记忆，大概不是很能唤"
"醒。"
msgstr ""
"En cuanto a los recuerdos menos vívidos, como las "
"experiencias de la vida cotidiana, es probable que "
"la hipnosis no pueda recuperarlos."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "这样吗？不过我还是想想试一试。"
msgstr ""
"¿Con que así funciona? Aun así, me gustaría "
"intentarlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "什么也想不起来的感觉实在是太难受了。"
msgstr ""
"No poder recordar nada es una sensación realmente "
"horrible."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "那好吧，准备好，我这就开始……"
msgstr ""
"Muy bien entonces. Prepárense, empezaré ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "看招！"
msgstr "¡Hyah!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "喂！"
msgstr "¡Oye!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "你确定要这么做吗？"
msgstr "¿Estás seguro de querer hacer esto?"

#. Description for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（史蒂夫的眼前突然一片漆黑）"
msgstr "(La visión de Steve se vuelve oscura)"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "这么做的话，也许会有什么意外情况也说不定。"
msgstr ""
"Hacerlo podría acarrear consecuencias inesperadas."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "放心吧，我已经做好觉悟了。"
msgstr "No te preocupes, estoy listo."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "我想知道，我的父母到底是什么人。"
msgstr ""
"Quiero saber... quiénes son realmente mis padres."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "还有……我梦中的那座墓，到底是谁的。"
msgstr "También... sobre esa tumba en mis sueños."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "我懂了。那么，准备，我们开始吧。"
msgstr ""
"Lo entiendo. Ahora bien, prepárense. Empecemos."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "你没事吧？"
msgstr "¿Te encuentras bien?"

#. Description for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（视野恢复）"
msgstr "(Visión recuperada)"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "怎么回事？"
msgstr "...¿Qué acaba de pasar?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "呜呜呜……又被吓一跳……"
msgstr "Waaah... me asusté otra vez..."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "我怎么了？"
msgstr "¿Qué me paso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "……失礼了。刚才我的妹妹突然来这里搞乱。"
msgstr ""
"...Mis disculpas. Mi hermana menor de repente se "
"apareció y causo este disturbio."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "这让我不小心选了你当目标。"
msgstr ""
"Eso hizo que te eligiera como objetivo sin querer."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "……我好像，想起了一些过去的事情？"
msgstr "...Creo que... ¿Recordé algo del pasado?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_2_map"
msgid "但是，那段记忆，十分模糊……"
msgstr "Pero... esa memoria es muy vaga..."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第3天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 3 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3"
msgid "我对之前那件事表示抱歉。"
msgstr ""
"Pido disculpas por lo sucedido anteriormente."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3"
msgid ""
"我的妹妹叫古明地 恋，之前发生过一些事情，让她获得了"
"无意识相关的能力。"
msgstr ""
"Mi hermana menor es Koishi Komeiji. Debido a "
"ciertos sucesos del pasado, adquirió habilidades "
"relacionadas con la mente inconsciente."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3"
msgid ""
"一般人在平常状态下是发现不了她的，并且她自己有的时"
"候也不知道自己到底在干些什么。"
msgstr ""
"La gente común normalmente no la notarían, y a "
"veces ni siquiera ella sabe lo que está haciendo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3"
msgid "是这样啊。"
msgstr "Entiendo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3"
msgid ""
"之后我也对朱鹭子尝试了几次催眠术，不过很可惜，她的"
"记忆似乎没法很好的恢复。"
msgstr ""
"Ya intenté usar la hipnosis en Tokiko un pare "
"veces más, pero desafortunadamente, su memoria no "
"parece recuperarse."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3"
msgid ""
"很抱歉我没能帮上什么忙。不过如果你不介意，我之后可"
"以给你们一些袭击犯人的线索。也许那个家伙有什么东西"
"能唤回她的记忆也说不定。"
msgstr ""
"Lamento no haber podido ser de mucha ayuda. Sin "
"embargo, si no le importa, puedo darle algunas "
"pistas sobre el atacante más tarde. Quizás esa "
"persona tenga algo que pueda ayudarla a recuperar "
"la memoria."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3"
msgid "既然这样，那我还是先去准备今天的战斗吧。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, entonces, permítanme prepararme para la "
"batalla que se avecina."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_3_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第3天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 3 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_over"
msgid "生日快乐！不过今天也不是你的生日！"
msgstr ""
"¡Feliz Cumpleaños! ¡Aunque tal vez no sea tu "
"cumpleaños!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_over"
msgid "这根蜡烛也不是一根普通的蜡烛！"
msgstr "¡Además, esta vela no es una vela ordinaria!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_over"
msgid ""
"这是诅咒蜡烛，一旦有怪物把它摧毁掉，那个怪物就会被"
"诅咒！"
msgstr ""
"¡Es una encantada Vela Maldita! ¡Si un enemigo la "
"destruye, ese monstruo será maldecido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_over"
msgid ""
"被诅咒的怪物会染上诅咒的火焰，并且在死亡后会直接爆"
"开！"
msgstr ""
"¡El monstruo maldecido se prendera en llamas "
"malditas, y explotarán cuando mueran!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_over"
msgid "千万别把它弄坏了！"
msgstr "Así que, hagas lo que hagas, ¡No la rompas!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_3_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第3天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 3 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，我找你有事。"
msgstr "Steve, hablemos un momento, por favor."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "啊，觉大人，您有事找我？"
msgstr "Ah, Dama Satori, ¿Quería verme?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "是的，关于你的那位养父……"
msgstr "Así es, es sobre tu padre adoptivo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "戴夫？"
msgstr "¿Dave?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "你确定他疯掉了吗？"
msgstr "¿Estás seguro de que se ha vuelto loco?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "……怎么了？"
msgstr "...¿Qué quieres decir?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "没什么，我只是想了解一下你们之间的故事。"
msgstr ""
"No es nada. Solo quería entender el vínculo que "
"existe entre ustedes dos."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "这样啊。"
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "说实话， 我不清楚他是不是真的疯了。"
msgstr ""
"Pare ser honesto, no estoy seguro que él se haya "
"vuelto loco."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "当我从昏迷中醒来之后，他就完全变了一个人。"
msgstr ""
"Desde que desperté del coma, se ha convertido en "
"una persona completamente diferente."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "嘴里说着一堆胡话，性格和之前大不相同。"
msgstr ""
"Suelta todo tipo de tonterías, hablando de "
"Gensokyo y demás, y su personalidad no se parece "
"en nada a la de antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"我一度怀疑他到底是不是真的戴夫。但是他是我的父亲，"
"而且我还能感受得到，他真的还爱着我。"
msgstr ""
"Incluso llegué a dudar de si realmente era Dave o "
"no, pero sigue siendo mi padre, y aún puedo sentir "
"que me ama de verdad."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "我没有其他选择，我只能相信……他疯掉了。"
msgstr ""
"No me queda más remedio que creer que... se ha "
"vuelto loco."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"在我昏迷之前，戴夫他曾经得了一场重病，可能是那场病"
"让他变成这样的。"
msgstr ""
"Antes de que yo cayera en coma, Dave padecía una "
"enfermedad grave. Quizás esa enfermedad fue lo que "
"lo convirtió en lo que era."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "我只能像他之前照顾我一样，把他照顾好。"
msgstr ""
"Lo único que puedo hacer ahora es cuidarlo, igual "
"que él solía cuidarme a mí."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "你是个有孝心的孩子。"
msgstr ""
"Steve, eres un buen chico que quiere mucho a sus "
"padres."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "但是……"
msgstr "Pero..."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "我希望你长大后，能坦然接受一些事实。"
msgstr ""
"Espero que cuando crezcas, seas capaz de aceptar "
"ciertas verdades con serenidad."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（觉大人的意思……难道说，戴夫他——）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Espera, ¿La Dama Satori quiere decir "
"que...? ¿Será que, Dave—)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "不，孩子。那位村民就是你的养父，别想太多。"
msgstr ""
"No, Steve. Ese aldeano es tu padre adoptivo. No lo "
"sobre pienses."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "啊，抱歉。"
msgstr "L-Lo siento."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（这样的话，我至少能够放下心来了，戴夫"
"还是那个戴夫。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Si ese es el caso, no tengo por qué "
"preocuparme. Dave sigue siendo el mismo Dave que "
"conozco).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（没有人能在觉大人面前撒谎的！）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Nadie puede mentirle a la Dama "
"Satori!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"对了，阿空说要送给你这件东西当礼物，她说也许这能够"
"帮上你的忙。"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, Okuu me pidió que te lo regalara. Dijo "
"que podría serte útil."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid "哇，好重！这是什么？"
msgstr "Whoa, ¡Es muy pesado! ¿Qué es esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"这是她的一根核能控制棒，是用来调节核聚变炉的火力"
"的。"
msgstr ""
"Es una de sus barras de control nuclear, utilizada "
"para regular el calor del horno nuclear."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group palace_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_3_map"
msgid ""
"试试看吧，史蒂夫。也许你的那些蓝图也需要这种东西也"
"说不定。"
msgstr ""
"Inténtalo, Steve. Quizás tus planos podrían "
"sacarle provecho."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第4天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 4 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4"
msgid "那边那个诡异的石英骷髅是什么东西？"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué es ese esqueleto de sílice espeluznante y "
"aterrador que hay ahí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4"
msgid "那个东西很麻烦的。"
msgstr "Es un verdadero fastidio lidiar con eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4"
msgid ""
"咱曾经尝试过把它打散架，结果不出一会它自己又站起来"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Una vez intenté hacerlo pedazos, pero enseguida se "
"volvió a levantar solo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4"
msgid "那次我不得不把它炸烂才彻底解决它。"
msgstr ""
"Una vez tuve que hacerlo volar por los aires para "
"deshacerme de él de una vez por todas."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4"
msgid "也就是说，它会复活……？"
msgstr ""
"Entonces, ¿Eso significa que puede volver a la "
"vida...?"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_4_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第4天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 4 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_over"
msgid "这是石眼！"
msgstr "¡Este es el Ojo de Piedra!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_over"
msgid ""
"它的高耐久可以阻挡怪物的攻击，并且可以用视线让前方"
"的敌人减速！"
msgstr ""
"¡Su gran resistencia le permite soportar los "
"ataques de los monstruos, e incluso puede "
"ralentizar a los enemigos que tiene delante con su "
"mirada! ¡Las piedras sí que pueden romper los "
"huesos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_over"
msgid "不要站在它的面前！"
msgstr "¡Solo no te pares enfrente de él!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_4_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第4天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 4 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"关于朱鹭子受到的那次袭击，之前也有出现过很多类似的"
"案件。"
msgstr ""
"En cuanto a la agresión sufrida por Tokiko, ya se "
"han dado muchos casos similares con anterioridad."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"部分受害者受到袭击之后，就陷入了长期失去意识的状"
"态。但那并非死亡，只是灵魂被从身体中抽走了。"
msgstr ""
"Algunas víctimas cayeron en un estado prolongado "
"de inconsciencia tras ser atacadas, pero no han "
"muerto. Sus almas han sido separadas de sus "
"cuerpos."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "灵魂吗……"
msgstr "¿Almas...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"不过，剩下的那些比较幸运的人，都只是头部受到了扁平"
"物体的打击，我之前也有向他们了解过情况。"
msgstr ""
"En cuanto a los más afortunados, solo sufrieron "
"golpes en la cabeza con un objeto plano. También "
"he hablado con ellos anteriormente."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"他们在受袭之前，都是孤身一人的状态，并且在房间外面"
"见到了一个奇怪的箱子。"
msgstr ""
"Antes de ser atacados, estaban solos en el "
"interior de la casa y vieron un cofre extraño "
"afuera."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "箱——箱子？"
msgstr "¿¡U-Un cofre!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "朱鹭子，你想起来了？！"
msgstr "¿¡Tokiko, acaso estas recordando algo!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "不好意思，没有。不过，我似乎有点印象就是了。"
msgstr ""
"No, lo siento, pero siento como si vagamente "
"recordará algo."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"我总感觉，我好像见过什么奇怪的箱子，但是我不太记得"
"那个箱子长什么样了。"
msgstr ""
"Tengo la sensación de haber visto una especie de "
"cofre extraño, pero no logro recordar qué aspecto "
"tenía."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"这样啊。那个箱子可能就是袭击者为了引诱人出来的诱"
"饵。"
msgstr ""
"Ya veo. Ese cofre podría haber sido un cebo "
"utilizado por el atacante para atraer a las "
"víctimas."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "我暂且把这些袭击的犯人称之为“猎手”。"
msgstr ""
"Por el momento, me referiré al autor de estos "
"ataques como \"Cazador\"."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "“猎手”……？"
msgstr "¿\"Cazador\"...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"因为这些袭击看起来，就像是犯人在狩猎别人的灵魂一"
"样。"
msgstr ""
"Porque estos ataques dan la impresión de que el "
"perpetrador está cazando las almas de las personas."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"不过，说来也很奇怪。那些只是头部受伤的受害者，他们"
"其实都有一个诡异的共同点。"
msgstr ""
"Pues bien, hay algo bastante extraño. Las víctimas "
"que solo sufrieron lesiones en la cabeza comparten "
"un rasgo común peculiar."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "那就是他们在昏迷之前进入了屋子里。"
msgstr ""
"Es decir, todos estaban dentro de un edificio "
"antes de perder el conocimiento."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "诶？"
msgstr "¿Huh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "说起来确实是这样！"
msgstr "Ahora que lo mencionas, ¡Eso es verdad!"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "我们发现朱鹭子的时候，她确实昏迷在屋子里！"
msgstr ""
"¡Cuando encontramos a Tokiko, ella esta colapsada "
"adentro de Kourindou!"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "……果然，但也很奇怪。"
msgstr "...Seguramente, pero sigue siendo extraño."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "为什么进入屋子里，猎手就会放弃他的目标了？"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué el \"Cazador\" abandonaría a sus "
"objetivos una vez que están dentro de un edificio?"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"并且，那些被抽掉灵魂的受害者，他们被发现时，都是被"
"装进了这个箱子里面。"
msgstr ""
"Además, las víctimas cuyas almas fueron "
"arrebatadas fueron encontradas todas metidas "
"dentro de ese cofre."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "这是犯人的某种癖好吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Se trata de algún tipo de hábito enfermizo y "
"retorcido del perpetrador?"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid ""
"尽管我能读取他人的内心想法，但我现在确实没有任何有"
"关犯人是谁的证据。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque puedo leer la mente de las personas, "
"actualmente no tengo pruebas de quién es el "
"culpable."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "我调查过的人中，没有任何人有关于犯案的记忆。"
msgstr ""
"Entre las personas que he investigado, ninguna "
"tiene algún recuerdo relacionado con estos delitos."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group palace_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_4_map"
msgid "可能，我需要调查一下其他东西……？"
msgstr "¿Quizás deba investigar otra cosa...?"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_5
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第5天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 5 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid "话说回来，史蒂夫。"
msgstr "Hablando de otro tema, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid "那些方块生物……非常奇怪。"
msgstr "Esas criaturas cuadrada son... muy extrañas."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid "呃，对你们来说确实是这样的……"
msgstr ""
"Huh, supongo que eso es cierto para ustedes..."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid "我不是这个意思。"
msgstr "Eso no es lo que quise decir."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid ""
"这些方块生物中虽然大部分都是亡灵生物，但也不乏有一"
"些活物。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque la mayoría de esas criaturas cúbicas son no "
"muertas, también hay algunos seres vivos entre "
"ellas."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid ""
"按理来说我应该是可以读取那些活物的内心的，但是——"
msgstr ""
"Lógicamente, debería poder leer los pensamientos "
"de los que están vivos, pero..."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid "我却没有办法做到。"
msgstr "Simplemente no puedo hacerlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid "呃，为什么？"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Pero por qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_5's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5"
msgid "我不清楚。看来这种生物真的是非常特殊了。"
msgstr ""
"No estoy segura. Parece que estas criaturas son "
"realmente muy especiales."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_5_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第5天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 5 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_over"
msgid "毁灭！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Destrucción!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_over"
msgid ""
"这是石砖加农炮！你可以把它放置在两个相邻的沙砾投手"
"上，然后点击它来发射毁灭性的炮弹！！！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Cañón de Ladrillo! ¡Puedes colocarlo "
"encima de dos Gravapultas continuos, luego hazle "
"clic para disparar un misil devastador!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_over"
msgid "让炮弹净化一切！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Bombardea a todos!!!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_5_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第5天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 5 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "对了，觉大人。"
msgstr "Por cierto, Dama Satori."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid ""
"有关这起异变的事情吗？嗯，我确实还记得之前发生过的"
"一件事。"
msgstr ""
"¿Sobre este incidente? Mmm, sí recuerdo algo que "
"sucedió antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid ""
"那位小人公主提到的，三年前，辉针城下方发生过的爆"
"炸，其实我知道它发生的位置在哪里。阿空跟我提过这件"
"事。"
msgstr ""
"Respecto a la explosión que tuvo lugar hace tres "
"años bajo el Castillo Shining Needle, que mencionó "
"la Princesa Inchling, sé exactamente dónde "
"ocurrió. Okuu me lo contó."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "其实就在妖怪之山上啦，我经常去那地方。"
msgstr ""
"Ocurrió en la montaña Youkai, ¿Sabes?, Voy allí "
"bastante a menudo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid ""
"妖怪之山……就是幻想乡里的那一座非常高的山脉吧？"
msgstr ""
"Montaña Youkai... ¿No es esa la montaña alta en "
"Gensokyo, no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "是的。而且具体位置的话——"
msgstr "Así, y más específicamente..."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "是在河童基地附近吧。"
msgstr "Fue cerca de un escondite kappa."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "河童基地吗……那里发生过什么？"
msgstr ""
"¿Un escondite kappa...? ¿Qué habrá pasado ahí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "终于找到你了，邻居！"
msgstr "¡Finalmente te he encontrado, vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "戴夫？你去哪儿了？"
msgstr "¿Dave? ¿Dónde has estados?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid ""
"我做了一个<color=red>新货物</color>，你可以去看看商"
"店！"
msgstr ""
"He creado un <color=red>nuevo producto</color>. "
"¡Ve a echarle un vistazo en la tienda!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "……又来推销了？"
msgstr ""
"...¿Eso es todo? ¿Solo vendiendo un nuevo producto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "也不全是。"
msgstr "No del todo."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "你见到朱鹭子吗？"
msgstr "¿Has visto a Tokiko?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "朱鹭子？呃，没有。"
msgstr "¿Tokiko? Uh, no."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "那她去哪儿了？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Dónde se habrá ido?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "呃、不知道啊。"
msgstr "No... lo sé."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "她不见了吗？"
msgstr "¿Se habrá perdido?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "要不我帮你们找找吧！"
msgstr "¿Quieres que te ayude a buscarla?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "地灵殿附近我很熟悉，应该很快就能找到的。"
msgstr ""
"Conozco muy bien la zona que rodea el Palacio. No "
"debería tardar mucho en encontrarla."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "那好吧。"
msgstr "Esta bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_5_map"
msgid "希望她不会出什么事情……"
msgstr "Espero que no le pase nada malo..."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_6
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第6天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 6 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "那些怪物又来了！准备器械和蓝图！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esos monstruos están llegando otra vez! ¡Tengo "
"que ir por mis planos y artilugios listos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "！！！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡¡¡!!!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "我的蓝图呢！"
msgstr "¿¡DÓNDE ESTÁN MIS PLANOS!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "怎么回事，怎么都没了！"
msgstr "¿¡Qué mie... todos se han desaparecido!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "那怎么对付这些怪物啊！"
msgstr ""
"¿¡C-cómo se supone que lucharé contra los "
"monstruos ahora!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "这样吧，邻居，我去把我压箱底的秘密武器拿来！"
msgstr ""
"¡Espera un segundo, vecino! ¡Tengo un arma secreta "
"que he guardado como ultimo recurso!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid "那是什么？"
msgstr "¿Arma secreta?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6"
msgid ""
"好了，我这就把它安装到战场上，接下来，你就准备看好"
"戏吧！"
msgstr ""
"Muy bien, voy a por él y colocarlo en el campo de "
"batalla. ¡Ahora, siéntense y disfruten del "
"espectáculo!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_6_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第6天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 6 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_over"
msgid "好了，狙击发射器，你就回来继续压箱底吧！"
msgstr ""
"Buen trabajo, Francotirador. ¡De vuelta al estante "
"polvoriento!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_over"
msgid "这是冷却单元！在核反应堆里常用的物品！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es la Capsula de Enfriamiento! ¡Un "
"componente común en los reactores nucleares!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_over"
msgid ""
"你可以把它放在器械上，来立即缩短它的充能时间！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puedes colocarlo sobre un artilugio para acortar "
"inmediatamente su tiempo de recarga!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_over"
msgid "好好冷静冷静！"
msgstr "¡Vamos a refrescarnos un rato!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_6_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第6天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 6 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "所以怎么回事，蓝图去哪里了！"
msgstr "¿Qué pasó? ¿Dónde estarán los planos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "是燐干的。她把那些东西都藏起来了。"
msgstr "Fue obra de Orin. Ella los escondió a todos."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "诶、诶？阿燐？"
msgstr "¿H-huh? ¿Orin?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "你为什么要这么做？！"
msgstr "¿¡Por qué harías una cosa como esa!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "我——我不知道啊！"
msgstr "¡N-No lo sé!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "啊？"
msgstr "¿Huh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid ""
"她的内心里确实有把你的蓝图都偷走的记忆，但是不知道"
"为什么，她的这段记忆很模糊，也不知道她为什么要这么"
"做。"
msgstr ""
"Es cierto que recuerda haber robado tus planos, "
"pero, curiosamente, esos recuerdos son muy "
"confusos y no logro comprender sus motivos."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid ""
"等咱回过神来的时候，咱连自己做了什么都已经不清楚"
"了！"
msgstr ""
"Cuando recuperé la consciencia, ¡Ni siquiera sabía "
"lo que había hecho!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid ""
"之前咱还以为是做了什么梦，不过现在看来，并不是这"
"样！"
msgstr ""
"Pensaba que todo había sido una especie de sueño, "
"pero ahora... ¡Parece que no lo fue!"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "就好像，是被什么人控制了一样！"
msgstr "Era como ... ¡Si hubiera estado manipulada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "啊？控制？"
msgstr "¿Manipulada?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "总之，阿燐，你先把那些蓝图都拿回来吧。"
msgstr ""
"En cualquier caso, Orin, por favor, ve primero a "
"recuperar esos planos."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "是，是……咱似乎还记得那个位置。"
msgstr ""
"S-sí ... Creo que todavía recuerdo dónde las puse."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "那咱先告辞了……对不起。"
msgstr "Me voy ahora... lo siento."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "究竟发生了什么……？"
msgstr "¿Qué estará pasando...?"

#. Description for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（燐离场）"
msgstr "(Rin se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "史蒂夫先生，我找到朱鹭子小姐了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Señor Steve! ¡Encontré a la Señorita Tokiko!"

#. Description for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（空入场）"
msgstr "(Utsuho aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "哦？她在哪儿？"
msgstr "¿Oh? ¿Dónde está ella?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "！她在灼热地狱遗址做什么？！"
msgstr ""
"¡! ¿¡Qué hace ella en las Ruinas del Infierno "
"Ardiente!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "那地方全是岩浆，对她这样的妖怪来说很危险！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ese lugar está lleno de lava! ¡Es extremadamente "
"peligroso para una youkai como ella!"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "不——不知道啊！我还以为她在那里玩……"
msgstr ""
"¡Yo... yo no lo sé! Pensé que solo estaba jugando "
"allí..."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "总之，我们快赶过去！"
msgstr "¡Tenemos que llegar rápido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "朱鹭子，你在那里做什么！"
msgstr "T-Tokiko, ¿¡Qué estás haciendo aquí!?"

#. Description for talk sentence 22 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（来到灼热地狱遗址）"
msgstr ""
"(Llegan hacia los Restos del Infierno Ardiente)"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "呃——咕、啊、呃呃呃……"
msgstr "¿Ughh...? Ack... uh, uuugh..."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "朱鹭子，你怎么了！"
msgstr "Tokiko, ¿¡Estás bien!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "她的内心现在非常混乱！充满了杂音！"
msgstr ""
"¡Su mente está hecha un lío ahora mismo! ¡Está "
"llena de ruido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid ""
"怎么回事！她那里也太危险了！下面是一片岩浆湖！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esto es malo! ¡Desde donde está, va a caer al "
"lago de lava que hay abajo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "朱鹭子，你快下来！"
msgstr "¡Tokiko, bajate de ahí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "呃呃呃呃呃、咕——啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
msgstr "¡Uggghhhh...Augh—UWAAAAAAAHHH!"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid ""
"不！！！！！！<color=blue>（朱鹭子掉下去了！！！）"
"</color>"
msgstr ""
"¡¡¡¡¡¡NOOO!!!!!! <color=blue>(¡¡¡ELLA SE CAYÓ!!!)</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（怎么……会这样……）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¿Cómo... pudo haber...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "给我把她吹回去！！！快！"
msgstr "¡Que la vuelvan a subir! ¡RÁPIDO!"

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "发生什么了！"
msgstr "¿¡H-huh!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "阿燐！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Orin!!!"

#. Description for talk sentence 33 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid ""
"（刚刚回来的燐，将一个木风扇扔到了朱鹭子的下方，把"
"她吹了回去。）"
msgstr ""
"(Rin, que acaba de regresar, lanza un ventilador "
"de madera debajo de Tokiko, haciendo que vuelva "
"arriba por el viento)."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，快！接住她！"
msgstr "¡DATE PRISA, STEVE! ¡ATRÁPALA!"

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "朱鹭子！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Tokiko!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "呃、啊啊啊……"
msgstr "Ugh... aahhh..."

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "快，我们把她带回安全的地方！"
msgstr "¡Rápido! ¡Llévenla a un lugar seguro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group palace_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_6_map"
msgid "回地灵殿！"
msgstr "¡Devuelta hacia el Palacio!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_7
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第7天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 7 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "还好咱赶到了……幸好她没事。"
msgstr ""
"Milagro de haberlo hecho a tiempo... Gracias al "
"destino, ella está bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid ""
"放心吧，朱鹭子的情绪现在已经稳定下来了，身体也没有"
"大碍。之后我们和她谈谈吧。"
msgstr ""
"Tranquilos, Tokiko ya se ha calmado y no está "
"herida. Hablaremos con ella más tarde."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "谢天谢地……真的太好了。"
msgstr "¡Menos mal!... Eso es realmente genial."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "另外，今天的话，好像是有新的怪物出现了。"
msgstr ""
"Además, parece que hoy ha aparecido un nuevo "
"monstruo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "手里拿着奇怪的金属板，不知道它是干什么的。"
msgstr ""
"Tiene en la mano una extraña placa metálica. No "
"tengo ni idea de para qué sirve."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "是吗，让我——"
msgstr "¿En serio? Déjame..."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "——？"
msgstr "¿...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "原来是一种叫“黑客”的怪物？"
msgstr "¿Entonces se le llama \"Hacker\"?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid "呃，对……"
msgstr "S-sí..."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（奇怪，在我的记忆中，我很确信我不曾见"
"过这种凋灵骷髅黑客。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Extraño... Estoy absolutamente seguro "
"de que nunca antes había visto este tipo de hacker "
"Esqueleto Wither).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（但是，为什么它却告诉我，这种怪物的样"
"子，我很熟悉？）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Pero ¿Por qué... Por qué me resulta "
"tan familiar?)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_7_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第7天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 7 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_over"
msgid "这是紫晶塔！它能够发射穿透一整行的激光！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Pilón de Amatista! ¡Dispara un láser "
"que atraviesa una fila entera!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_over"
msgid ""
"不过它的伤害很低，但是如果它受到的光照足够多，它的"
"激光威力和大小都会提升！"
msgstr ""
"¡Su daño base es muy bajo, pero si recibe "
"suficiente luz, tanto la potencia como el tamaño "
"del láser aumentan!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_over"
msgid "射穿你的敌人！"
msgstr "¡Haz que tus superestrellas BRILLEN MÁS!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_7_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第7天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 7 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "朱鹭子，你现在没事了？"
msgstr "¿Estás bien ahora, Tokiko?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "嗯。"
msgstr "Sí, en su mayoría."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "你之前去灼热地狱遗址，是为了？"
msgstr ""
"Cuando fuiste a las Ruinas del Infierno Ardiente "
"hace un rato... ¿Qué hacías allí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "诶？我去过那里吗？"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Yo fui allí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "你不记得了？"
msgstr "¿No lo recuerdas?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "抱歉，我真的没印象……"
msgstr "Lo siento, realmente no lo recuerdo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "之前发生什么了？"
msgstr "¿Qué paso antes de eso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "那时，我照常呆在地灵殿的庭院里。"
msgstr ""
"En aquel momento, yo estaba en el patio del "
"Palacio, como de costumbre."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid ""
"突然我的脑中变得一片空白，有一种奇怪的感觉占据了我"
"的脑子。"
msgstr ""
"Luego de repente, mi mente se quedó completamente "
"en blanco. Una extraña sensación se apoderó de mí."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "像是有人在呼唤我一样，那个声音说着——"
msgstr ""
"Era como si alguien me estuviera llamando. Esa voz "
"decía..."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "“远离他们，远离”——呃……那位先生。"
msgstr ""
"\"Manténgase alejado de ellos, lejos de...\" Eh... "
"ese caballero."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "远离……我？"
msgstr "¿Lejos... de mí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid ""
"然而就在这个念头产生后不久，我的脑子突然变得一团乱"
"麻，之后发生了什么我就不清楚了。"
msgstr ""
"Pero poco después de que surgiera ese pensamiento, "
"mi mente se volvió repentinamente confusa y no sé "
"qué pasó después."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "等我恢复意识的时候，已经躺在地灵殿的床上了。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando recuperé la consciencia, ya estaba de "
"vuelta dentro del Palacio, tumbada en una cama."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "那种感觉，我真的不想再经历第二次……"
msgstr ""
"Esa sensación... Realmente no quiero volver a "
"pasar por eso..."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "该不会，朱鹭子小妹也是和咱一样……被人控制了？"
msgstr ""
"¿Podría ser que la pequeña Tokiko estuviera "
"siendo... manipulada igual que yo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "被人控制？"
msgstr "¿Manipulada?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid ""
"咱也有过这样的经历，就在小妹你这件事发生前不久。"
msgstr ""
"Yo también tuve una experiencia similar, justo "
"antes que tú."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid ""
"那时咱不知道为什么，脑中突然就只有一个念头了。"
msgstr ""
"En ese momento, no sé por qué, pero de repente un "
"solo pensamiento me llenó la cabeza."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid ""
"那就是，把史蒂夫小弟你的所有蓝图搬走，然后藏起来。"
msgstr ""
"Consistía en agarrarlos todos y cada uno de los "
"planos de Steve y esconderlos."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "看来你好像处处被针对啊，邻居！"
msgstr "¡Parece que alguien te tiene manía, vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid ""
"……不过，往好处想，似乎因为这件事，咱才能及时赶到，"
"才没让小妹你陷入危险啊。"
msgstr ""
"...Pero, viéndole el lado positivo, parece que "
"gracias a eso pude llegar a tiempo y salvar a la "
"pequeña Tokiko de un peligro mayor."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid ""
"先不提那个家伙为什么对我的恶意如此之大了。做这些事"
"情的人到底是谁？"
msgstr ""
"Dejando de lado por un momento el motivo por el "
"cual esa persona siente tanta malicia hacia mí... "
"¿Quién diablos está haciendo esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group palace_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_7_map"
msgid "难道……是那个“猎手”干的吗？"
msgstr ""
"No me digan... ¿Qué el \"Cazador\" está detrás de "
"esto...?"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_8
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第8天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 8 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8"
msgid "说起来，觉大人呢？"
msgstr ""
"Cambiado de tema, ¿Dónde está la Dama Satori?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8"
msgid "觉大人啊，她早上说自己去外边调查了。"
msgstr ""
"¿Ah, la Ama Satori? Salió esta mañana. Dijo que "
"iba a investigar un poco."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8"
msgid "有关这些——呃，打人的事情。"
msgstr "Sobre los... uh, asaltos."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8"
msgid "这样啊。"
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8"
msgid "希望能有所进展吧。"
msgstr "Esperemos que haya algún progreso."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_8_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第8天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 8 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_over"
msgid "核平一切！"
msgstr "¡Si los atacas con armas nucleares, ganas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_over"
msgid ""
"这是核弹，你点燃它之后，他就会瞬间杀死极大范围内的"
"怪物！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es la Bomba Nuclear! ¡Una vez encendido, "
"mata instantáneamente a todos los monstruos en una "
"zona enorme!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_over"
msgid "并且不会留下任何尸体！"
msgstr "¡Ni siquiera dejará ni un solo cadáver!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_over"
msgid ""
"不过，它在爆炸之后，会直接破坏它所在的地块，导致你"
"暂时无法在这里放置器械！"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, ¡Tras detonar, destruirá la casilla "
"en la que se encontraba, impidiéndote "
"temporalmente colocar cualquier artilugio allí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_over"
msgid "战术核弹来袭！"
msgstr "¡Tenemos suerte que esté en nuestro bando!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_8_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第8天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 8 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "觉大人还没回来吗？"
msgstr "¿La Ama Satori no ha vuelto todavía?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "对啊，是不是有些太晚了？"
msgstr "¿No será que llegará un poco más tarde?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "……？等等，这边有个东西。"
msgstr "¿...? Espera, hay algo por allá."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "哦？"
msgstr "¿Oh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "箱子？"
msgstr "¿Un cofre?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "？"
msgstr "¿?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "我有一种不好的预感。要打开它吗？"
msgstr ""
"Tengo un mal presitimiento sobre esto. ¿Debemos "
"abrirlo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "打开吧！里面说不定有什么东西呢。"
msgstr "¡Abrerlo! ¡Tal vez haya algo dentro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "那就——"
msgstr "Bueno-"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
msgstr "¡WAAAAAAAAAAHHHHH!"

#. Description for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（箱子被打开，里面躺着的是昏迷的觉。）"
msgstr ""
"(El cofre se abre. Adentro está Satori acostada, "
"inconsciente)"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "觉、觉、觉大人！"
msgstr "¡A-Ama Satori!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "怎么回事！！！"
msgstr "¿¡P-pero que!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "发生什么了！"
msgstr "¿¡Qué paso!?"

#. Description for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（朱鹭子出场）"
msgstr "(Tokiko aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "这、这、这、这个箱子！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡Es- es- este... es el cofre!!!"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
msgstr "¡AAAAAAAAHHHH!"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "朱鹭子，你怎么了！"
msgstr "¡Tokiko, ¿qué te pasa?!"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "快把觉大人送去治疗！！！"
msgstr ""
"¡Rápido, lleven a la Ama Satori a una médico!"

#. Archive text for talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "来到永远亭。"
msgstr "Llegan a Eientei"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "怎么会这样……"
msgstr "Como pudo haber pasado esto..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "又来到这里了……"
msgstr "Aquí vamos de nuevo."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（觉大人居然也成为了袭击的受害者……）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Incluso la Dama Satori se convirtió "
"en una victima...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（可恶！到底是谁！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Maldita sea! ¿Quién será?!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "没想到，她也会成为犯人的目标。"
msgstr ""
"No esperaba que ella también se convirtiera en una "
"víctima."

#. Description for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（永琳出场）"
msgstr "(Eirin aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "一个好消息和一个坏消息。我直接说了吧。"
msgstr ""
"Buenas y malas noticias. Iré directo al grano."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"好消息是她受到的物理伤害不严重，只有头部遭到击打而"
"已，没有出血，也没有后遗症可能。"
msgstr ""
"La buena noticia es que sus lesiones físicas no "
"son graves. El golpe en la cabeza no le provocó "
"hemorragia interna ni riesgo de secuelas."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "那实在是太好了。"
msgstr "Eso es un gran alivio."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "我还没说完。"
msgstr "Aun no he terminado."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "坏消息是，她的灵魂被剥离出身体了。"
msgstr ""
"La mala noticia, es que su alma ha sido extraida "
"de su cuerpo."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "！"
msgstr "¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "没有了灵魂，她就只能一直沉睡下去。"
msgstr ""
"Sin su alma, permanecerá en este letargo para "
"siempre."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "觉大人，醒不过来了吗……"
msgstr "¿La Ama Satori... no despertará...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"还有最后一个办法。那就是直接找那个犯人，把他打败之"
"后兴许能让他把灵魂还回来。"
msgstr ""
"Aún queda una última opción. Enfréntate "
"directamente al culpable, derrótalo y tal vez "
"puedas obligarlo a devolverle su alma."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "这怎么找？！"
msgstr "¿¡Pero como lo encontraremos!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"如果有点线索的话，我可能可以帮你们找出他。不过，那"
"位能提供线索的小姐，现在正躺在床上呢。"
msgstr ""
"Si tienes alguna pista, tal vez pueda ayudarte a "
"encontrarlo. Sin embargo, la joven que podría "
"proporcionarlas ahora está en cama."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"之前她倒是对我守口如瓶，如今连说话这件事都做不到"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"Antes no me decía nada, y ahora ni siquiera puede "
"hablar."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "怎么办……"
msgstr "¿Qué hacemos ahora...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "那个——大夫？"
msgstr "Umm... ¿Doctora?"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "朱鹭子？"
msgstr "¿Tokiko?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "我好像，想起来了。"
msgstr "Yo creo... que recuerdo ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "！你想起来了？！"
msgstr "¡! ¿¡Tu recuerdas algo!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "嗯，至少大部分都想起来了吧……"
msgstr ""
"Sí, al menos... ya recuerdo la mayor parte..."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "在——看到那个可怕的箱子之后。"
msgstr ""
"Después... de haber visto ese terrorifico cofre."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "……箱子？"
msgstr "...¿Cofre?"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"你们还在船上的时候，我在香霖堂看店。那个紫色的木头"
"箱子就莫名其妙地出现在店外了。"
msgstr ""
"Mientras tú estabas en el barco, yo me quedé en "
"Kourindou. Fue entonces cuando, de la nada, "
"apareció un cofre de madera púrpura a pocos pasos "
"de la puerta."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "我上前看了看，那个箱子被锁着，打不开。"
msgstr ""
"Me acerqué para echar un vistazo más de cerca. El "
"cofre estaba cerrado con llave, así que no pude "
"abrirlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "并且，上面还雕刻着奇怪的画。"
msgstr "Además... tenía extraños grabados."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"我感觉这个东西很不妙，于是转身就准备回香霖堂，结果"
"头就被重重地打了一下。"
msgstr ""
"Tuve un muy mal presentimiento, así que me di la "
"vuelta, y cuando estaba a punto de regresar a "
"Kourindou, recibí un fuerte golpe en la cabeza."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "那时的我下意识地，拼了命地往屋子里面跑。"
msgstr ""
"En ese momento, instintivamente corrí de vuelta a "
"la tienda."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "然后，我就什么都不记得了。"
msgstr "Después de eso... No recuerdo nada más."

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "醒来之后，我就已经在这个地方了。"
msgstr "Lo siguiente que sé, es que desperté aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "……原来如此。"
msgstr "...Ya veo."

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"明白了，我会帮你们制作一些药水，这些药水应该能把它"
"引过来。"
msgstr ""
"Entendido. Prepararé algunas pociones de almas "
"para ti. Con eso debería ser suficiente."

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "需要几天时间，之后你们再来拿吧。我先告辞了。"
msgstr ""
"Tardarán unos días. Cuando estén listos, pasen a "
"recogerlos. Me despido ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "觉大人——有救吗……？"
msgstr "La Ama Satori... ¿Podrá ser salvada...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "一定会的，阿空！"
msgstr "¡Absolutamente lo hará, Okuu!"

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "史蒂夫？"
msgstr "¿Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "朱鹭子？有什么事吗？"
msgstr "¿Tokiko?"

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "我确实都想起来了。"
msgstr "Realmente lo he recordado todo."

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"我是……不对，我原本没有名字，大家都叫我朱鹭子，所以"
"我之后也就叫这个名字了。"
msgstr ""
"Yo no..., originalmente no tenía nombre. Todos me "
"llamaban Tokiko, así que adopté ese nombre."

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"然后，霖之助在三年前把香霖堂那家店交给我代理。"
msgstr ""
"Hace tres años, Rinnosuke me confió de Kourindou."

#. Text for talk sentence 44 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "再然后，我和史蒂夫，以及戴夫先生相遇了。"
msgstr ""
"Después de eso, te conocí a ti y al Señor Dave."

#. Text for talk sentence 45 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "一直到现在的事情，我都差不多想起来了。"
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que ha pasado hasta ahora... prácticamente "
"lo recuerdo todo."

#. Text for talk sentence 46 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "恭喜你找回记忆，小妹。"
msgstr ""
"¡Felicidades por recuperar tus recuerdos, pequeña!"

#. Text for talk sentence 47 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "阿燐，抱歉，因为我的事情，反而拖累了觉小姐。"
msgstr ""
"Orin... Lo siento. Por lo que me pasó, La Señorita "
"Satori se vio involucrada en esto."

#. Text for talk sentence 48 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid ""
"不用太自责，我们会把那个犯人揪出来，把他痛扁一顿，"
"让他把觉大人还回来的！"
msgstr ""
"No te culpes. ¡Sacaremos a ese culpable, lo "
"meteremos en mi carro y la Ama Satori volverá!"

#. Text for talk sentence 49 in talk group palace_8_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_8_map"
msgid "好了，一起回地灵殿吧！"
msgstr "Muy bien, ¡Volvamos todos al Palacio!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_9
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第9天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 9 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9"
msgid "诶？快看，怪物之中有些猫！"
msgstr ""
"¿Eh? ¡Miren esto, hay algunos gatos entre los "
"monstruos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9"
msgid "啊？居然还是只僵尸猫，已经烂的不成样子了……"
msgstr ""
"¿Eh? ¿Qué?, ¡Incluso es un gato zombi, ya podrido "
"incluso desmoronándose!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9"
msgid "小心啊，史蒂夫小弟，猫们可是有九条命的！"
msgstr ""
"Pero ojo, pequeño Steve. ¡Los gatos tienen nueve "
"vidas!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_9_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第9天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 9 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_over"
msgid "啊哈，下界反应核！"
msgstr ""
"¡Un dispositivo arcano! ¡Es el Núcleo Reactor del "
"Nether."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_over"
msgid ""
"如果它被放置在一个由器械组成的，特殊形状的结构的中"
"心，它会持续产出星之碎片！"
msgstr ""
"Si se coloca en el centro de una formación de "
"artilugios especial, ¡Generará continuamente "
"Fragmentos Estelares!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_over"
msgid ""
"这个结构是：\n"
"<color=red>A</color><color=blue>B</"
"color><color=red>A</color>\n"
"<color=blue>B</color>X<color=blue>B</color>\n"
"<color=red>A</color><color=blue>B</"
"color><color=red>A</color>\n"
"<color=red>A</color>和<color=blue>B</color>是两种不"
"同的器械，X则是下界反应核！"
msgstr ""
"La formación es:\n"
"<color=red>A</color><color=blue>B</"
"color><color=red>A</color>\n"
"<color=blue>B</color>X<color=blue>B</color>\n"
"<color=red>A</color><color=blue>B</"
"color><color=red>A</color>\n"
"<color=red>A</color> y <color=blue>B</color> ¡Son "
"dos tipos diferentes de artilugios, y la X es el "
"Núcleo Reactor del Nether!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_over"
msgid "试着启动反应堆吧！"
msgstr "Mensaje del cliente: ¡Activo!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_9_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第9天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 9 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "对了，史蒂夫小弟，咱有件事情得跟你说一下。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, pequeño Steve, hay algo que tengo que "
"contarte."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid ""
"咱之前不是……偷偷地把你的武器都给藏起来了吗？当然是"
"不知道是什么原因。"
msgstr ""
"¿Recuerdas aquella vez antes cuando... escondí en "
"secreto todo tu equipo? Claro, entonces no tenía "
"ni idea de por qué lo hice."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "现在咱终于想起来是怎么回事了。"
msgstr "Pero ahora por fin he recordado lo que pasó."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "是因为什么？"
msgstr "¿Qué fue lo que paso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "咱说过，在那时候，咱好像是被人控制了。"
msgstr ""
"Como ya dije, en aquel momento sentí que alguien "
"me estaba manipulando."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid ""
"这个我之前倒是遇见过这样的情况，一只头戴金冠的凋灵"
"骷髅，能够精神控制其他人。"
msgstr ""
"Ya me he topado con algo parecido antes. Hay un "
"esqueleto wither que lleva una corona dorada y es "
"capaz de hipnotizar a los demás."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "不对，这次控制咱的好像不是那种怪物。"
msgstr ""
"No. Esta vez, quien me manipulaba no parecía ese "
"tipo de monstruo."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "在咱被控制之前，咱好像偶然间瞥到了某个身影。"
msgstr ""
"Justo antes de ser manipulada, alcancé a "
"vislumbrar una figura."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid ""
"那个身影，好像是一只之前在战场上见到过的黑骷髅黑"
"客。"
msgstr ""
"Esa figura... parecía uno de esos esqueletos "
"negros de hackers que había visto antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "然后，咱之后就不知道发生什么了……"
msgstr "Después de eso, no sé qué pasó..."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "啊？是黑客控制了你？"
msgstr "¿Huh? ¿Un Hacker te manipuló?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "说起来，我——"
msgstr "Ahora que lo mencionas, yo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "我在那次失控之前，好像确实——"
msgstr ""
"Antes de que me manipularan aquella vez, creo que "
"realmente si lo vi..."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "确实好像看到了一个黑骷髅黑客。"
msgstr ""
"Creo que sí vi un esqueleto negro, un hacker."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "那之后我就失去了意识。"
msgstr "Después de eso, perdí el conocimiento."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid ""
"这个黑客居然能控制别人的精神，甚至还差点害死了朱鹭"
"子……"
msgstr ""
"Ese hacker puede manipular la mente de la gente de "
"alguna manera... incluso casi provoca la muerte de "
"Tokiko..."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "怎么会有这样邪恶的怪物？"
msgstr "¿Cómo puede un monstruo ser tan malvado?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid ""
"史蒂夫小弟，如果你之后遇到那个黑客，请您也一定要小"
"心。"
msgstr ""
"Pequeño Steve, si alguna vez te encuentras con ese "
"hacker, tú también debes tener mucho cuidado."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "那个家伙看起来比想象中的要危险。"
msgstr ""
"Esa cosa parece incluso más peligrosa de lo que "
"aparenta."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "并且……对您的恶意十分之大。"
msgstr ""
"Incluso, parece tener muchísima malicia contra ti."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid "对，史蒂夫，一定要小心……"
msgstr ""
"Así es, Steve. Por favor, ten mucho cuidado..."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group palace_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_9_map"
msgid ""
"我明白了。就算是为了阿燐和朱鹭子，我也绝对不会放过"
"那个家伙的。"
msgstr ""
"Entendido. Si es por Orin y Tokiko, no perdonaré a "
"ese desgraciado."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_note
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "实验记录"
msgstr "Registro de Experimento"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_note"
msgid "这是什么？"
msgstr "¿Qué es esto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_note"
msgid "呃，某种实验记录吧？"
msgstr ""
"Ehh, ¿Algún tipo de registro de experimentos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_note"
msgid "我看一下。"
msgstr "Dejame echarle un vistazo"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_note"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_note"
msgid "算了，看不明白。"
msgstr "No importa. No la entiendo."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_10_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第10天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 10 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "史蒂夫先生，我把大夫做的灵魂药剂带来了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Señor Steve! ¡Le traje la poción del alma que "
"preparó la doctora!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "好，这下就能引诱那个可恶的家伙了！"
msgstr ""
"Perfecto. ¡Ahora podemos atraer a ese maldito "
"bastardo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "希望这样能把觉小姐的灵魂找回来。"
msgstr ""
"Ojalá podamos recuperar el alma de la Señorita "
"Satori de esta manera."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid ""
"她帮我了很多忙，她变成现在这样，我真的很难过。"
msgstr ""
"Ella me ayudó mucho... Verla terminar así "
"realmente me entristece."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "话说咱有一点比较在意……"
msgstr "Todavía hay algo que me inquieta..."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid ""
"之前在地灵殿门口的那个，发现觉大人时候的那个箱子去"
"哪里了？"
msgstr ""
"El cofre donde encontramos a la Ama Satori. ¿Dónde "
"está?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "诶？"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "啊，原来不是燐你搬走了吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Huh? Espera, ¿No fuiste tú quien la movió, Orin?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "没有啊，咱根本就没有动它。是史蒂夫小弟——？"
msgstr ""
"¡No! ¡Yo nunca lo toqué! ¿No será el pequeño "
"Steve...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "我也没动过它啊……朱鹭子？"
msgstr "Yo tampoco lo toqué... ¿Tokiko?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "诶？我见到它之后就吓坏了，根本就没动它……"
msgstr ""
"¿Ah? Me asusté muchísimo después de verlo... "
"Definitivamente no lo toqué..."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_10_map"
msgid "奇怪，难道是恋大人干的吗……？"
msgstr ""
"Que raro... Podría la Señorita Koishi haberla "
"movido...?"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_11
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第11天入场"
msgstr "Palacio Día 11 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11"
msgid "准备好了。"
msgstr "Ya estoy listo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11"
msgid ""
"空，在战斗开始后不久，你就使用那瓶灵魂药剂，把“猎"
"手”引过来吧。"
msgstr ""
"Okuu, poco después de que comience la batalla, usa "
"esa poción de alma y atrae al \"Cazador\" hasta "
"aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11"
msgid "明白了！"
msgstr "¡Entendido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11"
msgid "“猎手”到底是什么人呢……"
msgstr "¿Quién es exactamente ese \"Cazador\"...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11"
msgid "不清楚啊……"
msgstr "Ni idea..."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（我们没有这次的敌人的任何信息……只能硬"
"着头皮上了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(No tenemos información sobre este "
"enemigo... tendremos que atacar a ciegas).</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_11_boss
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第11天头目"
msgstr "Palacio Día 11 Jefe"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_11_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_boss"
msgid ""
"这——这个东西，不是我们之前在地灵殿门口见到的箱子"
"吗？"
msgstr ""
"Es-esto... ¿No es este el cofre que vimos antes "
"frente al Palacio?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_11_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_boss"
msgid "这个东西怎么会出现在这里？"
msgstr "¿¡Qué está haciendo aquí!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_11_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_boss"
msgid "不知道啊！"
msgstr "¡No lo sé!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_11_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_boss"
msgid "等等，这个箱子好像有动静！"
msgstr ""
"¡Un momento, parece que el cofre se está moviendo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_11_boss's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_boss"
msgid "！！！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡¡¡!!!!!"

#. Archive name for talk group palace_11_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第11天结束"
msgstr "Palacio Día 11 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_over"
msgid "……！"
msgstr "¡...!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_over"
msgid "总算是把它杀掉了……"
msgstr "F-Finalmente... lo matamos..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_over"
msgid "箱子居然是活的……闻所未闻！"
msgstr ""
"¡¿El cofre estaba vivo...?! ¡Nunca había oído nada "
"de algo así!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_over"
msgid ""
"刚才那个箱子死掉的时候，有很多的灵魂飞了出来！原来"
"它就是那个“猎手”！"
msgstr ""
"Cuando ese cofre murió hace un momento, ¡Salieron "
"volando montones de almas! ¡Así que esa cosa era "
"el \"Cazador\"!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_over"
msgid "希望觉大人的灵魂能回到她的体内……"
msgstr ""
"Espero que el alma de la Ama Satori haya regresado "
"a su cuerpo..."

#. Archive name for talk group palace_11_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "地灵殿第11天地图"
msgstr "Palacio Día 11 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "我们快去永远亭，看看觉大人有没有醒过来吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Apresurémonos a ir a Eientei y veamos si la Ama "
"Satori ha despertado!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "好！"
msgstr "¡SÍ!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "大夫，觉大人她怎么样了？"
msgstr "Doctora, ¿Cómo se encuentra la Ama Satori?"

#. Description for talk sentence 2 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（来到永远亭）"
msgstr "(Llegan a Eientei)"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "觉大人！"
msgstr "¡Ama Satori!"

#. Description for talk sentence 3 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（觉出场）"
msgstr "(Satori aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "看来我做了个很长的梦呢。"
msgstr "Parece que he tenido un sueño muy largo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "感谢您为我们做出的一切，史蒂夫先生。"
msgstr ""
"Gracias por todo lo que has hecho, Señor Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "举手之劳！"
msgstr "¡Solo fue pequeño favor!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（又在抢我功劳了……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Otra vez atribuyéndose el mérito...)</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "也谢谢您帮我们这么多！"
msgstr "¡Muchísimas gracias por ayudarnos también!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "实在是没有想到，犯人居然就是那个箱子。"
msgstr ""
"Pensar que el culpable era en realidad ese "
"cofre ..."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"当时我去调查案件，却在地灵殿前方就发现了那个箱子。"
msgstr ""
"Me topé con ese cofre fuera del Palacio cuando fui "
"a investigar el caso."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"我发现了它的不对，确认周围没有人后，尝试去调查它，"
"结果却被它所袭击。"
msgstr ""
"Me acerqué, sabiendo que algo no andaba bien. Tras "
"asegurarme de que no había nadie alrededor, "
"intenté examinarlo, pero me atacó."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"看来我过于依赖读心的能力，疏忽了其他的事情啊。"
msgstr ""
"Confié demasiado en mi capacidad para leer la "
"mente y descuidé las demás posibilidades."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "果然，在智慧这方面，没人能比得过您，医生。"
msgstr ""
"Como era de esperar, cuando se trata de sabiduría, "
"nadie puede superarlo, doctora."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"过奖。也还是靠朱鹭子小姐的线索才能得出的结论。"
msgstr ""
"Me halagas. También gracias a las pistas de Tokiko "
"llegamos a esa conclusión."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "托您的福，现在永远亭的病人们醒了很多。"
msgstr ""
"Gracias a todos ustedes, muchos de los pacientes "
"aquí en Eientei ya han despertado."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "诶？大夫您知道那个箱子就是犯人？"
msgstr ""
"¿Eh? ¿Sabía usted que el problema estaba en el "
"cofre, doctora?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"毕竟侦探也不是我的本分工作，我也只能在医学这方面帮"
"点忙了。"
msgstr ""
"El trabajo de detective no es lo mío. Solo puedo "
"ayudar con asuntos médicos."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "我先去看看其他醒来的病人了。"
msgstr ""
"Iré a ver cómo están los demás pacientes que han "
"despertado."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "不过……"
msgstr "Aún así..."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"我和觉小姐同样都是受害者，为什么我只是受了伤，觉小"
"姐却是被抽走了灵魂呢？"
msgstr ""
"La Señorita Satori y yo fuimos víctimas. ¿Por qué "
"yo solo resulté herida, mientras que a ella le "
"extrajeron el alma?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"我想，你还记得那个箱子体积有多大吧？大到连我都躺得"
"下呢。"
msgstr ""
"Supongo que aún recuerdas lo grande que era ese "
"cofre, ¿verdad? Es lo suficientemente grande como "
"para que yo quepa dentro."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "呃，所以？"
msgstr "Sí, ¿y qué?"

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "它进不去房门，就这么简单。"
msgstr "No cabía por las puertas. Así de simple."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"这也能说明，为什么那些及时进屋的受害者也只是受伤而"
"已。"
msgstr ""
"Eso también explica por qué las víctimas que "
"lograron entrar a tiempo solo sufrieron heridas "
"leves."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（好普通的原因！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Esa es una razón ordinaria!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"啊，还有，香霖堂的防御器械没有锁定它，也是因为——箱"
"子的伪装？"
msgstr ""
"Ah, además, los artilugios defensivos de Kourindou "
"tampoco lo atacaron. ¿Fue porque... está "
"disfrazado de un cofre común y corriente?"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "大概吧。我其实不是很懂器械这方面。"
msgstr "Probablemente. No sé mucho de artilugios."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（看来器械也不是万能的……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Parece que los artilugios tampoco son "
"todopoderosos...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "这个，收下吧！"
msgstr "¡Toma esto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "哇！突然出现的什么东西，好重！"
msgstr ""
"¡Guau! ¡Algo apareció de la nada! ¡Lo cual PESA "
"mucho!"

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "大概是我的妹妹为了表达感谢，送你的东西吧。"
msgstr ""
"Probablemente sea un regalo de mi hermana menor "
"para expresar su gratitud."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（能不能送些轻一点的东西！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿¡Podrían darme algo más liviano?!)</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "呵呵，明白啦，下次会的。"
msgstr "Jeje, lo haré. Tal vez la próxima vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "啊，已经这么晚了，差不多也该回去了吧。"
msgstr ""
"¡Ah, ya es tarde! Ya es hora de que volvamos."

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid ""
"这次就回香霖堂吧，朱鹭子的记忆已经恢复了，也没有必"
"要继续留在地灵殿了！"
msgstr ""
"Esta vez, volvamos a Kourindou. Tokiko ha "
"recuperado la memoria, ¡Así que ya no hay "
"necesidad de quedarse en el Palacio!"

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "那我们回去吧！"
msgstr "Entonces, volvamos a casa."

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "再见，觉大人！"
msgstr "¡Adiós, Dama Satori!"

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "……嗯，再见。"
msgstr "...Adiós."

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Description for talk sentence 39 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（史蒂夫、村民和朱鹭子离开）"
msgstr "(Steve, el Aldeano y Tokiko se van)"

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "觉大人，您在担心什么吗？"
msgstr "Ama Satori, ¿Le preocupa algo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "那个孩子……"
msgstr "Ese niño..."

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "史蒂夫小弟吗？"
msgstr "¿Se refiere al pequeño Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "嗯。"
msgstr "Sí."

#. Text for talk sentence 44 in talk group palace_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:palace_11_map"
msgid "希望他之后能接受这一切吧。"
msgstr ""
"Espero que pueda aceptar todo esto... Cuando "
"llegue el momento."

#. Archive name for talk group tutorial
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "教程"
msgstr "Tutorial"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "嘿，邻居，好久不见啊！"
msgstr "¡Eh, vecino! ¡Cuánto tiempo sin verte!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "上次见到你，已经是好久以前了啊！"
msgstr "¡Hace mucho que no nos cruzábamos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "现在掌握器械的经验怎么样了？"
msgstr "¿Qué tal vas ahora con los artilugios?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group tutorial's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "差不多快忘了吧？要不要复习一下呢？"
msgstr ""
"¿Se te olvidó todo? ¿Quieres que te refresque la "
"memoria?"

#. Archive text for talk group tutorial's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "如果进行教程"
msgstr "En caso de sí"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group tutorial's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "好了，现在开始吧！"
msgstr "¡Perfecto, vamos a darle caña!"

#. Archive text for talk group tutorial's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "如果不进行教程"
msgstr "En caso de no"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group tutorial's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "记性不错嘛！朋友！"
msgstr "¡Tienes buena memoria, compañero!"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group tutorial's section 3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "嘿！朋友！你看起来真的掌握了！"
msgstr "¡Ya le estás agarrando el truco, vecino!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group tutorial's section 3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "以至于我还什么都没说，你就已经完成教程了！"
msgstr ""
"¡No dije ni pío, y ya te acabaste el tutorial!"

#. Archive text for talk group tutorial's section 4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "开始序章"
msgstr "Al comienzo del Prólogo"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group tutorial's section 4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "啊！正说着呢，那些僵尸就又来开始进攻你了。"
msgstr "¡AH! Esos zombis vienen por ti otra vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group tutorial's section 4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:tutorial"
msgid "那么，朋友，用你的经验把他们干掉吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Vecino, usa tus habilidades para detenerlos!"

#. Archive name for talk group prologue_note
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "藏宝图？"
msgstr "¿Mapa de Tesoro?"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group prologue_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:prologue_note"
msgid "这看起来像是一个藏宝图啊！"
msgstr "¡Esto parece un mapa del tesoro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group prologue_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:prologue_note"
msgid "你觉得这个藏宝图的终点会有着什么呢？"
msgstr "¿Qué es ese portal al final del mapa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group prologue_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:prologue_note"
msgid "也许……这玩意会把我们带到什么神奇的地方！！！"
msgstr "Tal vez... ¡Nos lleve a lugares MÁGICOS!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group prologue_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:prologue_note"
msgid "甚至有可能是我天天跟你说的那个幻想乡！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puede que incluso lleguemos a ese mundo de "
"Gensokyo del que te he estado hablando!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group prologue_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:prologue_note"
msgid ""
"你知道的，那是个人类和妖怪共存的地方！还有好多神话"
"传说中神奇力量！"
msgstr ""
"Ya sabes, ¡Un mundo con humanos y youkai! ¡Incluso "
"poderes mágicos de diversas leyendas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group prologue_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:prologue_note"
msgid ""
"很疯狂吧？？？那我们就去找——这道看起来特别可疑的传"
"送门吧！"
msgstr ""
"¿¡UNA LOCURA, VERDAD!? ¡Vamos a por ti, portal "
"sospechoso de aspecto muy sospechoso!"

#. Archive name for talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "第五章-访问香霖堂"
msgstr "Capítulo 5-Visita a Kourindou"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（戴夫在外面检查防御系统，还没有回"
"来。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Dave aún no ha regresado de "
"inspeccionar los sistemas de defensa exteriores).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（上次香霖堂遭到了僵尸们的袭击，朱鹭子"
"差点就……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Si no hubiéramos llegado a tiempo "
"para detener la horda de zombis fuera de "
"Kourindou, Tokiko habría sido...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（在那之后，我们开始在外围建设一些器械"
"作为防御装置，防止类似的情况发生。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Bueno, después de todo, instalamos "
"algunos artilugios fuera de la tienda para repeler "
"futuros ataques).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "搞定了，现在那些器械已经能正常工作了。"
msgstr ""
"Con eso debería bastar. Esos artilugios ya "
"funcionan como deberían."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "希望如此吧。"
msgstr "Eso espero."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "<color=blue>（气氛还是好凝重……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(El ambiente sigue tenso...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "那个。"
msgstr "Entonces, uh..."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "啊，朱鹭子，怎么了？"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Tokiko, ¿Pasa algo? ¿Algo que te preocupa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "就是上次，那个袭击我的奇怪的影像。"
msgstr ""
"Se trata de ese extraño holograma que me atacó la "
"última vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "那个家伙，好像认识史蒂夫先生。"
msgstr "Ese tipo... parece saber quién eres, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "史蒂夫先生，你认识他吗？"
msgstr "¿Reconoces a esa persona?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "怎么了？"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa con esa mirada?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "我——说不太清楚。"
msgstr "Yo ... no estoy seguro"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "诶？"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"之前我有和你在闲聊的时候说过，关于我的手臂的事情。"
msgstr ""
"¿Recuerdas cuando te conté sobre mi brazo "
"prostético?"

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"我记得是——你陷入了很长时间的昏迷，等你醒来之后，你"
"的手臂就已经变成假手了。"
msgstr ""
"Si no recuerdo mal... caíste en un coma prolongado "
"y, cuando despertaste, tu brazo se había "
"convertido en una prótesis."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "嗯，对的，那之后我就失去了很多记忆。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, así es. Fue entonces cuando perdí muchos de "
"mis recuerdos."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "在我昏迷之前的很多事情……我怎么想也想不起来。"
msgstr ""
"Muchas cosas que sucedieron antes de mi coma... no "
"puedo recordarlas, por mucho que lo intente."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "不过，其实我莫名有一点小小的印象。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, inexplicablemente, tengo un vago "
"recuerdo."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "在我昏迷之前，我似乎曾经认识过一个人。"
msgstr ""
"Antes de caer en coma, creo que conocía a alguien."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"但是，我已经怎么样也想不起来那个人到底是谁了。"
msgstr ""
"Pero... la verdad es que no recuerdo quién era "
"exactamente esa persona."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"他是谁？他和我是什么关系？我已经彻底失去这方面的印"
"象了。"
msgstr ""
"¿Quién era? ¿Qué relación teníamos? Me temo que lo "
"he olvidado por completo."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "那个影像，应该就是他吧。"
msgstr ""
"Pero ese holograma... ¿Podría ser...? No, tal vez. "
"Supongo que es posible."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "这样吗……"
msgstr "...¿Qué sería?"

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"可能，我对那个家伙做了什么不可饶恕的事情，他是来找"
"我寻仇的也说不定。"
msgstr ""
"Tal vez le hice algo imperdonable en el pasado, y "
"probablemente ahora esté aquí para vengarse."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"怎、怎么可能！史蒂夫先生这么善良，怎么会做那种事情"
"呢？"
msgstr ""
"¡D-De ninguna manera! ¡Eres la persona más amable "
"que conozco, Steve! Jamás harías algo así."

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "请问，史蒂夫在这里吗？"
msgstr "Disculpa, ¿Steve está aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "啊，我在，你是？"
msgstr "Ah, ese soy yo. ¿Con quién tengo gusto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"我是来自命莲寺的僧侣——寅丸 星，我此次前来是有事求于"
"史蒂夫先生。"
msgstr ""
"Soy, Shou Toramaru, una monje del Templo Myouren. "
"He venido hacia ti por una petición."

#. Description for talk sentence 35 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（星出场）"
msgstr "(Shou aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "什么事？"
msgstr "¿Una petición?"

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"在前不久，幻想乡内出现了一条红色的恶龙，它四处破"
"坏，为祸人间。"
msgstr ""
"No hace mucho tiempo, un malvado dragón rojo ha "
"aparecido en Gensokyo, causando estragos en su "
"tierra y en su gente."

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"我们命莲寺的住持——圣 白莲大人，因此独自离开了寺庙前"
"去降伏这头恶龙。"
msgstr ""
"Byakuren Hijiri, la suma sacerdotisa del templo "
"Myouren, dejó el templo para someter a aquel "
"malvado dragón."

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"但是，她已经好几天没有回来了，我们也没有她的任何消"
"息，因此我们决定要乘坐圣辇船前去寻找她的下落。"
msgstr ""
"Pero... no ha regresado en días, y aún no hemos "
"recibido ninguna noticia de ella, así que hemos "
"decidido viajar en el Barco Palanquín en busca de "
"su paradero."

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "圣辇船是……？"
msgstr "¿Barco Palanquín?"

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"圣辇船是我们的一艘可以在空中飞行的船，创造它的也是"
"圣。"
msgstr ""
"Es una nave nuestra capaz de navegar por los "
"cielos, que también fue creada por Hijiri."

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "<color=blue>（又、又是空中吗……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Lo que faltaba, devuelta en los "
"cielos...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "那么，为什么需要我帮忙呢？"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿Qué necesitan de mí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 44 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"因为，在天空上我们总是会遭到另一艘敌对船只的袭击。"
msgstr ""
"Pues bien, hemos estado bajo el ataque constante "
"de un barco hostil que también surca los cielos."

#. Text for talk sentence 45 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"那艘船会靠近我们，建起桥梁，然后放出僵尸登船攻击。"
msgstr ""
"Ese barco se acerca a nosotras, instala un puente "
"de abordaje y luego hordas de zombis abordan "
"nuestro barco y nos atacan."

#. Text for talk sentence 46 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"我们没有足够的力量对抗它们，因此需要您的帮助。"
msgstr ""
"Nuestras fuerzas por sí solas no son suficientes "
"para combatirlos. Por lo tanto, solicitamos su "
"ayuda."

#. Text for talk sentence 47 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "<color=blue>（哈……又是僵尸啊。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Oh por su puesto que eran esos "
"zombis...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 48 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"对了，我这次，是受神子的引荐而来，她也希望您能随我"
"们一起去。"
msgstr ""
"También debo mencionar que estoy aquí hoy por "
"sugerencia de la Principe Miko, y a ella también "
"le gustaría que se unieran a nosotras en este "
"viaje."

#. Text for talk sentence 49 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "神子吗……"
msgstr "Oh, Miko..."

#. Text for talk sentence 50 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（说起来，神子大人确实曾经说过。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Cierto, la Señorita Miko dijo algo "
"así).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 51 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（她会把我介绍给一位高僧，说是也许这能"
"帮我解决我一直以来的疑问。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Ella me presentaría a cierta suma "
"sacerdotisa que tal vez podría ayudarme a "
"responder las preguntas que rondaban por mi mente)."
"</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 52 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（说的应该就是星口中的那位白莲大人"
"吧。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Supongo que esa suma sacerdotisa "
"podría ser Byakuren que Shou mencionó).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 54 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "好，我随你们一起去吧。"
msgstr "De acuerdo, iré contigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 55 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "我也有些事情想从你们那里了解。"
msgstr ""
"Además que tengo algunas preguntas que me gustaría "
"decir a tu suma sacerdotisa."

#. Text for talk sentence 56 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "朱鹭子，你自己一个人在这里应该没问题吧？"
msgstr "¿Vas a estar bien estando aquí sola, Tokiko?"

#. Text for talk sentence 57 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "嗯，有防御器械在这边，应该是没有大问题的。"
msgstr ""
"Así es. Yo debería estar bien con esos artilugios "
"defendiendo el alrededor."

#. Text for talk sentence 58 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "史蒂夫先生就放心吧。"
msgstr "No necesitas preocuparte por mi, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 59 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "好，那我们走吧。"
msgstr "Muy bien, entonces vámonos."

#. Text for talk sentence 60 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "请随我们来吧。"
msgstr "Por aquí, por favor."

#. Text for talk sentence 61 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_1"
msgid "呦呵呵——登船啦！"
msgstr "¡Yo-jo-jo! ¡Todos a booooooordo!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第1天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 1 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1"
msgid "它们来了！那艘船出现了！"
msgstr "¡Aquí están! ¡Ha aparecido el barco!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1"
msgid "怎么回事？对方是——"
msgstr "Espera, ¿Es ese un..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1"
msgid "……末地船？"
msgstr "...¿Un Barco del End?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1"
msgid ""
"您原来认识它吗？它就是我们之前和你说过的那艘袭击我"
"们的船！"
msgstr ""
"¿Así que ya estas familiarizado con eso? Ese es el "
"barco que te dije que nos sigue atacando."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1"
msgid "我知道了，那就让我来吧！"
msgstr "Está bien, ¡Déjame encargarme de esto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（虽然现在是白天，但是我们的矿场无法带"
"到船上。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Aunque sea tiempo diurno, nuestra "
"mina no puede incorporase en la borda).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_1's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（因此，战斗所需要的能量可能会比较吃紧"
"了。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Parece que gestionar el consumo de "
"energía durante la batalla puede resultar bastante "
"complicado!)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_1_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第1天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 1 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_over"
msgid "爆炸性的新货！火药桶！"
msgstr ""
"¡Un barril de sorpresas! ¡El Barril de Pólvora!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_over"
msgid "它能够生产火药，一次能给予大量的能量！"
msgstr ""
"¡En vez de Redstone, esto producirá pólvora que "
"dar de doble de energía!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_over"
msgid "但是，大量的回报也伴随着风险！"
msgstr ""
"¡PERO, las grandes recompensas vienen con un gran "
"riesgo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_over"
msgid "如果火药没能及时被捡起，它就会爆炸！"
msgstr ""
"¡En caso de no recoger la pólvora a tiempo, la "
"pólvora podrá explotar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_over"
msgid ""
"同时，如果火药桶被摧毁或者被挖掘，它也会产生爆炸！"
msgstr ""
"¡Igualmente pasa lo mismo si el Barril de Pólvora "
"es destruido, incluso si es con el Pico, también "
"explotará!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_1_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_over"
msgid "没时间介绍了！快捡走！"
msgstr ""
"¡No hay tiempo de explicaciones! ¡Recógelos "
"rápidamente!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_1_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第1天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 1 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"那艘船我认得，它是和那些僵尸一样，是来自我们世界的"
"东西。"
msgstr ""
"Conozco ese barco, y al igual que esos zombis, es "
"algo de nuestro mundo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid "没想到它居然会出现在这里。"
msgstr "Sin embargo, no esperaba ver uno aquí."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"其实，早在三年前异变开始的时候，这艘船就已经出现"
"了。"
msgstr ""
"En realidad, este barco ya había aparecido desde "
"que comenzó el incidente hace 3 años."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"它飞在空中，载着各式各样的怪物，尝试袭击在空中路过"
"的所有目标。"
msgstr ""
"Transporta todo tipo de monstruos por el aire y "
"ataca a cualquier transeúnte desafortunado cuando "
"tiene la oportunidad."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"妖怪们深受它所扰，因此我们也尝试过针对它进行剿灭。"
msgstr ""
"A los youkai les preocupaba profundamente, por eso "
"intentábamos exterminarlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"但是，这艘船内部载着一种水晶。即使这艘船有一部分被"
"摧毁，水晶也会以极快的速度修复船身。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, dentro de la nave hay un cristal que, "
"incluso con parte de la nave destruida, puede "
"repararlo a una velocidad sorprendente."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"因此要完全摧毁它，就要先摧毁水晶，然而这需要相当多"
"的战斗力。"
msgstr ""
"Así que, si queremos destruir la nave, primero hay "
"que remover el cristal, lo cual requiere un "
"esfuerzo inmenso."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"并且这艘船一旦败下阵来就会以近乎传送般的速度逃跑，"
"根本没多少人能追得上它。"
msgstr ""
"Otro aspecto es que, cuando la nave se encuentra "
"en desventaja, huye a una velocidad similar a la "
"teletransportación, lo que hace casi imposible "
"perseguirla."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid "因此这件事也不了了之了。"
msgstr ""
"Por eso el barco sigue volando por ahí acosando "
"impunemente a sus víctimas."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（原来是末影水晶吗……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Un Cristal del End, huh... "
"Interesante).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_1_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_1_map"
msgid ""
"我们这次航行的目的主要是为了找到圣，因此只需要您帮"
"忙赶走它们就好了。"
msgstr ""
"Dado que el objetivo principal de nuestro viaje "
"esta vez es encontrar a Hijiri, solo necesitamos "
"tu ayuda para ahuyentar a los monstruos."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第2天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 2 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2"
msgid "前方出现了大量的飞碟！"
msgstr ""
"¡Se ha avistado un gran número de OVNIs más "
"adelante!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2"
msgid "飞、飞碟？"
msgstr "¿O-OVNIs?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2"
msgid ""
"幻想乡之前确实有过与飞碟有关的异变，但现在的飞碟和"
"之前的那种不一样。"
msgstr ""
"Gensokyo ya había experimentado un incidente "
"relacionado con OVNIs anteriormente, pero los "
"OVNIs actuales son diferentes a los anteriores."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2"
msgid "这些飞碟，纯粹是僵尸那一方的怪物。"
msgstr ""
"Estos OVNIs son simplemente monstruos del lado de "
"los zombis."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2"
msgid ""
"小心它们！它们可能会对战斗进行各种各样的干扰！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ojo con ellos! ¡Pueden causar todo tipo de "
"problemas durante la batalla!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_2_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第2天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 2 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_over"
msgid "这是三头发射器！"
msgstr ""
"¡Triple Dispensador, triple potencia de fuego!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_over"
msgid "它可以向它所在的行，以及相邻的两行发射箭矢！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Triptongador! ¡Puede disparar flechas "
"en su propia línea y las vecinas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_over"
msgid ""
"同时，如果它位于最边缘位置，那么它会改为向自身所在"
"行发射两支箭矢！"
msgstr ""
"¡Además, si se coloca en las filas más externas, "
"disparará DOS flechas en su propia línea y una en "
"la vecina!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_2_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_over"
msgid "把你的火力扩散到全战场吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Despliega tu potencia de fuego por todo el campo "
"de batalla!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_2_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第2天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 2 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid "星，那位圣 白莲大人，是个怎么样的人？"
msgstr ""
"Oye, Shou, solo quería preguntarte, ¿Qué clase de "
"persona es Byakuren?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid ""
"她是一位法力高强，而又心地善良的高僧。她帮助过非常"
"多的妖怪，这艘船的船长村纱就是被她所拯救。"
msgstr ""
"Hijiri es una suma sacerdotisa de magia poderosa "
"con un corazón bondadoso. Ha ayudado a muchos "
"youkai, incluyendo a Murasa, la capitana de este "
"barco, a quien salvó de un destino fatal."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid ""
"不过，由于她和妖怪走的太近，她曾经被封印在魔界之"
"中，后来我们这些妖怪又借助着圣辇船把她救了出来。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, debido a su estrecha relación con los "
"youkai, los humanos la sellaron en Makai. "
"Finalmente, nosotras, los youkai, la rescatamos "
"usando el Barco Palanquín."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid "那关于这艘——圣辇船呢？"
msgstr "¿Qué hay sobre el Barco Palanquín?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid ""
"圣辇船也是圣当时为了拯救村纱而使用法力创造的。不过"
"现在的这艘船和之前的那一艘船并非同一艘。"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué hay sobre el Barco Palanquín? El Barco "
"Palanquín también fue creado por Hijiri usando su "
"magia para salvar a Murasa. Sin embargo, el barco "
"actual no es igual al anterior."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid ""
"第一艘变成了现在的命莲寺。虽然寺庙仍然可以再变回船"
"的样子，但仍有些不便。"
msgstr ""
"El primer barco fue renovado y convertido en el "
"Templo Myouren. Si bien el templo aún puede "
"transformarse de nuevo en barco, hacerlo resulta "
"algo inconveniente."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid ""
"因此圣又用法力创造了第二艘用于在幻想乡和魔界中来往"
"的圣辇船，作为专门的交通工具。"
msgstr ""
"Por lo tanto, Hijiri utilizó su magia para crear "
"un segundo Barco Palanquín para viajar entre "
"Gensokyo y Makai como medio de transporte "
"exclusivo."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_2_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_2_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（随随便便就能创造一艘在空中飞行的船"
"吗……确实法力高强啊。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Esa sí que es magia poderosa para "
"poder crear una nave voladora con tanta "
"facilidad...)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_3
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第3天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 3 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3"
msgid "今天出现的敌人有——蜘蛛吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Ahora nos estamos enfrentando con... Arañas?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3"
msgid "是的，在那之前我们已经见过这些虫子了。"
msgstr "Sí. Ya las he visto antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3"
msgid "佛教曾有与蜘蛛有关的故事。"
msgstr ""
"En el Budismo, existe una historia relacionada con "
"las arañas."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3"
msgid ""
"传说佛世尊曾想使用蜘蛛丝救一恶人脱离地狱，然而恶人"
"最终又因自己导致蛛丝断裂，重新坠入深渊。"
msgstr ""
"Se dice que Buda intentó una vez usar un hilo de "
"araña para salvar a una persona malvada del "
"infierno, pero las acciones de esta persona "
"acabaron provocando que el hilo se rompiera y "
"cayera de nuevo al abismo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3"
msgid "还有这样的故事啊。"
msgstr "Vaya, pensar que existe una historia así."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3"
msgid "不过，你我皆非恶人，这蜘蛛也非比寻常。"
msgstr ""
"En cualquier caso, ninguno de nosotros es malvado, "
"y esas arañas tampoco son criaturas ordinarias."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_3's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3"
msgid "不要因它致使自己坠入地狱就好。"
msgstr ""
"Simplemente no dejes que te arrastren al infierno."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_3_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第3天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 3 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_over"
msgid "开始庆祝吧！"
msgstr "¡Tiempo de celebración!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_over"
msgid ""
"这是烟花发射器，在它上方一定范围内存在飞行敌人时，"
"它会自动使用烟花轰炸它们！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Dispensador de Fuego Artificial! "
"¡Cuando haya enemigos voladores dentro de un "
"cierto rango por encima de él, los atacará "
"automáticamente con fuegos artificiales!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_over"
msgid "不过，它也只能攻击到高空中的敌人！"
msgstr ""
"¡Solamente tiene como objetivo a los enemigos "
"voladores!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_3_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_over"
msgid "庆祝的时候到了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Vamos, hay que hacer un gran show de colores!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_3_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第3天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 3 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "嗯……？船头好像站着一个人？"
msgstr ""
"¿Hmm...? ¿Hay alguien de pie en la proa del barco?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "诶，是……"
msgstr "¿Huh? Esa..."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "哦，原来是她。"
msgstr "Oh, es ella."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"那家伙是封兽 鵺（yè），和我一样同是命莲寺势力的妖"
"怪。"
msgstr ""
"Ella es Nue Houjuu, una poderosa youkai del Templo "
"Myouren, como yo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "哦？"
msgstr "¿Ah?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"是你啊，说要解决幻想乡异变的，那个外界来的孩子。"
msgstr ""
"Pues mira quién es, el niño del mundo exterior que "
"dijo que resolvería el incidente en Gensokyo."

#. Description for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（鵺出场）"
msgstr "(Nue aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "最近妖怪之间也开始有关于你的传闻了。"
msgstr ""
"Últimamente se ha estado hablando mucho de ti "
"entre los youkai."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "我记得你好像叫，史蒂夫？"
msgstr "¿Tu nombre es Steve, no?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "嗯，是的。你在这里是为了？"
msgstr "Así es, ese soy yo. ¿Qué haces aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"……没什么，只是看到这船又飞上天空，来看看罢了。"
msgstr ""
"...Nada en especial, solo vine a ver esta nave "
"volando en el cielo otra vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "你要帮我们寻找圣吗？"
msgstr "¿Te gustaría ayudarnos a encontrar a Hijiri?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "……圣吗？抱歉，我做不到。"
msgstr "...¿Hijiri? Lo siento, no puedo."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "我当初就已经和她们说过了，我拒绝帮忙。"
msgstr ""
"Ya les dije a los todos del Templo Myouren en "
"aquel entonces que me negaba a ayudar."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"所以，你这家伙，到底为什么？你不也是圣的弟子吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué te pasa? ¿¡Acaso no eres también discípula de "
"Hijir!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"现在她需要我们出手相助，你却要在这个节骨眼上拒绝帮"
"忙？！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ella necesita nuestra ayuda ahora, y aun así te "
"niegas en este momento crítico?!..."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"史蒂夫是吧，你年纪轻轻来到这里，着实勇气可嘉。"
msgstr ""
"¿Steve, verdad? Eres muy valiente por venir aquí a "
"una edad tan temprana."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"不过，非常可惜，虽然我不知道这里真正发生了什么，但"
"是——"
msgstr ""
"Pero, por desgracia, aunque no sé qué está pasando "
"realmente aquí..."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "你们目前所做的一切，都没有任何意义。"
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que habéis estado haciendo hasta ahora es "
"completamente inútil."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"你这是什么意思？凭什么否定我们目前做的一切？！"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué quieres decir con esto? ¿Qué te da derecho a "
"desestimar todos nuestros esfuerzos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "总有一天，你们会明白的。"
msgstr "Tu lo entenderás todo algún día."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "好了，史蒂夫，我送你一件东西。"
msgstr "Una cosa más. Esto es para ti, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"这是人类村庄那边比较流行的一款小玩具，不过你不要小"
"看它。"
msgstr ""
"Es un popular juguete entre los Humanos de la "
"Aldea. Pero no lo subestimes."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"我给这个玩具加了点小小的魔力，如果运用得当，可以创"
"造出财富。"
msgstr ""
"Le añadí un toque de magia. Si se usa "
"correctamente, se puede crear riqueza."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "给。"
msgstr "Ten."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "……谢谢？"
msgstr "...Gracias, ¿Supongo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid ""
"好了，恕我真的没办法打起精神帮你们的忙，这是我能提"
"供的最大限度的帮助了。"
msgstr ""
"De acuerdo. Lamento no tener la energía suficiente "
"para ayudarte, pero esto es lo mejor que puedo "
"hacer."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "再见。"
msgstr "Hasta siempre."

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_3_map"
msgid "这家伙，还是和以前一样让人恼火……！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta chica... sigue siendo tan exasperante como "
"siempre!"

#. Description for talk sentence 29 in talk group ship_3_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（鵺离场）"
msgstr "(Nue se va)"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_4
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第4天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 4 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4"
msgid "啊，看那里！"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Mira por ahí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4"
msgid "那里有一朵看上去很像僵尸的粉色云！"
msgstr ""
"¡Parece que hay una especie de nube rosada con el "
"aspecto de un zombie!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4"
msgid "……？这么奇怪的东西？"
msgstr "...¿? ¿Qué demonios es eso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4"
msgid "它应该也是我们的敌人，要小心了！"
msgstr ""
"¡También debe ser nuestro enemigo, así que ten "
"cuidado!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_4's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4"
msgid "记得带上防空手段！"
msgstr ""
"¡No te olvides de traer artilugios anti-aéreos!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_4_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第4天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 4 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_over"
msgid "连射发射器！连射发射器！"
msgstr "¡Repetidor! ¡Repetidor!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_over"
msgid "它一次会发射两支箭矢！它一次会发射两支箭矢！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puede dispara dos flechas a la vez! ¡Puede "
"dispara dos flechas a la vez!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_over"
msgid "尽情重复吧！尽情重复吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Repítelo tantas veces como quieras! ¡Repítelo "
"tantas veces como quieras!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_4_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_over"
msgid "……？"
msgstr "...¿¿??"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_4_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第4天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 4 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "话说，昨天那位——奇怪的女士是谁？"
msgstr "Dime, ¿Quién era esa extraña señora de ayer?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"你是说鵺吗？她啊，也是我们命莲寺的一员，是位大妖"
"怪。"
msgstr ""
"¿Te refieres a Nue? Ella también es miembro del "
"Templo Myouren, y una youkai."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"但是她和我们这些僧侣之间的关系并不好，是个很讨人厌"
"的家伙。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, no se lleva bien con nosotras, las "
"monjes, ella puede ser muy molesta."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "说起来，这艘船上也有其他命莲寺的成员来着？"
msgstr ""
"Hablando de eso, ¿Hay otros integrantes del Templo "
"Myouren en este barco también?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"对的，村纱也随我们一起来了，她负责开船，所以没有时"
"间来参与战斗。"
msgstr ""
"Por supuesto. Está la capitana de este barco, "
"Murasa. Pero como siempre está al mando, no puede "
"participar en la lucha."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"除了她之外就没有其他人了，其余的人都留在寺里看守。"
msgstr ""
"Aparte de ella, no hay nadie más. El resto se "
"quedó en el templo haciendo guardia."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "嗯……话说——"
msgstr "Ya veo... Por cierto..."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "我还不知道你之前说的那条红龙到底是什么呢。"
msgstr ""
"Todavía no sé qué es exactamente ese dragón rojo "
"del que hablaste la última vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "那条龙吗？那我来说明一下情况吧。"
msgstr ""
"¿El Dragón? Permítame entonces explicarle la "
"situación primero."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "这条龙，其实是第二条龙。"
msgstr ""
"Este dragón que estamos lidiando en realidad es el "
"segundo dragón."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "诶？第二条？"
msgstr "¿Ah? ¿Un segundo dragón?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"是的，第一条龙其实是在三年前，异变刚发生时出现的。"
msgstr ""
"Así es. El primero apareció hace tres años, justo "
"cuando el incidente comenzó."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"那条龙是和一只巨大的僵尸一起出现的，它们一起对幻想"
"乡造成了很多破坏。"
msgstr ""
"Ese dragón apareció junto a un zombi gigante y "
"juntos causaron una destrucción masiva en Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"鉴于事情的严重性，我们也和梦殿大祀庙那边的人达成了"
"合作，一起解决它们两个。"
msgstr ""
"Dada la gravedad de la situación, llegamos a un "
"acuerdo con los miembros del Gran Mausoleo del "
"Salón de los Sueños para ocuparnos de esos dos."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"梦殿大祀庙那边把巨人封印在了地下，而圣则亲手杀死了"
"那条恶龙。"
msgstr ""
"Los responsables del Mausoleo sellaron al gigante "
"en lo subterráneo, mientras que Hijiri mató "
"personalmente al dragón."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "直接杀死吗……？"
msgstr "¿Mató directamente al dragón...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"虽然她杀生这件事曾经也产生过一些争议，不过大家还是"
"把她奉为了屠龙英雄。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque su acto de matar provocó cierta "
"controversia, todos seguían considerando a Hijiri "
"una heroína que mató al dragón."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "但是，她在那之后，似乎变得有些奇怪。"
msgstr ""
"Pero desde entonces, se ha estado comportando... "
"de forma extraña."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "奇怪？"
msgstr "¿Extraña?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "总感觉，圣一直有什么事情说不出口。"
msgstr ""
"Bueno... siempre tengo la sensación de que hay "
"algo que ella nunca se atrevería a decir."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group ship_4_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_4_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（这件事，背后还有什么隐情吗？）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿Habrá algo más de esto?)</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_5_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第5天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 5 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_over"
msgid ""
"高频脉冲发射器！高频脉冲发射器！高频脉冲发射器！高"
"频脉冲发射器！"
msgstr ""
"¡Dispensador de Alta Frecuencia de Pulso! "
"¡Dispensador de Alta Frecuencia de Pulso! "
"¡Dispensador de Alta Frecuencia de Pulso! "
"¡Dispensador de Alta Frecuencia de Pulso!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_over"
msgid ""
"一次发射四支箭矢！一次发射四支箭矢！一次发射四支箭"
"矢！一次发射四支箭矢！"
msgstr ""
"¡Dispara cuatro flechas a la vez! ¡Dispara cuatro "
"flechas a la vez! ¡Dispara cuatro flechas a la "
"vez! ¡Dispara cuatro flechas a la vez!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_over"
msgid "需要从连射发射器升级！需要——"
msgstr ""
"¡Para mejorarlo ponlo encima de los Repetidores! "
"¡Para mejorarlo-"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_5_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_over"
msgid "好了！够了！"
msgstr ""
"¡De acuerdo, SUFICIENTE, SUFICIENTE, SUFICIENTE, "
"SUFICIENTE!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_5_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第5天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 5 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "对了，我有个问题一直想问。"
msgstr ""
"Por ciento, tengo una pregunta que quiero decirte"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid ""
"你们和白莲大人同是命莲寺的人，为什么却没有她去哪里"
"了的线索，只能漫无目的地寻找呢？"
msgstr ""
"Tanto tú como la señorita Byakuren son del templo "
"Myouren, así que ¿Por qué no tienes ni idea de "
"adónde fue y solo puedes buscarla sin rumbo fijo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "这个……我来说说吧。"
msgstr "Bueno... Déjame explicarte."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid ""
"那时，红龙再次出现，圣当时正在寺里看着那条龙四处毁"
"坏。"
msgstr ""
"En ese momento, el Dragón Rojo apareció de nuevo. "
"Hijiri estaba en el templo, observándola sembrar "
"el caos por todas partes."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid ""
"我们赶到了她的身旁，正惊讶于眼前的发生的事情。那之"
"后，她忽然动身，准备离开寺庙。"
msgstr ""
"Corrimos a su lado, conmocionados por lo que "
"veíamos. Después de eso, de repente decidió "
"abandonar el templo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "我连忙上去问她怎么回事，但她只留下了一句话。"
msgstr ""
"Me apresuré a preguntarle qué estaba pasando, pero "
"solo nos dijo una frase."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "她说：“我去了结此番因果。”"
msgstr "Ella dijo, \"Voy a resolver este karma\"."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "那之后，她便离开了我们，什么也没有说。"
msgstr ""
"Después de eso, ella se fue sin decir nada más."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "原来她是独自一人离开的吗？"
msgstr "¿Así que, se fue por su propia cuenta?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid ""
"是的，已经好几天了，直到今天都没有她的任何线索。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, ya han pasado varios días y todavía no hay "
"rastro de ella."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "我们坐立不安，因此才决定使用圣辇船来寻找她。"
msgstr ""
"Estábamos inquietas, así que decidimos usar el "
"Barco Palanquín para buscarla."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_5_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_5_map"
msgid "这就是我们启程的原因了。"
msgstr "Por eso nos pusimos en marcha."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_6
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第6天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 6 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6"
msgid "嘿！看远处的天上！有一大堆飞碟！"
msgstr ""
"¡Oye! ¡Mira allá en el cielo! ¡Hay una enorme "
"enjambre de OVNIs!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6"
msgid "怎么回事？怎么会有这么多！"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué estará pasando? ¿Cómo es posible que haya "
"tantos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_6's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6"
msgid "不好！那些飞碟飞过来了！"
msgstr "¡Oh no! ¡Esos OVNIs ya vienen!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_6_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第6天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 6 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_over"
msgid "啊哈！信标！"
msgstr "¡Aja! ¡El Faro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_over"
msgid ""
"不过这个不是真的信标，只是一个会发光的手里剑发射"
"器！"
msgstr ""
"¡Pero este no es el auténtico, es solo un "
"dispensador de shurikens que brilla en la "
"oscuridad!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_over"
msgid ""
"它会向五个不同的方向发射手里剑！非常适合跨行攻击！"
msgstr ""
"¡Puede dispara shurikens en cinco direcciones "
"diferentes! ¡Ideal para ataques en múltiples "
"carriles!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_6_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_over"
msgid "让战场上布满星星吧！"
msgstr "¡Mira las estrellas fugaces!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_6_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第6天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 6 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_map"
msgid "现在还是没有找到白莲吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Byakuren sigue sin aparecer por ningún lado?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_map"
msgid "嗯，是的。"
msgstr "Aun sin rastro de ella."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_map"
msgid ""
"不过最后还有一处地方没有搜索，那就是妖怪之山附近。"
msgstr ""
"Pero hay un último lugar que no hemos registrado, "
"la zona cercana a la Montaña Youkai."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_map"
msgid "我们先回命莲寺整顿一番吧。"
msgstr ""
"Regresemos primero al Templo Myouren y "
"reagrupémonos."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_map"
msgid "正好！不如我们也先回香霖堂吧！"
msgstr ""
"¡Momento perfecto! ¿Por qué no volvemos primero "
"hacia Kourindou?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_6_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_6_map"
msgid "我也有一批货物想卖给你了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Tengo un lote de artículos que me gustaría "
"venderte!"

#. Archive name for talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "访问香霖堂-圣辇船"
msgstr "Visita a Kourindou-Barco"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "你这家伙少给我得意了！"
msgstr "¡Oye tú, deja esa actitud arrogante!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "什么啊！不都是你来惹事吗！"
msgstr ""
"¡¿Qué?! ¡¿No eres siempre tú quien empieza "
"primero?!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "……？好像在吵架？"
msgstr "...¿? ¿Parece que alguien está discutiendo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "哦？有人来了啊。"
msgstr "¿Oh? Hay alguien aquí."

#. Description for talk sentence 3 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（魔理沙和朱鹭子出场）"
msgstr "(Marisa y Tokiko aparecen)"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "喂！给我好好道歉啊！"
msgstr ""
"¡Oye! ¡Será mejor que te disculpes apropiadamente!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "切，懒得说废话了，我这次就先走了。"
msgstr ""
"Tch, no voy a perder mi tiempo en esto. Me voy "
"ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "你给我等着！"
msgstr "¡Ya verás!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "你们回来了啊。"
msgstr "Oh, has vuelto."

#. Description for talk sentence 7 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（魔理沙离场）"
msgstr "(Marisa se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "发生什么了？"
msgstr "¿Qué ocurre?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "抱歉，刚才有些失礼。"
msgstr ""
"Lo siento, perdí la compostura hace un momento."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "没事。刚才那是魔理沙吧？你们两个怎么了？"
msgstr ""
"Está bien. Era Marisa, ¿cierto? ¿Qué pasó entre "
"ustedes dos?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"她呀，我和那家伙之前关系就不好。在这场异变发生后，"
"她对我的态度就更加恶劣了。"
msgstr ""
"¿Ella? Nunca nos llevamos bien desde el principio. "
"Desde que empezó este incidente, su actitud hacia "
"mí ha empeorado aún más."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"因为她之前是霖之助最亲密的朋友之一，在我接下这家店"
"之后，她就觉得我是在霸占霖之助的店。"
msgstr ""
"Como ella solía ser una de las amigas más cercanas "
"de Rinnosuke, y después de que me hice cargo de la "
"tienda, sintió que yo estaba tratando de robársela."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"所以她每次来到店里的时候，我就知道准没好事发生。"
msgstr ""
"Así que cada vez que viene a la tienda, sé que no "
"va a pasar nada bueno."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "这样啊。"
msgstr "Ya veo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "不过，我倒是一直有个问题想问你。"
msgstr ""
"Dicho esto, hay algo que siempre he querido "
"preguntarte."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"你当时，为什么要接下这家店呢？当时发生了什么？"
msgstr ""
"En todo este tiempo, ¿Por qué decidiste estar a "
"cargo de esta tienda? ¿Que sucedió?"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "这件事啊……"
msgstr "Sobre eso..."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "我还是跟你们说了吧。"
msgstr "Supongo que debería decírtelo."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "在三年前的某一天，我照常来到这家店看书。"
msgstr ""
"Un día, hace tres años, fui a la tienda como de "
"costumbre a leer."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "在我临走之前，霖之助突然把我叫住了。"
msgstr ""
"Justo antes de irme, Rinnosuke me llamó de repente."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"他说，他之后可能会离开很长一段时间，问我愿不愿意帮"
"忙暂时接手这家店。"
msgstr ""
"Dijo que podría estar ausente durante mucho tiempo "
"y me preguntó si estaría dispuesto a encargarme de "
"la tienda temporalmente."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"当时我只是个到处闲逛的妖怪，只是喜欢看看书之类的，"
"没多想就答应了。"
msgstr ""
"En aquel momento, yo solo era un youkai errante al "
"que le gustaba leer libros y cosas así, así que "
"acepté sin pensarlo demasiado."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"那之后才发现看店原来是这么困难的事情，不过我还是撑"
"到现在了。"
msgstr ""
"Solo después me di cuenta de lo difícil que es "
"realmente gestionar una tienda, pero he conseguido "
"mantenerla hasta ahora."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "就这样。"
msgstr "Eso es todo."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "……原来是霖之助主动委托你来接手的啊。"
msgstr ""
"...Así que fue Rinnosuke quien te pidió que te "
"hicieras cargo."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "魔理沙她不知道吗？"
msgstr "¿Marisa no lo sabe?"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "她应该不知道，不然她也不会对我态度这么差。"
msgstr ""
"Probablemente no, de lo contrario no me trataría "
"tan mal."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "这样啊，我明白了。"
msgstr "Hmm..."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（……不过，我倒是获得了两个新的情报。）"
"</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(...Aunque, ya obtuve dos nuevas "
"piezas de información).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（第一，霖之助是知道自己要“失踪”长达三"
"年的。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(En primer lugar, Rinnosuke sabía que "
"iba a \"desaparecer\" durante tres años).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（第二，霖之助没有把自己要“失踪”的事情"
"告诉他最亲密的朋友。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(En segunda, él no le contó a su amiga "
"más cercana que iba \"desaparecer\").</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "<color=blue>（这是为什么？）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¿Porqué será eso?)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "对了，我们要新上架一批货物了！"
msgstr ""
"Por cierto, ¡Nos va a llegar un nuevo lote de "
"productos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group kourindou_visit_ship_2's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:kourindou_visit_ship_2"
msgid "来看看吧！不买不给送！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ven a echar un vistazo! ¡Son todos gratis siempre "
"y cuando pagues!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_7
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第7天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 7 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7"
msgid "出现了一种手持铁炮的僵尸！"
msgstr ""
"¡Aca hay un nuevo tipo de zombi que carga un cañón "
"de hierro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7"
msgid ""
"小心应对它们！他们的铁炮能帮它们抵挡来自前方的攻"
"击！"
msgstr ""
"¡Ten cuidado, ya que sus cañones pueden resistir "
"ataques frontales!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7"
msgid "并且也要小心它们的炮弹！"
msgstr "¡Cuidado también con sus balas de cañón!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_7's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7"
msgid "明白了！"
msgstr "¡Entendido!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_7_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第7天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 7 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_over"
msgid "吹吹风吧！"
msgstr "¡Vientos! ¡Adivina quien llegó!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_over"
msgid ""
"这是木风扇，它在被触发后会立即吹动一整行的怪物！"
msgstr ""
"¡Este es el Ventilador de Madera! ¡Una vez "
"activado sopla una línea entera de monstruos!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_over"
msgid "如果怪物特别轻或者在空中，它们会立即被吹飞！"
msgstr ""
"¡Si los monstruos son particularmente ligeros o "
"voladores, ¡Saldrán volando al instante!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_over"
msgid ""
"反之，如果怪物比较重并且在地面上，它们就只是会被击"
"退，或者不会受到影响！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por el contrario, si son más pesados ​​y están en "
"el suelo, solo serán empujados hacia atrás o "
"permanecerán ilesos al empuje!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_7_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_over"
msgid "它就是那即将到来的风暴！"
msgstr "¡La tormenta se está aproximando!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_7_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第7天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 7 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（今天还是和往常一样啊。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Hoy es un día como cualquier otro).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（不知道什么时候才是个头呢……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Me pregunto cuando finalizará "
"esto...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "史蒂夫！你快过来！"
msgstr "¡Steve! ¡Ven aquí rápido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "怎么了？"
msgstr "¿¡Qué sucede!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "找到圣了！快看那边！"
msgstr "¡Encontramos a Hijiri! ¡Mira por aquí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "她正在和红龙战斗！"
msgstr "¡Ella está luchando contra el Dragón Rojo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "什么？！"
msgstr "¿¡Qué!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（红、红龙被白莲击倒了！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡El Dragón Rojo fue derrotado por "
"Byakuren!)</color>"

#. Description for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（远处的白莲击倒了红龙，她降落在了红龙面前）"
msgstr ""
"(A lo lejos, Byakuren derriba al Dragón Rojo y "
"aterriza frente a ella)"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "圣！看这里！"
msgstr "¡Hijiri! ¡Por aquí!"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "好！这下就能把那条恶龙控制住了！"
msgstr ""
"¡Bien! ¡Ahora por fin podemos frenar a ese malvado "
"dragón!"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "只要把它封印起来，一切就都结束了！"
msgstr "Una vez sellado, ¡Todo habrá terminado!"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "那条龙看起来暂时是晕过去了，我这就去帮您！"
msgstr ""
"El dragón parece estar inconsciente por ahora. "
"¡Iré a ayudarla enseguida!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "圣、圣！您没事吧！"
msgstr "¡H-Hijiri! ¿Estás bien?"

#. Description for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid ""
"（红龙突然睁开眼睛，抓住机会向白莲喷了一口火）"
msgstr ""
"(El Dragón Rojo abre repentinamente los ojos y "
"aprovecha la oportunidad para lanzar fuego contra "
"Byakuren)"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "怎么回事！"
msgstr "¿¡Qué esta pasando!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "红、红龙，飞过来了！"
msgstr "¡E-El Dragón Rojo, está volando hacia aquí!"

#. Description for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（红龙飞了过来）"
msgstr "(El Dragón Rojo sobrevuela la zona)"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
msgstr "¡AAAAAAAAAAH!"

#. Description for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（红龙撞击了圣辇船）"
msgstr ""
"(El Dragón Rojo se choca contra el Barco Palanquin)"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "史蒂夫————！"
msgstr "¡Steeeeve!"

#. Description for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（史蒂夫掉下了船）"
msgstr "(Steve se cae fuera del barco)"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_7_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "史蒂夫！！！！"
msgstr "¡¡¡¡Steve!!!!"

#. Archive text for talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "史蒂夫在一间屋子里醒来。"
msgstr "Steve de despierta en una casa."

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "……我还活着？"
msgstr "...¿Sigo con vida?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "这里是哪儿啊？好像从来都没见过。"
msgstr ""
"¿¡Dónde estoy!? No creo haber visto este lugar "
"antes."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "奇怪，我为什么会在这？"
msgstr "Esto es raro. ¿Por qué estoy aquí?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "哎呦，你终于醒啦？"
msgstr "Ah, finalmente estas despierto."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "哇啊！你——"
msgstr "¡Whoa! Tu-"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "是我，小鬼！"
msgstr "¡Soy yo, tontito!"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"之前被你打醒的鬼人正邪。看到手下败将的滋味很爽吧？"
msgstr ""
"Seija Kijin, a quien ya venciste antes. Se siente "
"genial ver a tu oponente derrotada, ¿No es así?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "所、所以你想干嘛啊！"
msgstr "¿¡Q-Qué es lo que quieres!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"都是你这个家伙，害得针妙丸在她的族人面前都抬不起"
"头！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por tu culpa, Shinmyomaru ni siquiera puede alzar "
"la cabeza ante su propia gente!"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"上次我还因为被你打败而感到生气呢，居然会被人类打成"
"这样！一个人类居然有如此强大的力量。"
msgstr ""
"Me enfadé mucho por haber sido derrotada la última "
"vez. ¿Cómo pudo una simple cosa pudo vencerme así? "
"¿Un simple humano podría tener un poder tan "
"inmenso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"自从那之后，我就一直在观察。我发现你拿那些破烂战斗"
"的时候，居然能使用万宝槌这种东西！"
msgstr ""
"Desde entonces, te he estado observando. Dándome "
"cuenta de que cuando luchabas contra esas basuras, "
"¡Podías usar el Mazo Milagroso!"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "现在，我终于知道原因了！"
msgstr "¡Ahora por fin sé por qué!"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"我搜遍了你的身，发现了那些星星！这就是你力量的来"
"源！"
msgstr ""
"¡Examiné todo tu cuerpo y encontré estas "
"estrellas! ¡Esta debe ser la fuente de tu poder!"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "！那是星之碎片？你要用它干什么？"
msgstr ""
"¿Ah? ¿Los Fragmentos Estelares? ¿Qué vas a hacer "
"con ellas?"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "是吗？看来真的是好东西呢，哼哼。"
msgstr "¿Ah? Parece que son algo valioso. Je, je."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"你就等着吧，我马上就可以利用这些星星，来帮助针妙丸"
"解困！"
msgstr ""
"Ya verás. ¡Con estas estrellas, podré ayudar a "
"Shinmyomaru a salir de su aprieto!"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "然后，再逆转整个幻想乡的！"
msgstr "¡Así entonces, derrocaré todo Gensokyo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "喂，你等等——"
msgstr "Oye, espera-"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "……跑了。"
msgstr "...Ella salió corriendo..."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"虽然很不甘心，但是，这东西对器械之外的东西是没有用"
"的吧。"
msgstr ""
"Me cuesta admitirlo, pero... esas cosas no sirven "
"para nada que no sean artilugios."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "真是个笨蛋。"
msgstr "Qué idiota."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"说起来这里是哪里啊？好破旧的地方，似乎是间被遗弃的"
"屋子。"
msgstr ""
"Hablando de otro tema, ¿Dónde está este lugar? "
"Está muy deteriorado... parece una casa abandonada."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"我记得，我是从圣辇船上掉下来了。那么高的地方，我应"
"该早就摔死了才对啊。"
msgstr ""
"Recuerdo haberme caído del Barco Palanquín. Desde "
"esa altura, debería haber muerto."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "难不成，是那个天邪鬼救了我？"
msgstr "¿Podría ser... que la Amanojaku me salvara?"

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "没想到她还会救人啊。"
msgstr "Nunca pensé que salvaría a alguien."

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group ship_7_map's section 1
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "算了，总之先出去吧。"
msgstr ""
"En fin, lo primero que debo hacer es salir de aquí."

#. Archive text for talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "史蒂夫走出了屋子。"
msgstr "Steve sale afuera de la casa."

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "这里是人类村庄啊。"
msgstr "Entonces, esta es la Aldea Humana."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "幻想乡中人类居住的地方，我还是第一次看到。"
msgstr ""
"Es la primera vez que veo un lugar en Gensokyo "
"donde viven humanos."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（和想象中的不太一样，这里人影相当稀"
"薄。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(No es exactamente lo que imaginaba; "
"apenas hay gente alrededor).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（是异变的原因吗？）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¿Es por el incidente?)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "喂，那边的那个。"
msgstr "Oye tu, por aquí"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "嗯？你是？"
msgstr "¿Hm? ¿Y tu eres?"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "你……刚才从那间屋子里出来了？"
msgstr "¿Acabas... de salir de esa casa?"

#. Description for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（赤蛮奇出场）"
msgstr "(Sekibanki aparece)"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "啊，是啊，怎么了？"
msgstr "Ah, sí ¿Algún problema?"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "你为什么会去那间屋子？"
msgstr "¿Por qué entraste en esa casa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "？那间屋子怎么了吗？"
msgstr "...¿Qué hay con eso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "没什么，不好意思。"
msgstr "No es nada, no me hagas caso."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "刚才那位女士，我听戴夫说过，她叫赤蛮奇？"
msgstr ""
"Esa señora de hace un momento... creo que Dave la "
"mencionó antes. ¿Es Sekibanki?"

#. Description for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（赤蛮奇离场）"
msgstr "(Sekibanki se va)"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "这间屋子怎么了吗？"
msgstr "¿Cuál será el problema sobre esta casa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "啊，你在这里！"
msgstr "¡Ah! ¡Ahí estas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "啊，你们来了。"
msgstr "Ah, ya llegaron."

#. Description for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（星和村民出场）"
msgstr "(Shou y el Aldeano aparecen)"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "史蒂夫先生没事吧？"
msgstr "¿Se encuentra bien, Señor Steve?"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "没事，我好像是被人救下来了。"
msgstr "Estoy bien. Creo que alguien me salvó."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "呼，没事就好。"
msgstr "Fiu, estoy agradecido que estés bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group ship_7_map's section 2
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_7_map"
msgid "那么，该和我们回船上了！我的邻居！"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, entonces, ¡Es hora de regresar al barco, mi "
"vecino!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_8
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第8天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 8 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8"
msgid "<color=blue>（总算是回到船上了……）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡Por fin estoy de vuelta en el "
"barco!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8"
msgid "啊，您就是——白莲大人吗？"
msgstr "Ah, usted debe ser... Byakuren, ¿No?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8"
msgid "正是。您可是星口中的史蒂夫？"
msgstr ""
"Eso es correcto. Shou me contó sobre ti. ¿Eres "
"Steve, cierto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8"
msgid "是的。"
msgstr "Sí, soy yo."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_8's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8"
msgid ""
"不过，那艘末地船又出现了，等我把它们击退再说！"
msgstr ""
"Es un placer conocerte, pero el Barco del End está "
"aquí otra vez. ¡Disculpa, pero primero tengo que "
"ocuparme de ella!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_8_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第8天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 8 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_over"
msgid "弹弹弹！"
msgstr "¡Boing! ¡Boing!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_over"
msgid "这是弹性云！能够起到防御作用！"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta es la Nube Elástica! ¡Otro artilugio "
"defensivo!"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_over"
msgid ""
"和之前的防御器械不同的是，它不会被僵尸攻击，而是会"
"将僵尸弹走！"
msgstr ""
"!A diferencia de otros artilugios de defensa, en "
"lugar de absorber los golpes de los zombis y "
"detenerlos, los rebota atrás!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_8_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_over"
msgid ""
"不过，弹走僵尸也是会消耗它的耐久的，这点要注意！"
msgstr ""
"¡Sin embargo, rebotarlos consumirá su durabilidad! "
"¡No lo olvides!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_8_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第8天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 8 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "战斗结束了，白莲大人有什么事？"
msgstr ""
"Uf, lo logramos. Señorita Byakuren, ¿Tiene algo "
"que comentar?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "我先介绍一下自己吧。"
msgstr ""
"Sí, pero antes de eso... me gustaría presentarme "
"formalmente, si no le importa."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"正如您所知道的那样，我是命莲寺的住持，圣 白莲。"
msgstr ""
"Como seguramente ya sabes, soy Byakuren Hijiri, la "
"suma sacerdotisa del Templo Myouren."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"我此次出行是为了制伏那条红龙，结果却一时疏忽，让它"
"逃走了。"
msgstr ""
"El único propósito de mi expedición es derrotar al "
"Dragón Rojo. Sin embargo, en el momento más "
"crítico... Yo bajé la guardia."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "我酿成如此大错，实属不该。"
msgstr ""
"Lo dejé escapar. Nunca debí haber permitido que "
"nada de esto sucediera."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "圣，我一直都有问题想问您。"
msgstr ""
"Hijiri, he esperado mucho tiempo para preguntarte "
"esto."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"您在命莲寺的时候，看到红龙之后，头也不回地就离开了"
"我们。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando viste al Dragón Rojo cuando todavía "
"estábamos en el templo, te fuiste sin mirar atrás "
"ni una sola vez."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"并且，您在三年前消灭第一头红龙之后，一直都非常奇"
"怪。"
msgstr ""
"Incluso antes de eso, desde que exterminaste al "
"primer dragón hace tres años, no te has comportado "
"como siempre."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "这些年来，您到底怎么了？"
msgstr ""
"Durante todos estos años, ¿Qué ha entrado en ti?"

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "也许是时候该告诉你们了，星。"
msgstr ""
"Quizás sea hora de contarte lo que pasó, Shou."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "在三年前的时候，那头红龙伴随着巨人一同出现。"
msgstr ""
"Hace tres años, el Dragón Rojo apareció junto con "
"el Gigante."

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"巨人造成了很多破坏，甚至夺走了许多的生命，而红龙则"
"不停在幻想乡上空飞行。"
msgstr ""
"El Gigante sembró el caos en Gensokyo mientras el "
"Dragón Rojo surcaba los cielos sin cesar."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"人与妖怪们对它们深感恐惧，并且提出要消灭他们，让它"
"们为这些破坏付出代价。"
msgstr ""
"Los humanos y los youkai vivían con miedo. Querían "
"exterminarlos, hacerles pagar por su destrucción."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"巨人交给了梦殿大祀庙一方，而我则负责制伏那头红龙。"
msgstr ""
"Al final, el Gigante fue asignado a la gente del "
"Mausoleo, y yo me encargaría de someter al Dragón "
"Rojo."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"我一生中拯救人与妖怪无数，然而对于这次的目标，我没"
"有任何办法。"
msgstr ""
"He salvado incontables vidas en el pasado, ya "
"fueran humanas o de youkai. Sin embargo, esta vez, "
"frente a mi objetivo, no pude encontrar la manera "
"de hacer lo que tantas veces había hecho."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"对方是外界来的生物，我对它知之甚少，因此唯一的方法"
"只有将其消灭。"
msgstr ""
"Dado que provenía del Mundo Exterior, no sabía "
"nada sobre el Dragón Rojo. Su exterminio era mi "
"única opción."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"那一天，妖怪们找到了红龙的巢穴，我走进了洞穴中，其"
"余的妖怪则留在了洞口外面。"
msgstr ""
"Ese día, los youkai lograron encontrar el nido del "
"Dragón Rojo. Entré sola en la cueva mientras ellos "
"esperaban afuera."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "就在巢穴的深处，我见到了那条红龙。"
msgstr ""
"Fue en esa cueva donde me encontré cara a cara con "
"el Dragón Rojo."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"然而，意想不到的事情发生了。那条红龙，开口说了话。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando el Dragón Rojo abrió la boca, esperaba que "
"rugiera, que escupiera fuego o incluso que me "
"mordiera. En cambio, el Dragón Rojo me habló."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "我知道你是来做什么的。你是来除我的。"
msgstr ""
"Sé para qué estás aquí. Estás aquí para "
"exterminarme."

#. Description for talk sentence 20 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（白莲回忆和红龙的谈话）"
msgstr ""
"(Byakuren recuerda la conversación con el Dragón "
"Rojo)"

#. Speaker Name for talk sentence 20 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "character.name"
msgid "红龙"
msgstr "Dragón Rojo"

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "可是，你是否清楚，我并未危害任何人？"
msgstr ""
"Pero, ¿Sabes que nunca le he hecho daño a nadie?"

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"我来此处并非本意，在这里做过的唯一之事便是于天空之"
"上飞翔。"
msgstr ""
"No he llegado aquí por mi propia voluntad. No he "
"hecho más que volar muy por encima de la gente de "
"esta tierra."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"我不想与你们为敌，可你们却恐惧我们，要消灭我们。"
msgstr ""
"Nunca quise enemistarme con los humanos. Sin "
"embargo, nos temen y quieren eliminarnos."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"人类从来都是这样。他们宁愿消灭我们，也不愿相信我们"
"有任何清白。"
msgstr ""
"Así es la naturaleza humana. Prefieren matarnos "
"por nuestros supuestos pecados antes que creer en "
"nuestra inocencia."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "你身为高洁之人，也要狩猎我们这些无辜者吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿Tú, suma sacerdotisa de la bondad, también vas a "
"perseguirme por pecados que nunca he cometido?"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "那时的红龙对我说了这些话。"
msgstr ""
"Esas fueron las palabras que me dijo la <i>Dragona "
"Roja</i>."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"事实上，当时的幻想乡确实没有任何红龙袭击的报告，也"
"没有任何受到红龙火焰破坏的迹象。"
msgstr ""
"La Dragona tenía razón. A diferencia del Gigante, "
"no hubo informes de un ataque de dragón, ni "
"tampoco señales de daños por fuego."

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"它在幻想乡从未消灭或摧毁哪怕一人一物，然而幻想乡的"
"居民在巨人的恐惧下，却还是要消灭它。"
msgstr ""
"No importaba que Gensokyo hubiera salido ilesa de "
"la existencia de la Dragona Roja, la existencia "
"misma de la Dragona era vista como una amenaza."

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"没有人愿意相信红龙是无辜的。哪怕它现在真的什么也没"
"做，人们也不愿留它。"
msgstr ""
"Nadie quería creer que la Dragona Roja fuera "
"inocente; ninguno se sentía seguro dejándola sola "
"en los cielos."

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "当时的我陷入了两难。"
msgstr "Eso fue un dilema."

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"若放过红龙，仇恨红龙者大有人在，它迟早也会被其他妖"
"怪杀死，而我也会失去人们的信任。"
msgstr ""
"Si dejaba vivir al Dragona, la gente seguirá "
"odiándolo. Su vida acabaría siendo arrebatada por "
"otros youkai, y perdería la confianza del pueblo."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "若将其制伏，则是伤害无辜，绝非正义。"
msgstr ""
"Si la hubiera matado en esa cueva, habría "
"traicionado mis principios morales y le habría "
"arrebatado la vida a una ser inocente."

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "时间，对当时的我来说实在是太少了。"
msgstr "Ese día, no tuve tiempo de emitir un juicio."

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "你犹豫了。"
msgstr "Dudaste"

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "那我来帮你做决定吧。"
msgstr "Entonces, déjame decidir por ti."

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "我有我要保护的东西，你也不能就这样空手而归。"
msgstr ""
"Hay algo en esta cueva que debo proteger, y hay "
"algo en esta cueva que tú debes exterminar."

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "开打吧，这样对我们两者都好。"
msgstr ""
"Ninguna de las dos conseguiría lo que quiere si no "
"hiciéramos nada. Luchemos."

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"那之后，红龙和我进行了战斗。最后，红龙体力不支，我"
"也收了手。"
msgstr ""
"Después de eso, me enfrenté a la Dragona Roja en "
"batalla. Al final, la Dragona Roja cayó exhausta."

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"我本想饶它一命。哪知，那条红龙最终却拼尽全力站了起"
"来，撞向了洞穴的墙壁。"
msgstr ""
"Me detuve, queriendo perdonarle la vida. Pero "
"entonces, la Dragona se puso de pie con todas sus "
"fuerzas y se estrelló contra la pared de la cueva."

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"等我从那些烟尘中看清发生了什么时，它已经死去，用它"
"巨大的身躯堵住了通往巢穴深处的道路。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando el polvo se disipó, estaba muerta, había "
"usado su enorme cuerpo para bloquear el camino que "
"conducía al interior de la cueva."

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"那时的我最后什么都做不了。只能拿着战斗中掉落的一颗"
"龙牙，离开了巢穴。"
msgstr ""
"No sabía qué hacer a continuación. Al final, "
"agarré un diente que se cayó durante la batalla y "
"salí de la cueva."

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "居然是，这个样子的吗……"
msgstr "Entonces... ¿Eso fue lo que pasó?"

#. Text for talk sentence 43 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"人和妖怪们把我奉为屠龙英雄，就这样过了三年，谁也不"
"知道背后真正的故事。"
msgstr ""
"Humanos y youkai... me aclamaron como la heroína. "
"Durante tres años, nadie supo la verdad detrás de "
"todo eso."

#. Text for talk sentence 44 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "世人皆知我屠恶龙，可谁知我未曾屠，龙未曾恶？"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué sería de mí si el mundo supiera que fui la "
"asesina que fracasó en su intento de matar a un "
"dragón malvado que no era malvado?"

#. Text for talk sentence 45 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "此番纠缠，反倒入了因果。"
msgstr ""
"Fue este desastre el que me enredó en esta "
"calamidad."

#. Text for talk sentence 46 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "今日的红龙，便是之前的业，造就的孽。"
msgstr ""
"Este Dragón Rojo de hoy es la consecuencia de mis "
"acciones, producto de mis acciones del pasado."

#. Text for talk sentence 47 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "那，现在的那条红龙是……？"
msgstr ""
"Entonces, ¿Este Dragón Rojo con el que acabas de "
"luchar era...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 48 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "现在的红龙，就是三年前的母亲拼死保护的孩子。"
msgstr ""
"El Dragón Rojo que vistes hoy, es el hijo que su "
"madre que le dio su vida para protegerlo."

#. Text for talk sentence 49 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"它为了为母报仇，三年后便开始在幻想乡大肆破坏。"
msgstr ""
"Impulsado por la venganza, jura destruir todo "
"Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 50 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "我为了履行责任，才独自来到这里和红龙搏斗。"
msgstr ""
"Vine aquí para luchar sola contra el Dragón Rojo y "
"cumplir con la responsabilidad que una vez tuve."

#. Text for talk sentence 51 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"星，我离开命莲寺时，什么都没有对你们说，实在是抱"
"歉。"
msgstr ""
"Atormentado por las consecuencias de mis actos, me "
"marché sin decir palabra. Shou, lo siento "
"muchísimo por haberlo hecho."

#. Text for talk sentence 52 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"我曾想过告诉你们这一切的真相，但又怕这真相在公之于"
"众后，人们不相信我所说的话，命莲寺以及你们的声誉会"
"受到影响。"
msgstr ""
"Tenía miedo. Miedo de que el público no me "
"creyera. Miedo de que la reputación de nuestro "
"templo y de nuestros seguidores se viera "
"perjudicada."

#. Text for talk sentence 53 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid ""
"所以，那时的我才决定，我必须要亲手了结这件事情。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando volví a ver al Dragón Rojo, me prometí a mí "
"misma que debía acabar con esto con mis propias "
"manos."

#. Text for talk sentence 54 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "圣……"
msgstr "Hijiri..."

#. Text for talk sentence 55 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "这件事成为了我自己的心魔，纠缠了我整整三年。"
msgstr ""
"Durante tres años, me atormentó mi propia miseria. "
"Ya basta. Debo romper los lazos con el pasado."

#. Text for talk sentence 56 in talk group ship_8_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_8_map"
msgid "事到如今，已经不能再继续这样下去了。"
msgstr ""
"Hay que acabar con el flagelo del Dragón Rojo."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_9
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第9天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 9 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9"
msgid "实在是没想到，圣竟然经历过那样的事情……"
msgstr ""
"Jamás me habría imaginado que Hijiri estuviera "
"pasando por algo así..."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9"
msgid "先不管那些了，该战斗了。"
msgstr ""
"No... debo detenerme en eso ahora. Es hora de "
"seguir luchando."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9"
msgid ""
"前面好像出现了一种很壮的僵尸，还拿着锈蚀船锚。"
msgstr ""
"Veo algún zombi nuevo que parece bastante fuerte. "
"Llevando un ancla oxidada."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9"
msgid "他不会用那个玩意砸我的器械吧？"
msgstr ""
"No va a destrozar mis artilugios con eso, ¿cierto?"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_9's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9"
msgid "……那应该就是了。"
msgstr ""
"...Desafortunadamente, parece que ese será el caso."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_9_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第9天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 9 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_over"
msgid "闪亮亮！这是珠光宝塔！"
msgstr "¡Oh, qué brillante! ¡Es la Pagoda Enjoyada!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_over"
msgid "这东西怎么长得好像……我师傅的宝塔？"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué se parece tanto a... la pagoda de mi amo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_over"
msgid "当然，这是个仿制品！"
msgstr ""
"¡Por supuesto, es porque este es una réplica!"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_over"
msgid ""
"它能把一整行的空地禁用并变为黄金，暂时无法在上面放"
"置器械！"
msgstr ""
"¡Convierte las casillas vacías de toda una fila en "
"oro, y no podrás colocar nada sobre ellas!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_over"
msgid ""
"但是，每禁用一定数量的空地，它就会生成一个星之碎"
"片！"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, ¡Por cada pocas casillas "
"desactivadas, producirá un Fragmento Estelar!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_9_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_over"
msgid "把一切都点成黄金吧！"
msgstr "¡Convirtamos todo en oro!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_9_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第9天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 9 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "圣，我有些事情要说。"
msgstr ""
"Hijiri, hay algo que me gustaría comentar contigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "什么事情？"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid ""
"之前我们在圣辇船遇到了鵺，我们向她寻求帮助，但她却"
"十分冷漠。"
msgstr ""
"Anteriormente, nos topamos con Nue en el Barco "
"Palanquín. Intentamos pedirle ayuda, pero se "
"mostró indiferente hacia nosotros."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "甚至说我们做的这一切都没有任何意义！"
msgstr ""
"¡Incluso dijo que todo lo que hacemos no tiene "
"sentido!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "她怎么能这么说呢！"
msgstr "¿Cómo podría decir eso a sus compañeras?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "鵺吗？她的态度我也知情。"
msgstr ""
"¿Nue? Yo también he notado su actitud extraña."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "自从异变发生之后，她变得非常的恍惚与消极。"
msgstr ""
"Fue como si hubiera caído en trance desde que "
"ocurrió el incidente. Empezó a actuar aturdida y "
"confusa."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid ""
"不过，她会这样，其实我觉得她反而是有一些她自己的理"
"由的。"
msgstr ""
"Pero... tengo la sensación de que tiene una razón "
"para actuar de esa manera."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "也许，她是看到了我们看不到的什么东西吧。"
msgstr ""
"Quizás ella vio algo que nosotros no pudimos ver."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "是这样的吗……？"
msgstr "¿Será así...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid ""
"毕竟，她是一位和<color=red>认知</color>有关的妖怪。"
msgstr ""
"Después de todo, ella es el youkai de la "
"<color=red>cognición</color>."

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "……认知？"
msgstr "...¿Cognición?"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid ""
"没错，鵺能影响某物在别人眼中的外观与形象，也就是改"
"变别人对事物的<color=red>认知</color>。"
msgstr ""
"Así es. Nue puede afectar la apariencia de otros "
"objetos. En otras palabras, puede cambiar la "
"<color=red>cognición</color> de las personas."

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "认知……"
msgstr "Cognición..."

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "……！"
msgstr "...¡!"

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（等等，认知……！）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(¡Espera, cognición...!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（难道这场异变产生的原因，是那个东"
"西！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿La causa del incidente... podría ser "
"esa... cosa?)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（不对，怎么可能呢！幻想乡里怎么可能有"
"那种东西呢！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡No, eso es imposible! ¡No hay manera "
"de que algo así exista en Gensokyo!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，您怎么了？"
msgstr "Steve, ¿Se encuentra bien?"

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "没、没什么。"
msgstr "E-Estoy bien, gracias."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group ship_9_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_9_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_10
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第10天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 10 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid "经过数天与红龙的战斗，我的法力已经耗尽了。"
msgstr ""
"He gastado todo mi poder mágico en los días que "
"pasé luchando contra el Dragón Rojo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid "接下来我就无法继续战斗了。"
msgstr ""
"Tengo el temor que no pueda continuar luchando."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（连续战斗好几天吗，真的是超人……）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¿Cuántos días seguidos peleó? Es "
"realmente extraordinaria...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid ""
"那条红龙，虽说我有愧于它，但它确确实实为这里带来了"
"破坏和死亡。"
msgstr ""
"Aunque le fallé al joven Dragón Rojo, aun así "
"traje una catástrofe sin precedentes a esta tierra."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid ""
"情况不像它的母亲那样，因此我希望它能为这些破坏，以"
"及他人的性命付出真正的代价。"
msgstr ""
"La situación actual no se parece en nada a la de "
"su predecesora. Para enmendar todo el dolor y la "
"destrucción que ha causado, debe pagar el precio "
"máximo."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid "我见识到了您强大的力量，希望您能够同意。"
msgstr ""
"Te imploro que te unas a mi causa. He sido testigo "
"de tu increíble fuerza, sé que puedes acabar con "
"esto de una vez por todas."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid "要对付红龙吗……好吧，那就交给我了。"
msgstr ""
"¿Quieres que me encargue del Dragón Rojo?... De "
"acuerdo, lo haré."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_10's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10"
msgid "感激不尽。"
msgstr "De todo corazón, gracias."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_note
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "僵尸海盗地图"
msgstr "Mapa de Zombi Pirata"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_note"
msgid "这是什么？海盗地图？"
msgstr "¿Qué es esto? ¿Un mapa pirata?"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_note"
msgid ""
"是那些僵尸画的吧。目标地点好像就是红龙的巢穴。"
msgstr ""
"Parece que esos zombis dibujaron esto. Parece que "
"el final del camino es el nido del Dragón Rojo en "
"la montaña."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_note's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_note"
msgid ""
"不过如今那条红龙已经出山，这张地图也已经不需要了。"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, como ese dragón ya ha abandonado la "
"montaña, ya no necesitaremos este mapa."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_10_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第10天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 10 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "对了，白莲大人，我这次前来，其实有求于您。"
msgstr ""
"Ah, cierto. Señorita Byakuren, la razón por la que "
"me embarqué en esta misión era precisamente para "
"preguntarle algo."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid ""
"我帮神子大人解决了巨人的问题，她向我推荐了您，说您"
"可以帮我解决我的问题。"
msgstr ""
"Cuando ayudé a la Señorita Miko a resolver el "
"incidente del Gigante, ella me recomendó a ti, "
"alegando que podrías ayudarme a solucionar mi "
"problema."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "是什么问题呢？"
msgstr "Oh, ¿Cuál es el problema?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "我想知道我的父母到底是谁。"
msgstr "Yo deseo sabe quienes son mis padres."

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "原来是身世之谜吗。"
msgstr ""
"Ya veo... Tu deseo es descubrir el misterio sobre "
"tus orígenes."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid ""
"容我猜想一下，随你而来的这位村民，应该是您的养父？"
msgstr ""
"Si ese es el caso, ¿Estoy en lo cierto al suponer "
"que este aldeano que viaja contigo es tu padre "
"adoptivo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "是的。"
msgstr "Sí, estás de lo correcto."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "……有意思。"
msgstr "...Interesante."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid ""
"我明白了，等到红龙的事情得到解决，我会为您解惑。"
msgstr ""
"Comprendo tu situación. Cuando este incidente del "
"Dragón Rojo llegue a su fin, te ayudaré a resolver "
"tu misterio."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_10_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_10_map"
msgid "感、感谢白莲大人！"
msgstr "¡M-muchas gracias, Señorita Byakuren!"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_11
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第11天入场"
msgstr "Barco Día 11 Intro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid "那条龙马上就要来了。史蒂夫先生，做好准备。"
msgstr ""
"El Dragón Rojo se está aproximando. Señor Steve, "
"por favor, prepararte."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid "嗯。那条龙都会些什么？"
msgstr "Copiado. ¿Cuáles el arsenal del Dragón?"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid ""
"显而易见的——它会喷火，同时它巨大的翅膀也可以创造旋"
"风。"
msgstr ""
"Es más o menos lo que se imaginar, puede escupir "
"fuego y sus alas gigantes pueden crear fuertes "
"ráfagas de viento."

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid "那么你可要注意灭火了，邻居！"
msgstr ""
"¡Eso significa que es hora de apagar algunos "
"incendios, bomberito!"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid "呃，怎么灭？"
msgstr "Uh, ¿Cómo hago eso?"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid ""
"和以前一样，<color=red>用你的拳头捶它们</color>！"
msgstr ""
"¡Tal como siempre lo hacías, <color=red>aplástalos "
"con tus puños</color>!"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid "啊？"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid ""
"还有，在这场战斗中好好利用风吧！以及，信标可能也会"
"在某些情况下发挥作用！"
msgstr ""
"¡Aprovechemos este viento en el campo de batalla! "
"Además, ¡El Faro podría tener algunas utilidades "
"inesperadas en ciertas situaciones!"

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid "……我明白了。"
msgstr "...Entendido."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（天空中乌云密布，而我们的船上却阳光直"
"射。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Una legión de nubes grises envuelve "
"el cielo, pero el resplandor del sol brilla sobre "
"nuestro barco con una luminosidad inquebrantable)."
"</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_11's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那条孤龙的愤怒，也该在今天平息了。）"
"</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(El sufrimiento del dragón huérfano "
"terminará hoy).</color>"

#. Archive name for talk group ship_11_over
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第11天结束"
msgstr "Barco Día 11 Outro"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_over"
msgid "小心！那条龙把那艘船也砸下去了！抓稳！"
msgstr ""
"¡Cuidado! ¡El Dragón Rojo se está llevando el "
"barco consigo! ¡Agárrense fuerte!"

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_over"
msgid "好、好险！"
msgstr "C-Creí que estaba acabado"

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_over"
msgid "所有人都没事吧？"
msgstr "¿Están todos bien?"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_over"
msgid "看起来都没事。太好了！"
msgstr "A cielo, parece que todos están bien."

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_over"
msgid "那艘船也顺便被解决了，简直是一石二鸟！"
msgstr ""
"El Barco del End también ha sido eliminado. ¡Eso "
"sí que es matar dos pájaros de un tiro!"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_over"
msgid "非常感谢您的帮助，史蒂夫。"
msgstr "Gracias por toda tu ayuda, Steve."

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_11_over's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_over"
msgid "这红龙之灾终于结束了。"
msgstr ""
"La calamidad provocada por el Dragón Rojo "
"finalmente ha terminado."

#. Archive name for talk group ship_11_map
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "圣辇船第11天地图"
msgstr "Barco Día 11 Mapa"

#. Text for talk sentence 0 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "星，让船落地吧。"
msgstr "Shou, deja que el Barco Palanquín aterrice."

#. Text for talk sentence 1 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "我去超度那条龙。史蒂夫，也请您随我而来。"
msgstr ""
"Voy a dejar descansar a la alma del dragón, Steve, "
"por favor ven conmigo."

#. Text for talk sentence 2 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "明白。"
msgstr "Entendido"

#. Text for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（我们来到了红龙坠落的地方，这里就在人"
"类村落的不远处。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Estamos aquí donde cayó el Dragón "
"Rojo. No está lejos de la aldea humana).</color>"

#. Description for talk sentence 3 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "archive"
msgid "（白莲和史蒂夫来到了红龙坠落的地方）"
msgstr ""
"(Byakuren y Steve llegan a la parte donde el "
"Dragón Rojo cayó)"

#. Text for talk sentence 4 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（天上下起了雨，周围的人越来越多，他们"
"看着这头恶龙，和它保持着距离。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Cada vez más gente comenzó a reunirse "
"alrededor mientras la lluvia caía torrencialmente. "
"La gente no dejaba de mirar al dragón, pero "
"ninguno se atrevía a acercarse).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 5 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（它死不瞑目，身下是早已被从内到外压碎"
"的末地船。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Los ojos del Dragón Rojo aún miran "
"fijamente desde su cadáver, y todos los restos "
"destrozados de Barco del End yacen bajo él).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 6 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr "Amitabha."

#. Text for talk sentence 7 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "因与果，仇与怨，如今在此了结。"
msgstr ""
"Causa y efecto, odio y el resentimiento, todo ello "
"terminará hoy."

#. Text for talk sentence 8 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "且让这场雨洗净轮回，往生去罢。"
msgstr ""
"Deja que esta lluvia lave tu samsara, para que "
"puedas descansar en la otra vida."

#. Text for talk sentence 9 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "我此番便渡你上路。"
msgstr ""
"Que tu alma encuentre el camino hacia la paz."

#. Text for talk sentence 10 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（白莲大人上前，让巨龙合上了眼睛。）</"
"color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(La Señorita Byakuren camina hacia "
"delante, y cierra los ojos del Dragón Rojo).</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 11 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（那之后，红龙的身体慢慢地变成了尘土，"
"消散而去。）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(Luego de eso, el cuerpo del Dragón "
"Rojo lentamente se convierte en polvo, disipándose "
"en el aire).</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 12 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（……）</color>"
msgstr "<color=blue>(...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 13 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "<color=blue>（白莲大人转过了身来——）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(La Señorita Byakuren se da la "
"vuelta...)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 14 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "史蒂夫，您帮我解决了这件事情，不胜感激。"
msgstr ""
"Steve, me ayudaste a resolver este incidente. Por "
"ello, te estoy profundamente agradecido."

#. Text for talk sentence 15 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "这件物品，请您收下。"
msgstr "Me gastaría que tengas este artefacto."

#. Text for talk sentence 16 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"这是我仿照我的魔人经卷制作的仿制品，虽然魔力不及原"
"型，然而仍可助您一臂之力。"
msgstr ""
"Esta es una réplica de mi Pergamino del Sutra del "
"Hechicera. Aunque su magia no es tan poderosa como "
"la del original, estoy seguro de que aún puede "
"ayudarte."

#. Text for talk sentence 17 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "感谢。"
msgstr "Gracias, Señorita Byakuren."

#. Text for talk sentence 18 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"这三年内，我实在无法开口向大众解释发生了什么。"
msgstr ""
"Durante estos tres años, nunca fui capaz de "
"revelar a la gente lo que realmente sucedió."

#. Text for talk sentence 19 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "如今，是时候该让真相公之于众了。"
msgstr "Ahora es el momento de decir la verdad."

#. Text for talk sentence 20 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"我愧对红龙母子，但这也许会是目前最好的结果了。"
msgstr ""
"Le he fallado a la madre dragona y a su hijo, pero "
"quizás este sea el mejor final."

#. Text for talk sentence 21 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"好了。接下来，请让我就您身世的问题，帮您解惑吧。"
msgstr ""
"...Muy bien. A continuación, permítame resolver su "
"duda sobre tu origen y aclarar tu confusión."

#. Text for talk sentence 22 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"其实，我有一事相告。四年前，曾有一位访客来到命莲"
"寺。"
msgstr ""
"Tengo algo que debo contarte. Hace cuatro años, "
"hubo una visitante que vino al Templo Myouren."

#. Text for talk sentence 23 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "那位访客自称灯兰 樱，到访命莲寺有求于我。"
msgstr ""
"Esa visitante se hacía llamar Touran Sakura. Vino "
"al templo con una petición para mí."

#. Text for talk sentence 24 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "而那位访客此行的目的，正是解开一切的钥匙。"
msgstr ""
"El objetivo de su visita es la clave para desvelar "
"todos los secretos."

#. Text for talk sentence 25 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "……难道？"
msgstr "...¿Podría ser?"

#. Text for talk sentence 26 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "为了寻找自己失散多年的孩子。"
msgstr ""
"Ella vino para encontrar su hijo perdido hace "
"mucho tiempo."

#. Text for talk sentence 27 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "什、什么！"
msgstr "¿¡Q-Qué!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 28 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（寻、寻找失散多年的孩子……！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡P-Para encontrar a su hijo perdido "
"hace mucho tiempo...!)</color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 29 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"<color=blue>（难、难道那个人就是我的……！）</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color=blue>(¡P-Podría esa persona ser mi...)</"
"color>"

#. Text for talk sentence 30 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "那、那个人，如今还能再找到吗？"
msgstr ""
"¿E-Esa persona podría ser encontrada hoy en día?"

#. Text for talk sentence 31 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "茫茫人海中寻找一人，可非易事。"
msgstr ""
"Encontrar una aguja en un pajar no es tarea fácil."

#. Text for talk sentence 32 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "并且，在寻子无果后，那位访客再未出现过。"
msgstr ""
"Además, tras no encontrar a su hijo, aquella "
"visitante no volvió a aparecer."

#. Text for talk sentence 33 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "怎、怎么这样……"
msgstr "¿C-cómo podría ser...?"

#. Text for talk sentence 34 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "每次都……只差一点！"
msgstr ""
"¿Por qué será que siempre... se desvía un poquito "
"del objetivo?"

#. Text for talk sentence 35 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "只差一点吗？我看可未必。"
msgstr "¿Un poquito desviado? No lo creo."

#. Text for talk sentence 36 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "诶？"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. Text for talk sentence 37 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "这些年来的事情，我其实也有所耳闻。"
msgstr ""
"Me he enterado de los acontecimientos que han "
"ocurrido en los últimos años."

#. Text for talk sentence 38 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"您的身世定与这场异变的发生息息相关，那人兴许也能与"
"您再见上一面。"
msgstr ""
"Tu identidad y este incidente... sin duda están "
"estrechamente relacionados. Si esa persona es "
"pariente tuya, investigar los hechos podría "
"permitirte volver a verla."

#. Text for talk sentence 39 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"因此我确信，您找回自己身世的那一天，终究会在这幻想"
"乡内到来的。"
msgstr ""
"Es por eso que creo que el día en que recuperes tu "
"verdadera identidad, llegará finalmente a Gensokyo."

#. Text for talk sentence 40 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "真、真的吗！"
msgstr "¿¡T-tu crees eso!?"

#. Text for talk sentence 41 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid ""
"接下来，请您放下自己的执念，用自己的双眼见证吧。"
msgstr ""
"Pase lo que pase después, no te aferres a tu deseo "
"y podrás presenciar con tus propios ojos la "
"siguiente etapa de tu aventura."

#. Text for talk sentence 42 in talk group ship_11_map's section 0
#: Talk meta file
msgctxt "talk-mvz2:ship_11_map"
msgid "告辞了，祝您一路顺风。"
msgstr "Adiós, Steve. Te deseo un buen viaje."
